<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Iwomo</para>
  <para style="toc1">IWOMO iyi Wazilɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iwomo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iwo</para>
  <para style="mt1">IWOMO iyi Wazilɔ</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Oluku gba a ka kwokpo ungwu Iwomo iyi Wazilɔ le. Kwokpo kwɔlɛ kwu mbwalu kwokpo ungwu Oluku. A ka ngwu te kaa le so ewo iyi bɔkɔ wambwalu Ɔzhizɔsi umba kwonze umba bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e to mbo keyi, o ta anu iyi Iso Iyesheshi iyawu &lt;&lt;mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya lɛɛbi mbala Osamariya nzhii ba ilama iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ&gt;&gt; (1.8). Akwu ɛza iyi luzɛ undu Ɔkrasi imbwaluma undu lu lu gwu mbala enzu umba Azhu nzhii ba lu vyindɔ ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo imbwaluma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi. Ukama uwu kwokpo kwɔlɛ a kaa enzu umba o bo wa kwokpo kwɔlɛ lɛ ɛnwu ma tee Wambwalu Okrasi akwu agɛwa umba ɛzhi iyi Oromu mo, tee uzhi uwu Wambwalu Okrasi akwu inyɔlɔma iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo imbwaluma uwu Azhu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwokpo ungwu Iwomo iyi wazilɔ kwɔlɛ o kangwuma izhi ɛla: (1) Iyemo iyi luzɛ undu Wambwalu Okrasi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mizhikembo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yimo mu kwuvɔ; (2) ibulɔma iyi luzɛ ndɔlɛ nzhii ba mu Opaletanyi; mbala (3) ikyomo iyi ibulɔma iyi luzɛ ndɔlɛ nzhii ba mu ɛnzhi iyi Omediteraniya nzhii ba mu Oromu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwokpo kwɔlɛ ku siso meka iyi ɛduma Kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e fye mu wambwalu mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ ɔnuwu Ɔpɛtakɔ la ekpasu akwɛyi e le mu ɔshɔshi mbala watokeyi wu imbwama mbala ɛnwu ikama mu apula iyi bɔkɔ o ka lɛɛbi mu kwokpo kwɔlɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ilɔ iyi Wambwalu Okrasi umba kwonze mbala apula iyi i wo iyi bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi i zɔ ekpasu yi pepee mu luzɛ undu wambwalu mbamba mbala igyirima iyi ɔshɔshi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Mɛmi</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛnwu iyimo iyi anu itama (1.1-26)</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Ɔkpa umbwambwa uwu Ɔzhizɔsi mbala iso ishimɛzhi (1.1-14)</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Urikwunzu uwu Ozhudasi (1.15-26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Anu itama mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ (2.1—8.3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Anu itama mu Ozhudiya mbala Osamariya (8.4—12.25)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi Ɔpɔlu (13.1—28.31)</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Luzɛ undu anu itama undu kwonze (13.1—14.28)</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Igyirima mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. (15.1-35)</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Luzɛ undopo undu anu itama (15.36—18.22)</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Luzɛ undɔla undu anu itama (18.23—21.16)</para>
  <para style="io2">e. O ta Ɔpɔlu mu ugu mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, Osiseriya mbala Oromu (21.17—28.31)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Ɔtiyɔfilɔ, mu kwokpo mi ungwu kwonze, mi ka apula lɛɛbi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi e ye la iwomo mbala iyi a zɔ <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />nzhii ba kwɔfyi ungwu Ukpo e towu a kawa moshi. Ɛlɛ i wo mizhikembo iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo e shi wa zɛ ilɔ wu ekpasu kaa lo yi iyitu iyi apula iyi wa gyite lo yi yi. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Mizhikembo iyi lukwu wu a zɔ ɛnwu ma mbaa enzu mbɔlɛ la apula iwomo gyɔɔ iyi i zɔ te e yela kwunyɔ. E to afyi uwekpendo a zɔ ɛnwu munyi mbo la iso isomo mekeka iyi ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Ɔnu uwufo e yi mu kiya irimo mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu, akwɛyi e shi mbo ɛrama te: &lt;&lt; La lu lafya la Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mo, la lu rigbo la rɛshi ingyi Ada e so awu, iyi lu pwa munyi mi awu. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Ɔzhɔnu e wo obatisima mu embyi, afyi bwɛɛ iyi i yi mu inyɔma le o wo yi obatisima mu Kwundu uwu Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwundu Uwu Ukpo E To Ɔzhizɔsi A kawa Moshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Akwɛyi kwuyengwu wa zɛ ilɔ o kpala ɛlu, o yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, kwuye ngwɔlɛ ŋɔ ŋi gbala ɛsu iyi ɛzhi, ŋɔ shi Izirɛ re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te: &lt;&lt; Iyitu iyi kwuye mbala afyi iyi Ada Ɔsu Ukpo a zɔ mu idomo wu akwu iyayi mo. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Lunyi ba lu fya ekpasu kwuyengwu Kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye ma yi; Akwɛyi lu kwu azɔgɔ mi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, mbala munamuna mu Ozhudiya la Osamariya, nzhii ba mu imbwama iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa iso ɛlɛ isomo, akwɛyi Ukpo e to wu mo leyi mbo a kawa moshi, akwɛyi kwɔmu kwu nvye wu mo nzhii ba o ma wu fo.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Tabɔkɔ o bɔ eyi moshi akwɛyi enzu wepo o wɔ kporo mu ɛriga iruwu o ri mbala mba. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />O za mba te, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba Ogalili, kwuwongu kwuwongumbe lu ri munɛ lu yese moshi te? Ɔzhizɔsi ele, uwu o to wu yi mo o ka moshi ele, mate bɔkɔ lu ma wu a ka moshi awu, tatayi gba a gbama le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Ŋa Omatayasi Kaa La Ri Kunzu Ungwu Ozhuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Akwɛyi o yi mu lowa undu uwɛyi uwu Olivu o gba o kama mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, luzɛ undu lu ndama mo kyamate kwurizhi ungwu kwomelu kwukpɛnyi tayi. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Kwuye ungwu o kama, o ya mu ugu uwoshi mbaa bɔkɔ o kpo awu. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ gba akwu Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu mbala Ozhemisi mbala Anduru mbala Ofilipu mbala Otoma mbala Obatalomiwu mbala Omatiyu mbala Ozhemisi umɛ uwu Alufiyɔ mbala Ɔsamɔnu Ɔzilɔtu mbala Ozhuda umɛ uwu Ozhemisi <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Enzu lɛɛbi o koko o kpala ɛlu iyɔkpɔ o lɛ Ukpo, ikyo eko mbamba mbala Omeri anyi wu Ɔzhizɔsi mbala ɛmanyi wu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mu afyi ɛnyi Opita e yimo a rima meka iyi wa mbwalu oderi la uwo ekpepo a zɔ te, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />&lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, mɛga iso iyi Ukpo e so Odevidi mu Kwundu uwu Ukpo e nyɔlɔma mu reshi ingyi Ozhuda uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ ɔgwuzɛ uwu o yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Ozhuda uwu bɔkɔ o kyo wu o wama, moo o kyo o ŋa wu te le kyo nzu mu ɛduma ɛlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Eduwo iyi Ozhuda a fya mu ira iyi e wo awu, a ra yi o ya ɛzhi; mu riyi ngyɛngyi gba e ngye la reshi a kpa mɛzhi, ɛnwu wu i kpokpaa akwɛyi akɔ wu i fu kwudu le. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu e yi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o pwa kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki du Ozhuda le, inyi gba i shi o kpo kizɛ ngyɛngyi ɛnyi mu kenzu mbo te Akelidama, iluma yi akwu Ɛzhi iyi Ɛnzhii.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Akwɛyi Opita a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mo o ka yi ma mu Kwokpo ungwu Amwu te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">&lt;&lt; &lt;Kizɛ wu lakwu ɛrizhi; Onzu uwunawuna a ŋɔ mangyi mo,&gt; Onzu uwufo le to riyi wu ma.<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ i shoshi te lɔ ŋa onzu uwu e yi mbala nzu ngbaa kwuyengwu Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mbala nzu, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />ngba mu iyemo iyi obatisima uwu Ɔzhɔnu nzhii ba kwuyengwu o to Ɔzhizɔsi mo o kawa moshi. Mega onzu ele e kyo akwu u uzɔgɔ uwu iyimo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala nzu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Akwɛyi o wala ɛnyi iyi enzu wepo: Ɔzhɔsɛfu uwu o ya wu te Obasaba (o kyo o yi wu la ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhɔsitu) mbala Omatayasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Mizhikembo iyi o wala ɛnyi iyi enzu wepo mbamba akwɛyi wa zɛ ilɔ o lɛ Ukpo te, &lt;&lt;Ada, uŋɔ ŋɔ yi egbo iyi uwewe, zɔ nzu meka iyi enzu wepo mbɔlɛ onzu uwu ŋɔ ŋa <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />kaa le to ɛduma iyi wazilɔ ɛlɛ, iyi Ozhuda a lunyi afyima dɛ gba e kpomo le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Akwɛyi o fu mbo okuriya, akwɛyi Omatayasi e rimo akwɛyi o kyo wu mbala wa zɛ ilɔ wewo la ukpɛnyi mbamba.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ibomo Iyi Kwundu Uwu Ukpo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Bɔkɔ kwɔfyi ungwu Ɔpɛtakɔ inyi gba akwu afyi uwo ɛkpɛlɔ mizhikembo iyi odumudumu uwu ikalama kwu bo, wa mbwalu lɛɛbi ɔ kpala ɛlu mu riyi rikpɛnyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Akwɛyi kporo de ba anu iyɛku i le mu iwomo mate kwokpo ungwɔkwu tayi, kwu ngyi moshi kwu nyɔlɔ kwogba ungwu o yi mangwu awu. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />O ma apula iyi i yi mate ɛtunɛ iyi ɔyi tayi, i le mu ifulomo mu reshi ingyi uwewe mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Kpɛkpɛmba Kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye ma mba lɛɛbi akwɛyi o le mu lunzu ndowa isomo mate bɔkɔ Kwundu e shimbo ekpasu iyi isomo awu.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Kwuye kwɔngu pwa, enzu umba Izirɛ wa wuyi iyi Ukpo umba bɔkɔ ɔ wɔ mɛzhi ikikɔ ikikɔ iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi o yi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Bɔkɔ ɔ pwa anu ɛlɛ, akwɛyi enzu gyɔɔ o gyirima la kenzu iyama kwuwongu onzonzu a pwa mba te o siso mu kenzu wu. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Kwuwongwu izele izelembo mo akwɛyi o yo kwuyo te: &lt;&lt; Enzu lɛɛbi umba o yi mu iso isomo le akwu enzu umba Ogalili mo re? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ba iwo la bɔkɔ uwewe nzu a pwa mba te o so kenzu wu ŋa? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Mo ki kwu enzu umba Apatiya, umba Omediya mbala Ɛlamu; Umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu Omesopotamiya, Ozhudiya mbala Okapadosiya, Ɔpɔtu mbala Eshiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />enzu umba Afirigiya mbala umba Opafiliya, umba Izhipiti mbala kwuko ungwu Olibiya kɛlɛ mbala Ɔsarini; Agboga umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu Oromu <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />(ikyo Azhu mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, o fulowa o mbwalu ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo uwu Azhu) Enzu umba Okirita mbala Arabiya ki pwa mba te o tanu iyi apula iyi kenzu iyama iyi Ukpo e wo mu lunzu nzu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Ɛlɛ i shimbo kenzu iyama mbala izele, akwɛyi o yo esu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt; Iluma iyi ɛlɛ akwu kwuwongumbe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Umbafo, mba ba o wo mbo ɛnɛ o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;O wo atɛ gyɔɔ gba atɛ o yi mbo mo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opita E So Riba Ingyi Enzu Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Akwɛyi Opita mbala wewo la ukpɛnyi mbamba o yefa ɔ rima, akwɛyi Opita a ya opwu mo a za la riba ingyi enzu mbamba te: &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi Azhu mbala lunyi lɛɛbi umba lu yi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, la lu ngbɛ alu nɛrinɛri kaa lu pwa iso iyi mi so yi le. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Akwu atɛ gba ki wole mate lu so awu mo. Kwuye kekelele akwu ekerepe erendo iyi kwoto bɛnɛ! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Ɛlɛ gba akwu iso iyi anukenzu Ɔzhɔwɛlu esepo le te:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Ukpo a zɔ te, mu afyi iyi imbwama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Mi shi enzu lɛɛbi kwundu mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Ɛmɛ yi anzɔnu mbala eko o tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Akolobiya yi ba o ma ɛbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Enzu umbakɔ yi o wolo ondo.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ikyo ɛmɛgba mi, eko mbala anzɔnu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Mi shimbo Kwundu mi mu afyi ɛnyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">akwɛyi o tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Mi zɔ apula iyi kenzu iyama moshi kadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">mbala lɔzɔ mɛzhi kindo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">ɛnzhi mbala ɔyi mbala uwu kpakiri.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Ɔnu u fulowa akwu ipwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">ɔvya ba u vindɔ ɛnzhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">dɛshi inyɔma iyi kwɔfyi ungwɔkwu ungwu Ɔkwu kwu nyɔ.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Akwɛyi uwewe uwu bɔkɔ a ya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu o sa wu ma.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Enzu umba Izirɛ, la lu ngbɛ alu kaa lu pwa iso ɛlɛ: Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti akwu onzu uwu Ukpo a nyama la wu, uwu a lɔ wu la amɛ mbala apula iyi kenzu iyama mbala lɔzɔ iyi Ukpo e wo meka yi, iyi i zɛ mu kwuwo wu mate bɔkɔ lu yitu awu. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi ele Ukpo a lu wu afyima e shi yi mu iyitu iyi keyi wu mbala inyama wu; akwɛyi lu kpakyaa mbala enzu umba ira lu bɔ wu iba lu ngbɛ wu ma. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ukpo ba a gba la Ɔzhizɔsi iyimo mu kwuvɔ, a wawu ma mu inyashi iyi lukwu, kwongwu lukwu lu do wu irima mo. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Odevidi e so iso meka wu, a zɔ te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">&lt;&lt; &lt;Mi koko mi ma Ɔkwu mu keyi mi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Kwuwongwu e yi mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi mi awu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">mi wo idu kpu mo.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ mi yi ɔnyɛ, kenzu mi ka mu ɔnyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">ɛnwu lɛɛbi tete i yi ɛnwu igbomo mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">eyifulomo,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kwuwongu uŋɔ, Ɔkwu mi, ŋɔ lu mi afyima mu ogariwu mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">ŋɔ shimi, Ɔkɛrikɛri ŋɔ, ka la mi kpomo ka la mi vama mo.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Ŋɔ zɔ mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">ɛgwuzɛ iyi kwunyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">ŋɔ nyɔlɔ mi ma la ɔnyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">mu idu ŋɔ.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Akwɛyi Opita a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, Imi la mi so yi mu egbo ikpɛnyi te, usɔkwu nzu Odevidi e kpomo, o kpa wu ami, ogariwu wu e degbo a ŋɔ le te ɔnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Uwu ba akwu anukenzu awu, e yitu te Ukpo a vungɔma te uwu e fulo onzu uwu ɛdɔ wu mu ukpa uwu ɛsu wu <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Tabɔkɔ Odevidi a ma iyi i yi mu keyi, akwɛyi e so iso iyi iyimo iyi Okrasi, te Ukpo a lu wu afyima ka le kpomo la vuma mu ogariwu mo. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Ukpo e yi Ɔzhizɔsi ele mo lakwunyɔ; kinzu lɛɛbi ki ku azɔgɔ iyi ɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Tabɔkɔ o shiwu inzumbɛku iyi ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi ungwu Ukpo akwɛyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu Ada e so e shi mɛzhi te uwu e shi wu, e bo mawu; Kwundu uwu Ukpo awu gba Ukpo e shi enzu mbɔlɛ le mate lu ma lu pwa awu. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Odevidi a yama a ka mu oshi mo, ɔbulɛ a zɔ te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">&lt;&lt; &lt;Ukpo a za la Adakwogba mi, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwungyi mi <verse eid="ACT 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />nzhii ba mi wo agewa ŋa enye ŋɔ.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, ɛmɛ mba Izirɛ lɛɛbi lo yitu ngiri te: Ukpo e shi Ɔzhizɔsi ele uwu lu bɔ wu iba awu, te lakwu Ɔkwu mbala usama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Tabɔkɔ enzu o pwa iso ɛlɛ, i gwu mbo nzhii ba mu idu iyi anana akwɛyi o yo Opita mbala wa zɛ ilɔ umbafo mbamba te, &lt;&lt; Ɛmɛnɛ, ki wo te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Opita a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt; Uwewe yi la tamɛzhi ka lo wo wu obatisima mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi ka lu fya ɔpɛriri uwu ingbomo yi ma, akwɛyi lu na rɛshi ingyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Mo iso iyi o so o shi mɛzhi ele, akwu iyayi mbala ɛmɛ yi mbala enzu lɛɛbi umba o ndama mbala umba Ɔkwu nzu, Ukpo nzu a ba ya mba ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Mu opwu uwɔkwuu, Opita e so mbo iso gyɔɔ e tumbomo, akwɛyi a kpa mba ɛshɛku te, &lt;&lt;La lu sa ɛnwu yi ma mu ɔyi uwu ira ɔlɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ ɔ na rɛnu ingyi iso wu, o wo mbo obatisima. Enzu edubu ɛla gba o kyo riba ma mu uzhi uwu wa mbwalu mɔnu mawu le.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />O bɔ ɛmba ngiri o shɛmba kwuye mu ɛzɔ iyi wa zɛ ilɔ o zɔ mba ivɔngɔma mbala ɛlu ifumo mbala kiya irimo mbala Ukpo ilɛma kyaa.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iŋɔma Iyi Wambwalu Mbala Esu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Izele i yi uwewe mo kwuwongu amɛ mbala lɔzɔ undu amɛ undu bɔkɔ wa zɛ ilɔ o wo. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Wambwalu lɛɛbi o yi kyaa; kiya ingyinangyina ingyi uwewe e yi ngyi, o kama kyaa. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Umbafo o ya ɛzhi mba ma mbala ewulo iyi o yi yi akwɛyi o shi onzu uwunawuna uwu e yi ugɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />O kpakpɛ kwɔfyi kwɔfyi mu ɛlu ifumo kyaa mu ɔdida uwu ɔtɛpu. O ri kiya kyaa mu agba iyi esu la ɔnyɛ imwuma mbala egbo ikpɛnyi, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />la Ukpo iduma mbala ɔnyɛ imwuma uwu inzumbeshi ifyama mba enzu lɛɛbi. Kwɔfyi kwɔfyi Ukpo e kyo riba ingyi enzu umba o sa mba ma.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">O Bo Onzu U Nda Kwoya U Mu Alɛ Ma Ofya Ma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Ɔnu uwufo Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu o sheye mu ɔtɛpu mu kwuyengwu Ukpo ilɛma mu ekerepe ela iyi ɔnɔnda. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Onzu uwufo uwu e yi ofya umbu kpokapiya o koko o shi wu mu kenzugwu unga ɔtɛpu mbaa kwoya indama mbaa enzu umba o sheye mu ɔtɛpu. Kenzugwu kanga o ya nga te kenzugwu unga woshi. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Tabɔkɔ a ma Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu te o ŋɔ fye mu ɔtɛpu akwɛyi a nda mba eduwo. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu o bɔ wu eyi shii akwɛyi Opita a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Yese nzu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Akwɛyi onzu ele a bɔ mba eyi shii, a ma te a fya kiya mu ewo mbo ŋa.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Akwɛyi Opita a za wu te, &lt;&lt; Imi mi yi kwosiliva mo, mi yi kwogolu mo, ingyi mi yi ngyi gba mi shi ŋɔ le. Mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu Ɔnazarɛti, yimo kaa zɛma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Akwɛyi e yi wu mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi wu e yi wu mo a rima, mɔmɔɔmɔ ata wu mbala epunu iyi alɛ wu indama. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />A la kuzhoto akwɛyi e le mu luzɛ. Akwɛyi a mbwalu mba mu ɔtɛpu la luzɛ mbala kuzhoto ilama mbala Ukpo iduma. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Tabɔkɔ enzu lɛɛbi o ma wu mu luzɛ la Ukpo iduma, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />o zɔngɔma wu ma te uwu gba e koko a ŋɔ mu kenzugwu unga ɔtɛpu unga o ya nga te kenzugwu unga woshi umba kwoya indama awu le, akwɛyi izele i wombo mo la kenzu iyama meka iyi kiya ingyi ki wo onzu ele.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opita E So Iso Mu Ɔtɛpu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Tabɔkɔ u nda kwoya ele a ki Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu ma kpakiri, akwɛyi izele i yi enzu mo lɛɛbi akwɛyi o fye mu ɛnya irima o gba mu Okepe uwu Ɔsɔlɔmɔnu mbaa bɔkɔ Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu o yi le. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />kwuyengwu Opita a ma ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a za mba te: &lt;&lt; Lunyi enzu umba Izirɛ, kwuwongu kwuwongumbe bɔkɔ ɛlɛ i shi yi izele te? Kimbe ki shi lu bɔ nzu eyi mate akwu mu ekpasu nzu mbala ɛsɛsɛ nzu gba ki shi onzu ele a zɛma le? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Ukpo uwu Aburamu mbala Aziki mbala Ɔzhɛkɔpu, Ukpo uwu asɔkwu nzu e shi umɛgba wu Ɔzhizɔsi inzumbɛku. Lunyi ba lu rawu lu shi te lɔ ngbɛ wu ma, lu towu mo mu idu iyi Opayileti kwuyengwu a gyite la lu wu afyima. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Lu towo Onzu Ɔkɛrikɛri mbala Onzu uwu Ototo mo akwɛyi lu zɔ te akwu onzu uwura, u ngbɛ enzu awu gba lu lu wu afyima le. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Lu ngbɛ ɔkwu uwu kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ ma, Ukpo ba a gbawa la iyimo mu kwuvɔ. Kinzu ki kwu azɔgɔ iyi ɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Akwu ikwu idu fulo mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi gba onzu ele uwu lu yi wu, lu yewu mu imama gba a fya ekpasu le. Akwu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala ikwu idu lu fulo mawu gba i shi ofya umbu onzu ele u bomo le kaa lunyi lɛɛbi la lu ma.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />&lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, mi yitu te iyi lu wo awu, lu wo mu iyitumo, mate atekeyi yi o wo awu tete. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ɛlɛ gba ba akwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo a nyɔlɔ iso iyi anukenzu lɛɛbi bɔkɔ o so te Okrasi a ma inyashi. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Kuwo kwɔngu la lu ta mɛzhi, la lu mbwalu Ukpo kaa lɔ gbɔ yi ingbomo yi ma, Ukpo le shi yi ɛnwu igbomo, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />akwɛyi a lɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasti, uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa wu kwuwo yi awu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Mɛga Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔ moshi nzhii ba kwuyengwu Ukpo e shi te aa gba la iyinayina inɔngɔma, mate bɔkɔ anukenzu wu o so mekyi awu. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Mo Omosisi a zɔ te, &lt;Ɔkwu Ukpo a wa la anukenzu mate Imi te meka iyi enzu yi; la lu pwa iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ e so yi. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu a pwa iso iyi anukenzu awu mo, o luwuma mu enzu umba Ukpo akwɛyi o ngbɛ wu ma.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />&lt;&lt;Anukenzu lɛɛbi, i na mu Ɔsamuwɛ nzhii ba umba bɔkɔ o bo mizhikembo wu, kpɛkpɛ mba o siso meka iyi kwuye kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Lunyi lu kwu ɛmɛ umba anukenzu mbɔlɛ mbala wa ri ogu uwu iso iyi Ukpo bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi mbala umba eteyi. A za la Aburamu te, &lt;Mu ɛdɔ ŋɔ, enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi ɔ fya esheshi ma.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />kwuyengwu Ukpo e yi umɛgba wu ma mu kwuvɔ, a lɔ wu mba yi keyi ka la mbwa yi ma ka uwewe la lafya la ɔgwuzɛ uwu ira.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Udaba Uwu Watokeyi Umba Azhu A Lɔ Laa Opita Mbala Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Tabɔkɔ Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu o yi mu enzu iso isomo, akwɛyi ebwoshi umba Ukpo mbala u to keyi uwu wa gbo Ɔtɛpu mbala Asadusi o bo. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Egbo iyi enzu mbɔlɛ itutumo gyɔɔ kwuwongu wa zɛ ilɔ o yi mu enzu ɛzɔ izɔma te, Ɔzhizɔsi e yimo mu kwuvɔ inyi gba i zɔ te, onzu uwu e kpomo a gba la iyimo. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />O yi Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu ma akwɛyi o fu mbo mu ugu ugyi nzhii ba eyi ilama kwuwongu akwu mu onoyo. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Tetete enzu gyɔɔ umba o pwa iso ɛnyi, o na yi ma akwɛyi riba ingyi wa mbwalu ri kyomo ri ka mu enzu edubu ɛlɔ.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Bɔkɔ eyi i lama akwɛyi watekeyi mbala enzumbakɔ mbala wazɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi o kpala ɛlu mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Anasi, obwoshi uwakɔ e yi mɔmɔ ikyo mbala Okayafasi mbala Ɔzhɔnu mbala Alɛkizanda mbala enzu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi obwoshi uwakɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />O wala Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu kwudu akwɛyi o lo mbo meka, akwɛyi o fye mbo mu eyo iyomo te: &lt;&lt;Uwe e shi yi ekpasu, naa mɛnyi iyi uwe bɔkɔ lu wo ɛlɛ le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Akwɛyi Opita, uwu a nyɔlɔma mu Kwundu uwu Ukpo, a za mba te: &lt;&lt;Lunyi watekeyi mbala enzu umbakɔ! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Gba iyama iyi lu ya nzu ɔnɛ le akwu kwuwongu esheshi iyi Ukpo e wo la onzu Ukpokapiya ele, gba lu yo nzu te i wo la bɔkɔ ofya wu u bomo le, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />ki gyi te lunyi mbala enzu umba Izirɛ lɛɛbi la lu yitu te: A kwu mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu Ɔnazarɛti, uwu lu bɔ wu iba, uwu Ukpo e yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ awu gba onzu ele uwu a ri mu idu yi ele o bo wu ofya ma le. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">&lt;&lt; &lt;Kwoki ungwu lunyi wambo igwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">lu to ngwu mo le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">ungwu gba akwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">kwoki ungwu ɔla le.<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Mɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi kɛɛkyi gba oo fya isama le, moo i yi ɛnyi iyifo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a sa enzu ma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Bɔkɔ o ma te Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu o yi iyi mo, ikyo o dayima te o wa ɛzu mo, akwu atalaka bi, akwɛyi i shi mbo kenzu iyama gyɔɔ. O bo o zɔngɔma te enzu mbɔlɛ o gɔ mbala Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />O siso kego mo kwuwongu onzu uwu o bo wu ofya ma awu a ri mbala mba mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Akwɛyi o za Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu te lɔ wɔ kwudu mu ɛlu ikpalama iyi wa to keyi umba Azhu akwɛyi o ta amasa mbala esu. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Akwɛyi o ya esu mo o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Enzu mbɔlɛ ki wo mbo te?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt; Kwuwongwu onzu uwunawuna mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ e yitu te enzu mbɔlɛ o wo amɛ iyɛku iyi ki domo te ki zɔ kwu zɔ yi mo. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Gba ki gyi te kiya ngyɛlɛ la ki fulama mba enzu mo, de ba la ki lo mbo iyi te lo so onzu uwunawuna iso gbee mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi fo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Akwɛyi o gba mba la iyama mɛmi akwɛyi o shi mbo ɛrama te lo so iso mo ba lo zɔ ɛzu mu ɛnyi Ɔzhizɔsi gbee fo. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu ba o gba opwu o za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu zɔ mafyi yi, iyina ishika, la ki mbwalu iyi Ukpo na iyayi ŋa? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kinzu ki do te ki lafya la iso isomo mu kiya ingyi ki ma ba ki pwa mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Mizhikembo iyi wa to keyi umba Azhu o lo mbo iyi akwɛyi o lu mba afyima, o fya kwuyi ungwu o kpamba ɛmu mo, mo enzu lɛɛbi o ŋɔ mu Ukpo iduma kwuwongu kiya ingyi ki wo. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Onzu uwu o wo apula iyi amɛ bɔkɔ o bo wu ofya le e yi lɔri undu lu pika lɔri uwekpendo ma.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wambwalu O Lɛ Ukpo Kaa Lo Fya Ekpasu Iyi Iso Isomo Gedegede.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bɔkɔ ɔ lu mba afyima, akwɛyi Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu o gbama o ka mba wa mbwalu o ko so lɛɛbi iyi kiya ingyi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ umba kwuse o so mbo. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Tabɔkɔ wa mbwalu o pwa iso ɛlɛ akwɛyi o ta kpaa mu Ukpo ilɛma. O zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu uwu idomo,&gt;&gt; uŋɔ gba ŋɔ wo oshi mbala ɛzhi mbala risu, mbala apula iyi i yi mayi lɛɛbi le. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo e siso mu kenzu unga umɛgba ŋa ete nzu Odevidi te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">&lt;&lt; &lt;Kimbe ki shi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Izirɛ mo o wo amba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">akwɛyi o bi egbo iyi umbwa te?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">o kpa kyaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">ikyo watekeyi o fu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">ɛlu kyaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">akwu agewa umba Ada Ɔsu Ukpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ɛrɔdu mbala Ɔpɔtiyɔ Opayileti o kpa kyaa mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Izirɛ mo mbala ɛmɛ umba Izirɛ umba kwuse kwɔlɛ, o ri utu uwu umɛ ŋɔ Ɔkɛrikɛri Ɔzhizɔsi uwu ŋɔ ŋa awu. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />O wo kiya ingyi ekpasu ŋɔ mbala igyima ŋa i gyi te la i wo diridiri awu. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Kekelele, Ada Ɔsu Ukpo, yese iyi ilomo mbo kaa shi ɛmɛgba ŋa lo wuyi iyi isisomo ŋɔ mo. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Nda kwuwo ŋɔ kaa bo enzu efya ma, kaa zɔ lɔzɔ undu amɛ mbala apula iyi izele mu ɛnyi iyi umɛgba ŋa ɔkɛrikɛri Ɔzhizɔsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Mizhikembo iyi o mbwa Ukpo ilɛma ma, riyi ingyi o kpala ɛlu awu ri wo akpa. Akwɛyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo e shi mbo ekpasu kpɛkpɛmba akwɛyi o so iso iyi Ukpo gedegede.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa mbwalu O Ka Apula Iyi O Yiyi Mbala Esu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Wa mbwalu lɛɛbi o yi egbo ikpɛnyi mbala amasa ikpɛnyi. Onzu uwunawuna uwu e yi kiya a zɔ te kiya ngyɛngyi akwu ingya wu kɛɛkyi mo. O ka kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ o yi ngyi kyaa. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Wa zɛ ilɔ o kpa kpɛɛ mu anu itama iyi iyimo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mu kwuvɔ la ekpasu iyɛku, akwɛyi Ukpo e shimbo esheshi wu gyɔɔ lɛɛbi. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />O yi enzu umba o yi igɔ meka mba mo kwuwongu, kwuye ungufo enzu umba o yi itu mbala agba o ya yi ma o bo la eduwo <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />akwɛyi o ka yi la eduwo ɛnyi la wa zɛ ilɔ kaa lɔ ka yi ma la enzu umba o yi igɔ.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Akwɛyi onzu uwu o ya wu te Ɔzhɔsɛfu, uwu a wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Olevi mu Ɔsapurɔ, uwu bɔkɔ Wa zɛ ilɔ o kpo wu ɛnyi te Obanaba (iyi o lunyi te Umɛ u ka enzu ɛnwu ma awu), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />a ya utu wu ma akwɛyi e bo la eduwo mu idu iyi wa zɛ ilɔ.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ananiya Mbala Osafira.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Onzu uwufo uwu o ya wu te Ananayasi mbala oko wu, Osafira, umba tete o ya kizɛ mba ingyifo ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Mu nyama iyi oko wu akwɛyi eduwo a gyi yi ma e she la ɛnwu akwɛyi e to iyi bɔkɔ ishimo a ka la Wa zɛ ilɔ.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Akwɛyi Opita a za wu te &lt;&lt;Ananayasi, ŋɔ wo la bɔkɔ ŋɔ nyama onzu uwoyi a nyɔlɔ ŋɔ egbo mo bɔkɔ ŋɔ kyoro Kwundu uwu Ukpo ma akwɛyi ŋɔ shi eduwo iyifo mo la ɛŋɔ meka iyi eduwo iyi ŋɔ ya ɛzhi ma ŋa? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Kizɛ ngyɛngyi akwu ingya ŋa gba ŋɔ ya ngyi ma le mo re? Bɔkɔ ŋɔ ya ngyi ma awu, eduwo akwu iyaŋa mo re? Kimbe ki shi ŋɔ bi egbo iyi kiya ngyɛlɛ te iwomo? Ukpo gba ŋɔ kyoro wu mo le, mo akwu onzu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Tabɔkɔ Ananayasi a pwa iso ɛlɛ, akwɛyi e lo wɔrɔ mɛzhi akwɛyi e kpomo. Enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ ɔ pwa kiya ingyi ki wole, iyi iyɛku i wombo mo. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Akwɛyi abulɛgɔ alugbaga o bo to ukpɛzhi ma, o wuwu mo, akwɛyi o to wu o kawa kwudu o ko kpa wu ami. <verse eid="ACT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Mizhikembo iyi awa ɛla akwɛyi oko wu Osafira e ngyi; e yitu kiya ingyi ki wo ɔnu wu mo. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Opita e yo wu te, &lt;&lt; So mi, ɛlɛ gba akwu abwa iyi kizɛ ingyi uŋɔ mbala ɔnu ŋɔ lu ya ngyi ma le?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">A zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ee eduwo ngyi gba i ŋawu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Akwɛyi Opita a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Lu wo la ba lu nyama kaa lu pwa Kwundu uwu Ukpo ma te? Yese! Enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpa ɔnu ŋɔ ami awu ɔ ŋɔ le mu kenzugwu; uŋɔ tete abulɛgɔ o to ŋɔ oo wa ŋa kwudu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Mɔmɔɔmɔ e lo wɔrɔ mɛzhi mu idu iyi Opita e kpomo. Akwɛyi abulɛgɔ mbɔlɛ bɔkɔ o fyemo o du wu ukpɛzhi, o to wu o kawakwudu akwɛyi o pwuwu mo kɛlɛ mbala ɔnu wu. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Iyi iyɛku i yi wa mbwalu lɛɛbi ma mbala enzu umba o pwa apula iyi i wo le.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa zɛ ilɔ O Wo Apula Gyɔɔ Iyi Izele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Wa zɛ ilɔ o wo apula iyi amɛ mbala iyi izele gyɔɔ mba enzu. Wambwalu lɛɛbi o koko o kpala ɛlu mu ɔtɛpu uwu e yi mu okepe uwu Ɔsɔlɔmɔ awu. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Enzu gyɔɔ umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu mo o wuyi iyi ikyo mbala Wa zɛ ilɔ , tetete Wa zɛ ilɔ o yi igba mu eyi mbo. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Tetete eko mbala anzɔnu gyɔɔ o nyama o mbwalu Ɔkwu akwɛyi riba ingyi wa mbwalu ri kyomo. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Kwuwongwu apula iyi wa zɛ ilɔ o wo, enzu o bo la enzu umba efya o shi mbo mu ɛkyɔ, o shi mbo mu ɛgwuzɛ kaa gba Opita a kaka, kwundu wu kwu zɛ ma mba kaa kwu bo mbo enzu efya ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Enzu gyɔɔ umba o wɔ mu ese ɛkɛlɛkɛlɛ mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o bo la enzu umba efya mbala umba o yi ɛndu iyira akwɛyi kpɛkpɛ mba efya mba i bomo.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Watokeyi Umba Azhu O Lo Wa zɛ ilɔ Inyashi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Akwɛyi obwoshi uwakɔ mbala enzu wu lɛɛbi umba o yi mu odudu uwu Asadusi o wo rise ingyi Wa zɛ ilɔ . <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />O yi Wa zɛ ilɔ ma akwɛyi o fu mbo mu ugu ugyi. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Mutu ɔnwu ba ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a wu ikwu iyi ugu ugyi awu ma akwɛyi a wala wa zɛ ilɔ kwudu. <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a za mba te &lt;&lt;La lu so mu ɔtɛpu kaa lu so enzu iso iyi kwunyɔ ungwepo ngwɔlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Tabɔkɔ eyi i lama, akwɛyi o fye mu ɔtɛpu, o kwo mu enzu ɛzu izɔma mate bɔkɔ Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo e so mbo awu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Kwuye ungwu obwoshi uwakɔ mbala enzu wu o bo mo, o ya odudu uwu wa to keyi umba Azhu mbala Wa to keyi umba Izirɛ ma lɛɛbi. Akwɛyi o lɔma o ka mu Ugugyi te lo so lo ngyela Wa zɛ ilɔ mbamba kaa lo yo mbo eyo. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Tabɔkɔ adakari umba o lɔ mba ma o kama, o du wa zɛ ilɔ mbamba mu ugu ugyi mo. Akwɛyi o gba o kama o ko fu oga te, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Ki ka ki du Ugugyi te o lowu mo la wa gbomo te o rima mu lunzugu mu igbomo. Tabɔkɔ ki wu riku mo, ki du onzu ukpukpɛnyi te mɛmi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Tabɔkɔ u to keyi uwu wagbomo umba ɔtɛpu mbala u to keyi uwu ebwoshi o pwa ɛlɛ, amasa mba ikpashaa akwɛyi o le mu egbo ibyima iyi i bi nyɔ mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Akwɛyi onzu uwufo e bo a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu yese! Enzu umba lu fu mbo mu ugu ugyi awu ɔ ri mu Ɔtɛpu mu enzu ɛzu izɔma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Tabɔkɔ ɔ pwa ɛlɛ, u to keyi uwu wagbomo mbala enzu wu o ko ngye la Wa zɛ ilɔ mbamba. Ɔ kpa mba mɛga mo kwuwongu o wiyi te enzu o bo kpamba ekyi.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Tabɔkɔ o bo mbo mo, o shi mbo o rima mu idu iyi wa to keyi umba Azhu kaa obwoshi uwakɔ le yo mbo eyo. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />A za mba te &lt;&lt;Ki shi yi ɛrama te la lu zɔ ɛzu mu ɛnyi ɛlɛ fo,&gt;&gt; lunyi ba lu pwa iso nzu mo, lu fula Ɔzhɛrusalɛ ma lɛɛbi mbala iso iyi onzu ele. Lu gyite enzu lɔ ma ungwoyi nzu meka iyi lukwu undu onzu ele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Akwɛyi Opita mbala wa zɛ ilɔ umbafo o gba opwu te: &lt;&lt;Ukpo gba akwu mɛga kaa la ki pwa iya wu le, akwu onzu mo! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Ukpo uwu asɔkwu nzu e yi Ɔzhizɔsi ma mu lukwu, uwu bɔkɔ lu sa wu karende mu kwuwɛyi ngwu lukwu akwɛyi lu ngbɛ wu ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Ukpo e shi Ɔzhizɔsi inzumbɛku kaa la ŋɔma mu kwuwo ngwungyi wu te akwu umɛ uwu ɔsu mbala Usama, kaa le shi Izirɛ lo kwu ira ɔsu kaa lo fya igbɔma iyi ingbomo mbo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Kinzu ki kwu azɔgɔ iyi apula ɛlɛ, ikyo Kwundu uwu Ukpo tete, iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu iso wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Tabɔkɔ odudu uwakɔ uwu wa to keyi umba Azhu o pwa ɛlɛ, amba o wombo mo akwɛyi ɔ gyite lɔ ngbɛ wa zɛ ilɔ ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Akwɛyi Ofarisi uwufo uwu o ya wu te Ɔgamaliyɛ, u zɔ ɛzu iyi ɛrama iyi Omosisi, uwu enzu lɛɛbi o lowu mo awu, e yimo a rima mu idu iyi odudu uwu wa to keyi umba Azhu akwɛyi a zɔ te lo wala wa zɛ ilɔ mbamba kwudu kaa lo shimbo kwuye bwɛɛ dɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Akwɛyi a za la odudu uwakɔ uwu wa to keyi umba Azhu te: &lt;&lt; Enzu umba Izirɛ, la lu ngbɛndu mu kiya ingyi lu gyite la lu wo enzu mbɔlɛ le. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Mu afyi iyi kembo Otewudasi a wɔ, e to ɛnwu te akwu kiya, enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu wu o yi ederi endo mo. Bɔkɔ ɔ ngbɛ wu ma enzu umba o mbwalu wu lɛɛbi o rima akwɛyi ɔ pwa akpa mba fo. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Mizhikembo wu, Ozhuda uwu Ogalili a wɔ tete mu afyi iyi enzu iwama.Uwu akwu u to keyi uwu enzu umba o wo ovyo mbala watekeyi. Uwu tete o ngbɛ wu ma akwɛyi enzu umba ɔ mbwalu wu lɛɛbi ɔ kpashaa. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ mu iso ɛlɛ, Imi mi ta yi amasa te: La lu shi enzu mbɔlɛ bi! La lu lu mba afyima lo sheyimo! Mo gba iwomo iyamba ɛlɛ a kwiyi onzu, i shirimo mewo. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ishi gba i ngyi mba Ukpo, lu do te lu nyi enzu mbɔlɛ ma mo; de ba lu ŋu kiri ewa mbala Ukpo!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">wa to keyi mbamba o nyama la iso iyi Ɔgamaliyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />O ya wa zɛ ilɔ ma akwɛyi ɔ kpa mba ikpa. O shi mbo ɛrama te lo so iso mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi fo akwɛyi o lu mba afyima ɔ ka ma.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Wa zɛ ilɔ o lafya la odudu uwakɔ uwu wa to keyi umba Azhu, la ɔnyɛ imuma te umba Ukpo kyo o wamba tete mu inyashi imama kwuwongu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Kwɔfyi kwɔfyi wa zɛ ilɔ o kpakpɛ mu ɛzu izɔma mbala anu itama iyi ɛza iyesheshi mu ɔtɛpu mbala agba agba te Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu usama le.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">O Ŋa Enzu Werewo Kaa Lo Mbwama Mu Ɛduma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu riba ingyi wa mbwalu ri kwo mu ikyomo. Akwɛyi Azhu umba bɔkɔ o so kenzu unga Ogiriki o le mu anu izɔma mu reshi ingyi Azhu umba bɔkɔ o so kenzu unga Iburu. O za anu te eko wakpanuma ma umba Ogiriki o wo mbo iwomo kwuyengwu ewiri ikama. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, wa zɛ ilɔ wewo la wepo mbɔlɛ o kpala wambwulu lɛɛbi ɛlu akwɛyi o za mba te &lt;&lt; I sheshi te ki lafya la anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo kaa la ki wo ɛduma iyi ewiri ikama mo. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, la lu ŋa enzu werewo umba ilukwu umba bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi mbala mba akwɛyi ki shi mbo ɛduma iyi ewiri ikama. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />akwɛyi ki shi kwuye nzu mu Ukpo ilɛma mbala anu itama iyi rɛnu ingyi Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Amasa ɛlɛ i fye enzu lɛɛbi ma, akwɛyi o ŋa Ositivi uwu e yi ikwu idu lu fulo mbala Kwundu uwu Ukpo , ikyo Ofilipu mbala Oporokorusi mbala Onikano mbala Otimo mbala Ɔpamɛnasi mbala Onikolasi uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ mu Atiyɔki, uwu ba akwu u mbwalu Ukpo uwu Azhu. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Wambalu o ka la enzu mbɔlɛ mba wa zɛ ilɔ umba Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi o fulo mbo ewo reshi, o lɛ Ukpo.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Akwɛyi iso iyi Ukpo i le mu iyama. Riba ingyi wa mbwalu mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ ri kwo mu ikyomo gyɔɔ akwɛyi ebwoshi umba Ukpo o nya la ikwu idu lu fulo.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Yi Ositivi Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Ukpo e shi Ositivi Esheshi gyɔɔ mbala ekpasu iyɛkwu iyi ɛduma iwomo akwɛyi e wo apula iyi izele mbala amɛ gyɔɔ mba enzu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Akwɛyi agewa wu o wɔ mɛmi iyi enzu umba odudu uwu Udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu uwu enye umba Ekyi (mo tayi gba o ya mba le.) Enzu mbɔlɛ akwu Azhu umba Osarini mbala Alɛkizandariya ikyo mbala ɛzhi iyi Osilisiya mbala Eshiya o le mu kambwu irimo mbala Ositivi. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Kwuwongwu ilukwu mbala Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi mbala Ositivi, umba ba ɔ fawa la ibyima.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Akwɛyi o lo enzu umbafo mu ubwu kyokyo ka lɔ zɔ te, &lt;&lt; Kinzu ki pwa Ositivi e so iso iyi ɔya mu reshi ingyi Omosisi mbala Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />O shi egbo iyi enzu lɛɛbi, ikyo watekeyi mbala wazɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi i yimo. O yi Ositivi o ka wu mu udaba uwakɔ uwu wa to keyi umba Azhu. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />O wa la azɔgɔ umba angba akwɛyi o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele e so iso iyi ira iyɔkpɔɔ mekeka iyi Ɔtɛpu ele mbala ɛrama iyi Omosisi.<verse eid="ACT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Ki pwa wu a zɔ te Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti ele e shiri Ɔtɛpu ele ma akwɛyi a ŋanga ukwu uwu Omosisi e shi nzu awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Kpɛkpɛ mba umba o ŋɔ mu odudu uwakɔ uwu wa to keyi umba Azhu awu o bɔ Ositivi eyi shii akwɛyi o ma ureyi wu u lemo u yi mate uwu ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo tayi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Iso Iyi Ositivi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Akwɛyi obwoshi uwakɔ e yo Ositivi te &lt;&lt; Iso iyi o so mu reshi ŋɔ lɛɛbi le te gba i yi le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Akwɛyi Ositivi a gba opwu tee: &lt;&lt; Ɛmɛnɛ mi mbala umba ada mi, la lu ngbɛ alu kaa lu pwa! Ukpo uwakwu a zɔ ɛnwu ma la ete nzu Aburamu kwuye ungwu e degbo mu Omesopotamiya dɛ gba a ba ka mu Ara le. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Ukpo a za wu te, &lt;Lafya la ɛzhi ŋɔ mbala enzu ŋɔ kaa so mu ɛzhi iyi mi ŋi zɔ ŋɔ le.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />&lt;&lt; Akwɛyi Aburamu a lafya la ɛzhi iyi Ashadiya a ka ŋɔ mu ɛzhi iyi Ara. Mizhikembo iyi lukwu undu ete wu, akwɛyi Ukpo a za wu te laba ŋɔ mu ɛzhi ɛlɛ iyi lu yi ma yi ele. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Ukpo e shi wu ogu munɛ mo, kizɛ kɛkyi te lala e shi wu mo. Tetete, Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi te uwu mbala ɛdɔ wu iyi izhikembo wu e shimbo ɛzhi ɛlɛ akwu iyamba; kwuye kwɔngu bɔkɔ Ukpo e so ɛlɛ Aburamu e de yi umɛ mo. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Ukpo a za la Aburamu te, &lt; Ɛdɔ ŋɔ aakwu agboga mu ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyamba mo, oo kwu enye, o lo mbo inyashi iyi lɔri ederi endo. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />akwɛyi Ukpo a zɔ te, ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ ɛmɛ umba izirɛ o gbo rinye awu, uwu e loyi inyashi,&gt; &lt;Akwɛyi mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, o wɔma mu ɛzhi ɛnyi o nyɔ oo gbo mi ɔya mu kizɛ ngyɛlɛ.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Akwɛyi Ukpo a za la Aburamu te le koko la zɛ ɛmɛ anzɔnu ɛsɔ ma kaa li zɔ te Aburamu mbala ɛdɔ wu o nyama la Iso iyi Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi. Aburamu a mba Aziki akwɛyi a zɛ wu ɛsɔ ma ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwɔranda. Mizhikembo iyɛnyi, Aziki a mba Ɔzhɛkɔpu a zɛ wu ɛsɔ ma, Ɔzhɛkɔpu ba a mba ɛmɛ wewo la wepo akwɛyi a zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma umba bɔkɔ o kwu watekeyi umba Izirɛ awu.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />&lt;&lt;Ɛmɛ umbakɔ umba Ɔzhɛkɔpu o wo rise ingyi uwɛri mba Ɔzhɔsɛfu akwɛyi o to wu o yama la wawo rishi akwɛyi o ka wa mu Izhipiti ka le gbo rinye. Ukpo ba e yi mbalawu <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />akwɛyi a wa wu ma mu inyashi lɛɛbi. E shi Ɔzhɔsɛfu ilukwu, a mbwa wu ma a fya iyeshi mu eyi iyi ɔsu uwu Izhipiti, Ofero; Uwu e shiwu u to keyi uwu Izhipiti mbala kwogba ungwɔsu lɛɛbi.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />&lt;&lt; Akwɛyi lonzu iyama lu fye mu Izhipiti mbala ɛzhi iyi Okena lɛɛbi; ɛlɛ i bo la inyashi gyɔɔ. Kwuye kwɔngu mbala agba wu o fya kiya ingyi o rimo mo. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhɛkɔpu a pwa te ewiri i yi mu Izhipiti, akwɛyi a lɔ ɛmɛ wu te lo so lo ya ewiri. ɛlɛ gba akwu luzɛ undu kwonze mbo le. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Bɔkɔ o ka ungwopo, akwɛyi Ɔzhɔsɛfu a zɔ ɛnwu wu ma la ɛmanyi wu, akwɛyi Ofero a pwa iso iyi enzu umba Ɔzhɔsɛfu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɔzhɔsɛfu a lɔma te ete wu, Ɔzhɛkɔpu mbala agba wu lɛɛbi, umba enzu uwekperewo la walɔ, lo bo lo du wu mu Izhipiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɛkɔbu a kwuma a ka mu Izhipiti mbaa bɔkɔ uwu mbala ɛmɛ wu o ŋɔ nzhii ba lukwu mba. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />O gba la ɛkpɛzhi mba o bo mu Ɔshɛkɛmu akwɛyi o shi mbo mu ogariwu uwu bɔkɔ Aburamu a ya mafyi iyi ɛmɛ umba Amɔ mu Ɔshɛkɛmu awu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />&lt;&lt; Tabɔkɔ kwuye kwu bo kɛlɛ ungwu Ukpo a nyɔlɔ iso wu ma iyi bɔkɔ e so eshi mɛzhi mbala Aburamu awu, akwɛyi enzu nzu umba o yi mu Izhipiti o kwo mu riba ikyomo gwurugwuru. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Akwɛyi o to ɔsu uwepo mu Izhipiti uwu bɔkɔ e yi Ɔzhɔsɛfu mo. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />E Kyoro umba asɔkwu nzu ma akwɛyi e lo mbo inyashi gyɔɔ, a kpamba mɛga te lo fu ɛmɛ mbelu mba ma kaa lo kpomo.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye kwɔngu gba o mba Omosisi le. Omosisi ba akwu umɛ uwoshoshi. Umba ete wu o yi wu mogba mba nzhii ba evya ɛla. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi o to wu o ko shi wu mu kwudu, akwɛyi umɛ oko uwu Ofero e towumo, akwɛyi e yi wu akwu umɛ wu. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />O zɔ Omosisi ɛzu iyi ilukwu iyinayina iyi ɛzhi iyi Izhipiti. E siso mu idomo mbala apula iwomo mu ekpasu.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />&lt;&lt; kwuyengwu Omosisi e yi lɔri uwekpendo akwɛyi a ka te la ma ɛmanyi wu, Izirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Akwɛyi a ma onzu uwu Izhipiti te e yi mu onzu uwu Izirɛ ɛmwu ibyima. Akwɛyi a ka te a mbwa wu ma akwɛyi a ngbɛ onzu uwu Izhipiti ele ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Omosisi a mate ɛmanyi wu Izirɛlu o zɔngɔma te Ukpo a lɔ wu kaa uwu la wamba ma mu rinye, umba ba ɔ zɔngɔma yi ma tayi mo. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Eyi i lama Omosisi a ma ɛmanyi wu Izirɛ wepo te o yi mu ewa ikirimo. Akwɛyi ka te le lo mbo mesu, akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, lunyi lu kwu imɛnɛ, kimbe ki shi lu gyite la lu wo esu ira?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />&lt;&lt; Akwɛyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu uwufo ɛmwu ikpama awu, e shi Omosisi eyi biŋa akwɛyi a za wu te &lt; Uwe e shi ŋɔ te kwu u to keyi mbala u zɔ nzu ombu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Naa ŋɔ gyi te kaa ngbɛ mi ma mate bɔkɔ ŋɔ ngbɛ onzu uwu Izhipiti mule awu ŋa?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Tabɔkɔ Omosisi a pwa ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a ri ma a ka mu Omidiya. A ŋɔ ugbɔga mɔmɔ mbaa bɔkɔ a mba ɛmɛ anzɔnu wepo.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />&lt;&lt; Mizhikembo iyi lɔri uwekpendo, Omosisi a ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo mu ɛzhi ingbarara kɛlɛ mbala lɔwa undu Osinayi mbaa ɔyi u yi mu kwuwɛyi ungwɛri ipwumo. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Tabɔkɔ Omosisi a ma ɛlɛ, izele i yi wu mo. Akwɛyi ka te e kpeyi kaa la ma gedegede le kyo, akwɛyi a pwa opwu uwu Ukpo u zɔ te: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />&lt;Imi gba mi kwu Ukpo uwu asɔkwu ŋɔ le, Ukpo uwu Aburamu, Aziki mbala Ɔzhɛkɔpu.&gt; Omosisi ele mu ipulama la iyi, akwɛyi a ka kɛlɛ kaa le yese mo fo.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />&lt;&lt; Akwɛyi Ukpo a za la Omosisi te, &lt; Lu ekpoyata ŋa ma, mo mba ŋɔ ri ele akwu kizɛ kɛ kɛrikɛri. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Mi ma inyashi iyi enzu mi mu Izhipiti. Mi pwa ibɛma mba gba mi bo te la mi wa mba ma le. Bo mi lɔŋɔ ma mu Izhipiti kaa wala enzu mi ma mu ɛzhi iyi Izhipiti.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />&lt;&lt;Omosisi ele gba enzu umba Izirɛ o to wumo le. O yo wu te &lt;Uwe e shi ŋɔ te ka kwu u to keyi nzu mbala u zɔ nzu ombu?&gt; uwu gba Ukpo a lɔwu te lakwu u to keyi mbala usama mba mu imbwama iyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu e du wu mu ɛzhi ingbarara mbaa bɔkɔ ɔyi u yi mu ipwumo awu. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />A wa mba ma mu ɛzhi iyi Izhipiti mizhikembo yi e wo apula iyi kenzu iyama mbala lɔzɔ undu amɛ mu Izhipiti mbala Risu Refyobyo mbala kwuyengwu luzɛ mba mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara lɔri uwekpendo awu.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />&lt;&lt; Omosisi ele tete gba a za la ɛmɛ umba Izirɛ te, &lt;Ukpo a wala anukenzu meka yi mate Imi te.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Omosisi ele gba akwu u to keyi uwu enzu nzu le kwuyengwu o kpala ɛlu mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara. Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo e siso mbala wu mu lɔwa undu Osinayi, mbala umba ete nzu akwɛyi a na iso iyi Ukpo iyi kwunyɔ iyi bɔkɔ ki yimo ki du yi.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />&lt;&lt;Umba ete nzu ba o towo iso wu imbwaluma. O gyi rɛnu wu mo ndii; mu egbo mbo igba i so mu Izhipiti i shemba woshi i ka le. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Enzu o za la umanyiwu uwakɔ Ɛrɔnu te, &lt; Ndo nzu eshi iyi i to nzu keyi, mo onzu ele, Omosisi, uwu a wa nzu ma mu ɛzhi iyi Izhipiti - ki yi kiya ingyi ki du wu mo!&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Kwuye kwɔngu gba o ndo eshi iyi i yi mate umɛ uwu endo le. O wo yi isabɔ la odumudumu uwakwu. Ɔ lɛ kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e wo mbo gba i wo le ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Akwɛyi Ukpo e fulo wa e she mbo ɔsu, e shi mbo o le mu apula iyi oshi ɔya igbomo kyamate elovyo mbala ɔvya, ilɛma. Ɛlɛ i zɛ kyaa mbala iyi bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo ungwu umba anukenzu te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">&lt;Lu ka mi la isabɔ mbala rɛshi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">mu lɔri uwekpendo mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">lunyi kwogba ungwu Izirɛ!<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Lunyi lu shi kwunu ungweshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ungwu Ɔmɔlɛshi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">mbala eshi iwɔ kwulovyo, iyi o ya yi te Ɔrɛfani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">eshi iyi lu wo ka lu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">lɛ yi ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Kwuwongwɔlɛ Mi re yi mba rinye igbomo mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ese iyi indama i ka Ɔbabilɔ ma.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />&lt;&lt; Asɔkwu nzu o yi kwunu ungwu Ukpo ilɛma mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara. O wo ngwu mate Ukpo e so Omosisi te le wo ngwu tayi, kyamate bɔkɔ ɔ zɔ wu ngwu tayi. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Mizhikembo iyi o nakwunu ungwu ɛlu ikpalama ma, akwɛyi Ozhoshuwa mbala umba ete nzu ɔ za ngwu o bo ngwu mu ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a nayima mafyi iyi ada umba kiya akwɛyi e shiyi mbo awu. Kwu ŋɔ mu ɛzhi ɛnyi nzhii ba kwuyengwu Odevidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Odevidi a fya esheshi mbaa Ukpo akwɛyi a nda Ukpo kwoya te le shiwu kapa kaa le mbo kizɛ ingyi Ukpo ilɛma la Ukpo uwu Ɔzhɛkɔpu. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ɔsɔlɔmɔ gba ba e mbo ɔtɛpu la Ukpo le.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />&lt;&lt; Ada Ɔsu Ukpo ba a ŋɔ mu agba iyi bɔkɔ enzu gba o mbo le mo. Kyamate bɔkɔ anukenzu e so te:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />&lt;&lt; &lt; Oshi akwu ukpa uwu ɛsu mi, ɛzhi ba akwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">kagyi unga alɛ ifulomo mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ukpo a za wu te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Kwogba ungwu na ba ŋɔ do te</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">ŋɔ mbo mi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Naa mu na ba akwu kizɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">ingyi ɛnwu igbomo mi?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />A kwu ewo mi gba i wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:50">apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi le mo re?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Ositivi a za mba te:&lt;&lt;Lunyi wa pwa mo mbɔlɛ umba bɔkɔ lu gyite lu lomo la Ukpo mo naa lu pwa iso iyi Ukpo mo: Lu koko lu towo iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo ma kyamate bɔkɔ umba asɔkwu yi o wo tayi! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Anukenzu uwu bɔkɔ umba eteyi o lowu inyashi mo, e yimo. Anukenzu umba o kwu ɛpa iyi inyɔma iyi Usama lala lu ngbɛ mba ma. Mu afyi ɛlɛ onzu ongbulolo ele lu ri utu wu, akwɛyi lu ngbɛ wu ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Ositivi a za mba te lunyi gba lu na ɛrama iyi Omosisi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi Alɔgbulɔ wu te lo shi umba asɔkwu nzu le, lunyi ba lu towo imbwaluma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Kpa Ositivi Ekyi Nzhii Ba E Kpomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Tabɔkɔ wa to keyi umba Azhu o pwa iso ɛlɛ, o wo amba gyɔɔ la ɛfyi ikwumo. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ositivi uwu Kwundu uwu Ukpo ba e yi mbala wu awu, e yi eyefaa, e yese moshi akwɛyi a ma inzubɛkwu iyi Ukpo, akwɛyi a ma Ɔzhizɔsi a rima mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi ungwu Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Akwɛyi Ositivi a zɔ te &lt;&lt;&lt;La lu yese, mi ma oshi te u wuma gboo akwɛyi mi ma Umɛ uwu Onzu a rima mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungwu Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Tabɔkɔ udaba uwakɔ uwu Azhu o pwa ɛlɛ akwɛyi kpɛkpɛ o se alu mba ma akwɛyi o tara ega mu opwu uwakwu, akwɛyi o rɛnya o ko kpo wu mɛnwu, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />o pipi wu o wa wu ma mu kwuse akwɛyi o le wo mu ekyi ikpama. Azɔgɔ wa towu ekyi mbɔlɛ ba o lu ekpayi mba ma o shi yi mu idu iyi onzu ulugbaga uwufo uwu o ya wu te Ɔsɔlu.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />kwuye ungwu o ye wu mu ekyi ikpama awu, akwɛyi Ositivi a lɛ Ukpo, a zɔ te &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu mi Ɔzhizɔsi, na kwunyɔ mi ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Akwɛyi a bɔ epunu mɛzhi, a tara oga kpaa, a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ada Ɔsu Ukpo, gbala ingbomo mbo kpa mba.&gt;&gt; Tabɔkɔ a mbwa isomo tayi akwɛyi Ukpo a na wu kwunyɔ ma.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Kwuye ungwu o ngbɛ Ositivi ma awu, Ɔsɔlu e yi mɔmɔ ba a nyama te lo ngbɛ Ositivi ma.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Ɔsɔlu E Lo Wambwalu Inyashi Gyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ɔnumawu inyashi iyɛku i du wa mbwalu mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ akwɛyi enzu lɛɛbi o kpashaa o fu mu Ozhudiya mbala Osamariya, ishi wa zɛ ilɔ kɛkyi.<verse eid="ACT 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Wambwalu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o yi iyi iyi Ukpo o to ukpɛzhi uwu Ositivi o pu wu mo akwɛyi o wo obobyi wu gyɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Ɔsɔlu ba e kwo mu wa mbwalu inyashi ilomo. E fye mu agba mu agba, e yi wa mbwalu eko la anzɔnu akwɛyi e pyipyi mbo e fu mbo mu ugu ugyi.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Tanu Iyi Iso Iyeshi Mu Osamariya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpashaa le ɔ za la anu itama munamuna bɔkɔ o ka. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Ofilipu a ka mu kwuse ungwɔkwu ungwu Osamariya kwukpɛnyi Akwɛyi a tanu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Tabɔkɔ enzu gyɔɔ o pwa iso iyi Ofilipu ikyo o ma apula iyi kenzu iyama iyi bɔkɔ e wo lɛɛbi, umba o shi alu mu iso wu mbala egbo mbo ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Ɛndu iyira i wɔ kwudu mɛnwu iyi enzu riba la ikyakwokwo ibyima. Enzu wakpokapiya mbala wa mu alɛ ma gyɔɔ o bo mbo efya ma. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Enzu umba kwuse kwɔngu o mu ɔnyɛ gyɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsamɔ U Wo Imondo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Onzu uwufo o ya wu te Ɔsamɔ e yi mu imondo iwomo mu kwuse kwɔngu diridiri-e. Imondo wu i shi enzu umba Osamariya lɛɛbi kenzu iyama. E kwɛnwu te uwu akwu onzu uwakwuu mu kwuse kwɔngu, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />akwɛyi enzu lɛɛbi la enzu umba kwuwo mbala ayirewa o mbwalu wu akwɛyi o zɔ te, &lt;&lt; Onzu ele akwu ekpasu iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ o ya yi te ekpasu Iyɛkwu awu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Enzu o mbwalu wu kwuwongu bɔkɔ e to kwuye gyɔɔ bɔkɔ e wo mbo apula iyi kenzu iyama mbala imondo. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />kwuyengwu umba ba o nyama la iso iyesheshi iyi ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo mbala ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi bɔkɔ Ofilipu e so mbo awu akwɛyi o wo mbo obatisima. Ka la eko la anzɔnu o wo mbo obatisima. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Ɔsamɔ mafyiwu a nyama tete akwɛyi o wo obatisima. Akwɛyi a mbwalu Ofilipu munamuna mba bɔkɔ a ka, bɔkɔ a ma apula iyi lɔzɔ mbala apula iyi kenzu iyama iyi bɔkɔ Ofilipu e wo akwɛyi izele i yi wu.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Tabɔkɔ wa zɛ ilɔ umba o yi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o pwa te enzu umba Osamariya o na iso iyi Ukpo, akwɛyi ɔ lɔ Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu ɔka munyi mbo. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />kwuyengwu Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu o bomo, o lɛ Ukpo te kaa lo na Kwundu uwu Ukpo, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />kwuwongu Kwundu uwu Ukpo e de fye mu onzu ukpukpɛnyi mba te mo. O wo mbo obatisima mɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi bi bɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Akwɛyi Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu o fulo mbo ewo mu reshi akwɛyi o na Kwundu uwu Ukpo.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔsamɔ a ma te wa zɛ ilɔ o fulo wa mbwalu ewo mu reshi akwɛyi o na Kwundu uwu Ukpo akwɛyi eshi mbo ɛyi <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />akwɛyi a za Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu te &lt;&lt;La lu shimi ekpasu ɛlɛ ka onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ mi fulo wu ewo mi kaa la na Kwundu uwu Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Opita a gba wu opwu te &lt;&lt;Ɛyi ŋɔ li tomo mbala ŋa, kwuwongu bɔkɔ ŋɔ ka amasa te ŋɔ ya rɛshi ingyi Ukpo mɛyi! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ŋɔ kyo mɔgbɔ mo, ŋɔ yi ogbo mu ɛduma ɛlɛ mo, kwuwongu egbo ŋɔ iyi ongbulolo mbaa Ukpo mo. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Kwu ira ŋa ɛlɛ ɔsu ka kpa ɛshɛku la Ukpo igboshimo egbo iyira iyi ŋɔ yi yi ele a gba yi akpa ŋa. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Moo mi ma te ŋɔ yi yese ingyi ira, uŋɔ ba ŋɔ yi mɛyɛ iyi ingbomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Akwɛyi Ɔsamɔ a za la Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu te &lt;&lt; La lu lɛ Ukpo kwuwo mi kaa iyi ŋɔ so le ndii li du mi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu o mbwa anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo akwɛyi o gbama o ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, o za la anu itama iyi ilɔ iyesheshi mu ese riba iyi Osamariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ofilipu Mbala Onzu Uwu Itopiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ɔnuuwufo Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a za la Ofilipu te, &lt;&lt; So mu kwuko ungwu ononoyo mu - ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ u solofo u wɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ uwu sheye mu Ogaza awu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Akwɛyi e yimo a kama, ta bɔkɔ e sheyimo e kpolo inozhi uwu bɔkɔ akwu onzu uwakwuu uwu Itopiya uwu bɔkɔ apula iyi Ɔsu oko uwu Okadɛsi uwu Itopiya bɔkɔ i yi mɔwu wu awu. Onzu ele a ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kaa la lɛ Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Tabɔkɔ a gbama e sheye mogba a ŋɔ mu omato uwu Onya a za la kwokpo ungwu anukenzu Azaya iwama. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Akwɛyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo a za la Ofilipu te &lt;&lt;Turugba kɛlɛ mbaa omato uwu Onya awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Akwɛyi Ofilipu a rɛnya a ka mbaa omato uwu Onya awu akwɛyi a pwa te onzu ele a wa kwokpo ungwu anukenzu Azaya. Akwɛyi Ofilipu e yo wu te &lt;&lt; Ŋɔ zɔngɔma iyi ŋɔ yi mu iwama le ma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />A gba opwu te, &lt;&lt; Mi wo la mi yitu, gba onzu o zɔ mi yi dɛ mo?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a ya Ofilipu mo kaa la yama la ŋɔ mbala wu.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Inozhi awu e yi mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo iwama ungwu kwu zɔ te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">O she wu mo mba ingbɛma mate ilɔ tayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">mate umɛ uwu ilɔ mewo iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a gbɔ wu inyi wu mo awu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">ba e siso mo.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />O lo wu ese o towu ombu mamo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Uwe bɔkɔ e do ata ifulomo iyi eye wu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Kwuwongwu enzu o ngbɛ wu ma e shi rito mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo.<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Akwɛyi Inozhi awu e yo Ofilipu te &lt;&lt; Shɔkɔ so mi, iso iyi uwe bɔkɔ anukenzu ele e yi mu isomo? E so mu reshi wu naa mu reshi ingyi onzu awa ŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Akwɛyi Ofilipu a za wu te kwokpo ungwu ŋɔ yi mu iwama awu kwu so iso iyesheshi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu luzɛ mɔgwuzɛ o du embyi akwɛyi inozhi awu a zɔ te &lt;&lt; Yese de, embyi o ŋɔ le, kimbe ki fo obatisima mi iwomo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Ofilipu a za wu te gba ŋɔ kwidu ŋɔ fulo la egbo lɛɛbi o wo ŋɔ obatisima&gt; akwɛyi inozhi awu a zɔ te, &lt;Mi nyama te Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi akwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Akwɛyi Inozhi awu e shi omato uwu Onya awu te la rima. Akwɛyi Ofilipu la inozhi awu o solofo o fye mu embyi akwɛyi Ofilipu e wo wu obatisima. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o wɔ kwudu mu embyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo e to Ofilipu mo a ka wuma akwɛyi inozhi awu a mawu fo. Uwu ba akwu luzɛ wu la ɔnyɛ imuma. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ofilipu ba a wɔ mu Azɔtu, e le mu igɔma la anu itama iyi ilɔ iyesheshi mu ese ɛnyi lɛɛbi nzhii ba e bo mu Oseseriya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔsɔlu A Na Ɔzhizɔsi Tee La Kwu Ɔkwu Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(Iwomo Iyi Wa zɛ ilɔ 22.6-16; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ɔsɔlu ba a gyakpɔ mu ishi itomo te, uwu a ngbɛ onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu Ɔkwu ma. Akwɛyi a ka mba obwoshi uwakɔ <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />akwɛyi a nda kwupu ungwu a za ngwu a ka la wa to keyi umba udaba uwu Azhu mu Ɔdamasikɔ, kaa onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi, eko la anzɔnu, u wu e yi wu mo a nyawa mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kaa la ta wu mu ugu ugyi. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔsɔlu a nda la Ɔdamasikɔ ma fo, akwɛyi ɛbɛ iyɛku i wɔ mu oshi i kpowu mɛnwu. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Mu kwotota kwɔngu a tama mɛzhi akwɛyi a pwa opwu u wu u za wu te, &lt;&lt; Ɔsɔlu, Ɔsɔlu, kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ ŋɔ lo mi inyashi te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Akwɛyi Ɔsɔlu e yo kwuyo tee, Ɔkwu, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ kwu uwe?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Akwɛyi a gba opwu te &lt;&lt; Mi kwu Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ ye wu mu inyashi ilomo awu. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />&lt;&lt;Yimo ka fye mu kwuse kekelele akwɛyi o so ŋɔ kiya ingyi ŋɔ wo.<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu luzɛ mbala Ɔsɔlu awu izele i yi mbo mo, o pwa opwu bi ba ɔ ma ɔzɛnzɛnyi mo. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Ɔsɔlu e yimo mɛzhi, ta bɔkɔ a ya eyi mo, a ma kiya kinyinyi mo. Akwɛyi o yi wu mu ɔwu o kawa mu Ɔdamasikɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Ɔsɔlu e to afyi ɛla a ma ɛbɛ mo, e ri kiya mo ba e wo embyi mo.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />U vɔngɔ kiya uwu Ɔzhizɔsi uwufo uwu o ya wu te Ananayasi e yi mu Ɔdamasikɔ mɔmɔ. Akwɛyi a ma ɛbɛ te, Ukpo a ya wu ma &lt;&lt;Ananiya!&gt;&gt; Ɔkwu a ya wu ma meka iyi ɛbɛ imama te &lt;&lt; Ananayasi!&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a nya wu ma &lt;&lt; Daa,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Akwɛyi Ukpo za wu te &lt;&lt; Yimo ka so mu kwogba ungwu Ozhuda mu Ɔgwuzɛ uwu o ya wu te Ototo awu kaa yo kwuyo ungwu onzu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ mu Otasu uwu ɔ ya wu te Ɔsɔlu awu ŋɔ du wu mu Ukpo ilɛma. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Ɔsɔlu a ma ɛbɛ te, onzu uwufo uwu o ya wu te Ananayasi e bo e fulo wu ewo kaa la gba la ɛbɛ imama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananayasi a gba opwu te &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mi pwa ɛza iyi onzu ele mbala ira iyi bɔkɔ e wo enzu ŋɔ wabwalu lɛɛbi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />A gba e bo munɛ la inyama iyi ebwoshi umbakɔ ka le yi umba bɔkɔ o to rinyi ŋɔ lɛɛbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ɔkwu ba a za la Ananayasi te, &lt;&lt; So! mo mi ŋa wu ka le wo mi ɛduma, e siso mi mbaa umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo mbala asu mba mbala midu iyi enzu umba Izirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Mi zɔ wu inyashi iyi bɔkɔ a ba ma kwongwu ɛnyi mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Akwɛyi Ananayasi a ka mu kwogba kwɔngu akwɛyi e fye mo. E fulo Ɔsɔlu ewo wu akwɛyi a za wu te &lt;&lt; Umɛnɛ mi Ɔsɔlu, Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ ma wu kwuyengwu ŋɔ yi mu inyɔma munɛ awu, a lɔ mi ma kaa gba la ɛbɛ imama, kaa na Kwundu uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Mu kwotota kwɔngu kiya ki wɔ mate ekpo iyi umu tayi mu eyi iyi Ɔsɔlu akwɛyi a gba la ɛbɛ imama kyawu. E yimo akwɛyi Ananayasi e wo wu obatisima. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />E ri kiya ingyirimo akwɛyi a gba la ekpasu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Ɔsɔlu A Ta Anu Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Mu Ɔdamasikɔ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Ɔsɔlu e wo afyi bwɛɛ mbala wa mbwalu mu Ɔdamasikɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Mu kwotata kwɔngu e le mu anu itama mu idaba iyi Azhu te Ɔzhizɔsi akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa wu, izele i yi mbomo akwɛyi o yo te &lt;&lt;Akwu onzu ele gba e lo wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi inyashi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ le mo re? Onzu ele e bo te le yi mbo kaa la ka la ebwoshi umbakɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kaa lo fu mbo mu ugu ugyi&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Tetete ekpasu iyi Ɔsɔlu i le mu ikyomo kwɔfyi kwɔfyi. A kpa amasa iyi Azhu umba o yi mu Ɔdamasikɔ awu shaa, mu isomo te Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu Okrasi le.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Mizhikembo iyi afyi gyɔɔ i pikama, Azhu o wo ɔkwura wu ka lo ngbɛ wu Ɔsɔlu ma. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ɔsɔlu ba a pwa kwɔkyɛ mba te o ye wu migbomo la utu la ɔnu mu kenzugwu unga ɔbɛ ka lɔ ngbɛ wu ma. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ɛmɛgba wu ba o towu mo mutu o lo wu mu kibiri akwɛyi o za wu mu kwɔtu ungwu kwogyiga o shi wu mɛzhi akwɛyi a wirima a kama iya wu.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔsɔlu A Gba A Ka Mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Tabɔkɔ e bo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ a gyite le kyo mbala wa mbwalu, umba ba o wuyi wu kwuwongu o nyama te akwu u mbwalu ongbulolo mo. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Akwɛyi Obanaba ba e to wu a kawa mbaa wa zɛ ilɔ. Akwɛyi Obanaba a za mba te Ɔsɔlu a ma Ɔkwu mu ɔgwuzɛ, te Ɔkwu e siso mbala wu, akwɛyi Ɔsɔlu e siso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi gedegede mu Ɔdamasikɔ <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Akwɛyi Ɔsɔlu a ŋɔ mbala mba, a gɔ iyawu la anu itama iyi Ɔkwu gedegede mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Ɔsɔlu e koko e ri lɔɔmbwu mu iso Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Azhu umba bɔkɔ akwu Agiriki, umba ba o gyite lo ngbɛ wu ma. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Tabɔkɔ wa mbwalu o pwa ɛlɛ, o towu ɔ ka mu Oseseriya akwɛyi ɔ lɔ wu a ka mu Otasu.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Akwɛyi wambwulu mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya mbala Ogalili mbala Osamariya lɛɛbi o ŋɔ mu oloto. Kpɛkpɛ mba o zɛ luzɛ mba mu iyi iyi Ukpo ba kwundu uwu Ukpo a ka mba ɛnwu ma akwɛyi o kyo riba ma gyɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opita A Ka Mu Olida Mbala Ozhopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Tabɔkɔ Opita e yi mu ifulama mu ɛzhi iyi Azhu mbala Osamariya, akwɛyi a ka mbaa wa mbwalu mu Olida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Mɔmɔ e du onzu uwufo ukpokapiya ɔ ya wu te Aniyasi, a nɔ mu kwugodo lɔri lɔranda. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Opita a za la Aniyasi te &lt;&lt;Aniyasi, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e bo ŋɔ ofya ma-a. Yimo ka kwu ɔkyɔ ŋɔ ma.&gt;&gt; Mɔmɔɔmɔ, Aniyasi e yimo a rima. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Olida mbala Ɔsharɔ lɛɛbi o ma Aniyasi akwɛyi ɛlɛ i shi mbo o nyama o bwalu Ɔkwu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />U mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi uwufo e yi mu Ozhopa mɔmɔ o ya wu te Otabita (iyi bɔkɔ iluma yi akwu Ɔdɔkasi), e koko e wo ɛduma iyi esheshi, a mbwama la ayirewa ma gyɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Mu kwushi kwɔngu, a nofya akwɛyi e kpomo. O wo ukpɛzhi wu ma akwɛyi o shi wu mu ugu uwoshi. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Olida andama mbala Ozhopa mo. Bɔkɔ wa mbwalu o pwa te Opita e yi mu Olida, akwɛyi o lɔ enzu wepo o ka munyi wu, o ko kpawu ɛshɛku te &lt;&lt;Shɔɔkɔ bo kekelele!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Opita a kama mbala mba, akwɛyi bɔkɔ o fyemo mogba, o kawa mu ugu uwoshi. Eko wakpanuma lɛɛbi o fula wu ma la ega ilomo, o kyo o zɔ wu ekpayi iyi Ɔdɔkasi e fu kwuyengwu e yi lakwunyɔ awu. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Opita a wala enzu ma mu ugu lɛɛbi, akwɛyi a la epunu mɛzhi a lɛ Ukpo. E fulowa e shi ukpɛzhi eyi akwɛyi a za wu te &lt;&lt; Otabita, yimo.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Otabita a ya eyi mo akwɛyi ta bɔkɔ a ma Opita akwɛyi e yimo a ŋɔma. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />E yi wu mu kwuwo e yimo a rima mu alɛ wu. Akwɛyi a ya enzu wa mbwalu ma mbala eko wakpanuma akwɛyi e shi wu mbo la reyi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Iwomo ɛlɛ i fulama lɛɛbi mu Ozhopa , akwɛyi enzu gyɔɔ o kwidu o fulo mu Ɔkwu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Opita a gyi e wo afyi mu Ozhopa, a ŋɔ mbala uwo ekpo uwufo o ya wu te Ɔsamɔ.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ A Lɔ Laa Opita.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Onzu uwufo e yi mu Oseseriya o ya wu te Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ akwu u to keyi uwu uzhi uwu asozha umba Italiya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Uwu mbala agba wu lɛɛbi o yi iyi iyi Ukpo ba o wo kiya ingyi Ukpo a gyi. E wo ayirewa gyɔɔ rɛshi ba a lɛ Ukpo kwuye ngwunangwuna. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ɔnu uwufo mu ekerepe ela iyi ɔnɔnda Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ a ma ɛbɛ. Mu ɛbɛ imama ɛlɛ, a ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo gedegede e bo munyi wu akwɛyi a ya wu ma te, &lt;&lt; Ɔkɔnɛliyɔsi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ a bɔ wu eye ngoo, iyi i wowu mo akwɛyi e yo te, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, ɛlɛ akwu mbɛ?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a gba wu opwu te &lt;&lt;Ukpo a na Ukpo ilɛma ŋa mbala rɛshi ingyi ŋɔ wo ayirewa awu, inyi gba apula e bɔkɔ o lolo ŋɔ ma yi le. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Lɔ enzu Kekelele kaa lo so mu Ozhopa kaa lo ngye la Ɔsamɔ uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Opita awu, <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />e yi mogba uwu Ɔsamɔ u pwu ekpo, uwu bɔkɔ kwogba wu kwu yi mu kenzu unga risu awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e so wu iso le a kama, Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ a ya ɛmɛgba wu wepo ma mbala osozha ɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ e yi iyi iyi Ukpo ba e yi mbala wu kwuyengwunanguna ma. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ a ba mba ɛza iyi kiya ingyi ki wo lɛɛbi, akwɛyi a lɔ mba ma mu Ozhopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Meyi i lama iyi kwɔfyi kwɔngu, mu kwuyengwu ɔnɔnda, ta bɔkɔ o yi mu luzɛ akwɛyi o nda la Ozhopa fo, akwɛyi Opita a ya kadu mugu kaa la lɛ Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Lonzu lu wowu mo akwɛyi a gyite le ri kiya. Tabɔkɔ o yi mu kiya ingyirimo iwomo bɛnɛ akwɛyi e fye mu ɛbɛ imama. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Opita a ma oshi te u wuma akwɛyi a ma kiya mate kwulamba ungwu o ma ngwu ma eko edondo o ye ngwu mu ikalama mɛzhi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Izɔfyi umba alɛ endo lɛɛbi mbala kiya ingyi bɔ ki pipi mɛzhi mbala afyi umba oshi o yi mɛmi ngwu. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Akwɛyi a pwa opwu uwu Ukpo u za wu te &lt;&lt; Opita, yimo kaa ngbɛ kaa kwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Akwɛyi Opita a za wu te &lt;&lt; Ada Ɔsu Ukpo mi do ɛlɛ iwomo mo!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mi di ri kiya ingyi ɛrama iyi Azhu nzu i nyama nana ingyi ki wuluma dɛɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Opwu ɔnwu u gba u u wɔ ungwopo kpɔ u za wu te &lt;&lt;Gba Ukpo a wulu kiya ma, ki zɔ te kiya ngyɛngyi ki sheshi mo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ɛlɛ iwo tayi izhɛla akwɛyi o to kwulamba kwɔngu ma o gbawu o ka moshi.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Tabɔkɔ Opita e yi mu egbo ibyima iyi iluma iyi ɛbɛ iyi uwu a ma le akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ a lɔ mba ma le o fye kwogba ungwu Ɔsamɔ ma akwɛyi o ri mu kenzugwu mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Akwɛyi o yama mu opwu uwɔkwu o yo kwuyo te Ɔsamɔ uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Opita awu e yi munɛ re?<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Tabɔkɔ Opita e degbo mu egbo ibyima meka iyi ɛbɛ ɛlɛ akwɛyi Kwundu Uwu Ukpo a za wu te &lt;&lt;Ɔsamɔ, enzu wala o yi mu kwuyo ŋɔ iyomo. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Yimo, kalama kaa so kaa du mbo mɛzhi. Ki tomo iyi isomo mbala mba mo, mo Imi gba mi lɔ mba le.<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Opita a kalama a ka e du enzu mbɔlɛ akwɛyi e yo mbo te &lt;&lt; Imi gba lu yi mu igagyima le. Kimbe ki bo yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Enzu mbamba o gba wu opwu te &lt;&lt; Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ u to keyi uwu asozha umba Oroma gba a lɔ nzu ma munyi ŋɔ le. Uwu akwu onzu ototo, a wuyi iyi Ukpo. Azhu lɛɛbi o lo wu mo gyɔɔ. Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a za wu te la ya ŋa ma kaa bo mogba wu kaa la pwa iyi ŋɔ so.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Akwɛyi Opita e fye mbo mo mogba wu akwɛyi e lo mbo riyi oga.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 10:23">Opita E Bo Mogba Uwu Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Meyi i lama iyi kwɔfyi kwɔngu, Opita a wɔ a kama mbala mba, akwɛyi wa mbwalu umbafo o wɔ mu Ozhopa o zɛ mbala wu o kama. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Mu kwɔfyi ungwu kwu mbwalu, e fye mu Oseseriya. Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ ba e yi eyi mbo iyi ifulomo akwɛyi a ya enzu umba kwogba wu mbala ɛmɛza wu kasɛkɛ ma o kpala ɛlu mogba wu. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Tabɔkɔ Opita e fye mo mogba, Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ e kwumo a bwa wu ma akwɛyi e gbo wu oya. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Opita ba a za wu te &lt;&lt;Yimo, yimo!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt; Imi mi kwu onzu mate uŋɔ tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Opita a za la iso isomo mbala wu akwɛyi e fyemo mɛmi, e du kwumbu ungwu enzu. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Akwɛyi Opita a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Lunyi lu yitu marimari te kinzu ki yi ɛrama te Azhu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, lo ri imɛza mbala esu mo. Ukpo ba a zɔ mi te la mi ya onzu uwunawuna te Ukpo a na wu mo mo, naa onzu uwu kashi mo. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ gba bɔkɔ lu lɔ la mi, mi ri kaambu mo akwɛyi mi bo. Kekelele mi yo yi te, kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ lu lɔ la mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Akwɛyi Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ a gba opwu te: &lt;&lt; Ɔnɛ akwu kwɔfyi ungwu ondo bɔkɔ mi yi mogba mi mu Ukpo ilɛma mu kwuye kwɔlɛ tete, mu ekerepe ela iyi ɔnɔnda. Akwɛyi mi ma onzu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ e lo ekpayi iyi ilemo a ri mu keyi mi <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />akwɛyi a za mi te, &lt;&lt;Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ, Ukpo a pwa ilɛma ŋa mbala rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo ayirewa le. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Lɔma kaa lo so mu Ozhopa mbaa Ɔsamɔ uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Opita awu. A kwu ugbɔga mogba uwu Ɔsamɔ u pwu ekpo uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔ mu kenzu unga risu awu.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ɛlɛ gba ishi mi lɔma munyi ŋɔ le, ki mwɔnyɛ la ibomo ŋɔ. Kelele lɛɛbi nzu ki ŋɔ le mu idu iyi Ukpo kaa la ki pwa kiya ingyinangyina ingyi Ukpo a za ŋa te so nzu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso Iyi Opita Mogba Wu Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Akwɛyi Opita e le mu iso isomo, a zɔ te: &lt;&lt;Kekelele gba mi zɔngɔma yi ma te Ukpo e yi kusɛ mo. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />uwu ba a na enzu umba kwudu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ ɔ riyi wu akwɛyi o wo iyi bɔkɔ uwu a gyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Lunyi lu yitu iyi ilɔ iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a lɔ la enzu wu umba Izirɛ, ilɔ iyesheshi iyi idigbomo iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, uwu bɔkɔ akwu Ɔkwu uwu enzu wu lɛɛbi e bo yi. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Lunyi lu yitu iyi kiya ingyi ki wo mu Ozhudiya, iyo yoo mu Ogalili, mizhikembo iyi obatisima uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhɔnu a tanu wu awu - <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Lunyi lu yitu te Ukpo e shi Ɔzhizɔsi uwu a wɔ mu ɔnazarɛti awu Kwundu wu mbala ekpasu ka le wo apula iyi amɛ. Lu yitu kpɔ te Ɔzhizɔsi a fulama mu ese ikikɔ ikikɔ e wo iyeshi la enzu, umba bɔkɔ o yi mɛyɛ iyi onzu uwoyi ba a wa mba ma. Ɔzhizɔsi e wo ɛlɛ lɛɛbi kwuwongu Ukpo e yi mbala wu<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />&lt;&lt; Kinzu ki kwu azɔgɔ umba kiya ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi e wo lɛɛbi mu ɛzhi iyi Azhu mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. Watokeyi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o to wu o kpa mu kwuwɛyi o ngbɛ wu ma. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ukpo ba e yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwɔla akwɛyi e shi enzu lɔ ma wu. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />A kwu enzu lɛɛbi gba o ma wu le mo, azɔgɔ umba Ukpo a ŋa le gba o ma wu le. Kinzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa nzu bɔkɔ ki ri, ki wo mbalawu gba ki mawu le mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ e yimo mu kwuvɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Ukpo a ta nzu ɔkpa te la ki tanu iyi iso wu la enzu, la ki za mba te Ɔzhizɔsi gba Ukpo a ŋa wu le te kaa la zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o degbo la reyi mbala umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Anukenzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o ka iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi awu, o so enzu te onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kwu idu e fulo ma wu, oo gba la ingbomo wu oo kpa wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enzu Umba Akwu Azhu Mo O Na Kwundu Uwu Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Tabɔkɔ Opita e yi mu iso ɛlɛ isomo bɛnɛ akwɛyi enzu lɛɛbi umba o pwa iso ɛlɛ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye ma mba. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Azhu Wambwalu umba bɔkɔ o ngyi mu Ozhopa mbala Opita o ya kenzu te enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo lala o na Kwundu uwu Ukpo tete, <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />kwuwongu o pwa te o so lunzu ndowa ba ɔ du Ukpo ma,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">akwɛyi Opita a za mba te, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo e yi uwu bɔkɔ e se enzu mbɔlɛ ɔgwuzɛ ma kaa lo wo mbo obatisima mo? Kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye ma mba kyamate kinzu tete-e?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Akwɛyi Opita a za mba te lo wo mbo obatisima mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Akwɛyi o za la Opita te le wo afyi bwɛɛ mbala mba.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="ms">Opita E So Wambwalu Mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ Kiya Ingyi Ki Wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Wa zɛ ilɔ mbala Wambwalu mu Ozhudiya ndii o pwa te enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo o na iso Ukpo tete. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Akwɛyi ta bɔkɔ Opita a ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, Azhu umbafo wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o gyi te enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, lo zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma awu o gwu wu anu akwɛyi o za wu te, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Ŋɔ ka mu agba iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo wa zɛ ɛsɔ mo akwɛyi ŋɔ ri kiya mbala mba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Akwɛyi Opita e so mbo kiya ingyi ki wo lɛɛbi te: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />&lt;&lt;Mi yi mu kwuse ungwu Ozhopa mu Ukpo ilɛma, mi ma ɛbɛ. Mi ma kiya ki wɔ moshi kyamate kwulamba o ma ekyikyi mu eko endo ungwu, akwɛyi a kala ngwu ma mu idu mi. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Mi yese mɛmi iyi kwulamba kwɔngu akwɛyi mi ma Iuzhi ndu alɛ endo mbala Izɔfyi umba ɔsɛ mbala izɔfyi umba bɔkɔ o pyipyi ubwu mɛzhi mbala afyi mba oshi. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Akwɛyi mi pwa opwu uwu u za mi te, &lt;Opita yimo, ngbɛ kaa kwu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi mi gba opwu te &lt;Ɔkwu mi! Mi do ɛlɛ iwomo mo! &lt;&lt;Mi di ri kiya ingyi ɛrama iyi Azhu nzu inyima naa ingyi ki wuluma mo dɛ mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Opwu ɔnwu u gba u u wɔ ungwopo kpɔ u za mi te &lt;Gba Ukpo a wulu kiya ma ki zɔ kiya ngyɛngyi ki sheshimo mo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Ɛlɛ iwo tayi izhɛla akwɛyi o to okpayi awu ma o gbawu o ka moshi.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Mu kwotota kwɔngu enzu wala umba bɔkɔ o lɔ mba ma bɔkɔ o wɔ mu Oseseriya o fye mogba mbaa mi yi le. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Kwundu a za mi te la mi tomo iyi isomo mbala mba mo. Wambwalu warɛnyi mbɔlɛ o kama mbala mi akwɛyi ki fye mogba uwu onzu awu. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Ɔkɔnɛliyɔ e so nzu ewo iyi bɔkɔ a ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo mogba wu akwɛyi a za wu te &lt;Lɔma mu Ozhopa mbaa Ɔsamɔ uwu bɔ o ya wu te Opita awu. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Aa ka ŋa la ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi bɔkɔ uŋɔ mbala agba ŋa o fya isama.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11.15 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">z</char>
    </note>Tabɔkɔ mi ye la iso isomo akwɛyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye mamba mate bɔkɔ kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye ma nzu mu ɔnuwu kwonze awu. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Akwɛyi mi lolo iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔkwu e so te: &lt;Ɔzhɔnu e wo yi obatisima mu embyi, Imi ba mi wo yi obatisima mu Kwundu uwu Ukpo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ukpo uwu e shi kwundu wu e fye ma mba awu uwu gba e shi nzu le tete, kinzu umba ki kwidu ki fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi awu, imi mi kwu uwe bɔkɔ mi domo te mi se Ukpo ɔgwuzɛ ma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Tabɔkɔ o pwa iso iyi Opita ɛlɛ, akwɛyi o lafya la Opitanu igwumo akwɛyi o du Ukpo ma, o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;I zɔ te, Ukpo a nyama la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo te lo fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ tete, gba o kwira mba ɔsu akwɛyi o kwu idu lu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wambwalu Umba Bɔkɔ O Yi Mu Atiyɔki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Mizhikembo iyi o ngbɛ Ositivi ma wa mbwalu gyɔɔ o lafya la Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o ka mu ese ewa kwuwongu enzu o ye mbo mu inyashi ilomo mɔmɔ. Umbafo mba o ka mu Ofonesiya, mu Ɔsapurɔ, mu Atiyɔki mu ɛzhi iyi Osiriya. o so iso iyi Ukpo laa Azhu kɛɛkyi.. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Wambwalu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu Ɔsapurɔ mbala Osarini o ka mu Atiyɔki akwɛyi o le mu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi isomo la umba Ogiriki tete, o zɛ mba ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Ekpasu iyi Ɔkwu i yi mbala mba, akwɛyi enzu gyɔɔ o nyama o mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Ɛza iyeshi ɛlɛ i fye mu alu iyi wa mbwalu mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, akwɛyi o lɔ Obanaba ma kaa le so mu Atiyɔki. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Tabɔkɔ a kama mɔmɔ, a mwu ɔnyɛ kwuwongu a ma esheshi iyi Ukpo mu enzu mbɔlɛ. Akwɛyi a ka mba ɛnwu ma te lo rima kpakiri mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwalu ma mu egbo mbo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Obanaba akwu onzu uwoshoshi, uwu bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi mbala wu, uwu bɔkɔ e kwidu e fulo mu Ukpo. Kwuwongwu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ e wo, enzu gyɔɔ o na iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Akwɛyi Obanaba a ka mu Otasu kaa la gagyi Ɔsɔlu, <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />kwuyengwu e fye wu mo akwɛyi e bo wu mu Atiyɔki. Obanaba mbala Ɔsɔlu o to kari ngyɔɔ mu Atiyɔki la enzu ɛzu izɔma mu Ɔshɔshi. Mu Atiyɔki gba o ye la wa mbwalu iyama te Akirisitɛ le.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Kwuye kwɔngu, anukenzu umbafo o wɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o bo mu Atiyɔki. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Akwɛyi ukpɛnyi mba uwu o ya wu te Agabu awu, e yimo mu ekpasu iyi Kwundu akwɛyi a za la enzu te ɛzhi iyi Oroma lɛɛbi i ya lonzu. &lt;Ɛlɛ i wo mu kwuye ungwu Ɔkaladiyɔ akwu Ɔsu awu.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Wambwalu umba Atiyɔki o kamasa te lo mbwama la wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya. Uwewe ee shi iyi bɔkɔ ekpasu wu i ba. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Akwɛyi o lɔ Obanaba mbala Ɔsɔlu la rɛshi ngyɛlɛ te lo kala enzu umbakɔ umba ɔshɔshi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Inyashi Iyi Wambwalu I Kyomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Akwu mu kwuye kwɔngu gba Ɔsu Ɛrɔdu e yi wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi umbafo ma kaa le lo mbo inyashi. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />A ngbɛ Ozhemisi umanyi uwu Ɔzhɔnu ma mu okpandɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Tabɔkɔ a ma te ɛlɛ i she la Azhu, akwɛyi a gya kpɔɔ e yi Opita ma tete. Ɛlɛ i wo kwuyengwu odumudumu uwu oburedi uwu bɔkɔ e yi otutu mo. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ e yi Opita ma akwɛyi a ta wu mu ugu ugyi, a ra wu e lo la asozha wendo wendo izhi endo mɔwu kaa lo gbo wu mo utu la ɔnu. Ɛrɔdu ba a gyi te la wa wu kwudu mu ugu ugyi kaa lo zɔ wu ombu la eyi iyi enzu gedegede mizhikembo iyi odumudumu uwu ikalama. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Tayi gba Opita o shi wu mu ugu ugyi le, enzu wa mbwalu ba o kpakpɛ mu Ukpo ilɛma kwuwo wu.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">O Wala Opita Ma Mu Ugu ugyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Mu utu uwu bɔkɔ Ɛrɔdu a gyi te la wala Opita kwudu kaa lo zɔ ombu wu, Opita ba e yi mu ondo ikpolomo meka iyi asozha wepo, o lo wu ɛyɛ ekpepo, akwɛyi asozha wepo ba o yi mu igbomo mu kenzugu. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Kporo ba ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a wɔ akwɛyi ugu ugyi awu akwu ɛbɛ gedegede. Akwɛyi a kpa Opita kwuwo mu kamba akwɛyi a nyiwu eyi mo. A za wu te, &lt;&lt;Yimo efyefya&gt;&gt; akwɛyi ɛyɛ iyi Opita i luma. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Lo ɛriga ŋa mbala ekpoyata ŋa.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Opita e wo tayi. Ɔlɔgbulɔ awu a za la Opita te, &lt;&lt;Kwu ekpayi ŋa ma kaa mbwalu mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Akwɛyi Opita a mbwalu wu o wɔ kwudu mu ugu ugyi awu, ba Opita e yitu te ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo mbala wu o yi mu iwɔ kwudu kego mo; a ma kyamate uwu e yi mu ɛbɛ imama bi. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />O pika enzu umba igbomo umba kwonze mbala umba opo mo, akwɛyi o bo mu kenzugu akwɛyi riku ingyi kwoso unga bɔkɔ o fye mu kwuse awu riku ri wuma lɛngyi akwɛyi o wɔma manga. Mizhikembo iyi o zɛma o pika ɔgwuzɛ ukpɛnyi ma, akwɛyi kporo ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a lu wu afyima.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Akwɛyi Opita a zɔngɔma ma akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Iyi kambwu mo, kekelele gba mi yitu te Ukpo a lɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ wu le kego kaa la wa mi ma mu ɔwu uwu Ɛrɔdu mbala kiya ingyinangyina ingyi enzu umba Azhu o fulo eyi te ki bi du mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Kwuye ungwu Opita azɔgɔ Ukpo a wawuma akwɛyi a ka mogba uwu Omeri anyi wu Ɔzhɔnu, uwu o ya wu te Omaki, mbaa bɔkɔ enzu riba o kpala ɛlu mu Ukpo ilɛma. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Opita a la kwuwo mu riku, akwɛyi umɛgba okokpayi uwu o ya wu te Oroda, a kaa te le yitu uwe bɔkɔ e yi mu kwuwo ilama mu riku. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Tabɔkɔ a zɔngɔma opwu uwu Opita ma, ɔnyɛ a ga wu ma, a wu riku ma dɛ mo akwɛyi a gba renya a ka mɛmi akwɛyi a ta opwu kpaa te, &lt;&lt;Opita a ri mu kenzugwu le lo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />O za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ kpo rishi re?&gt;&gt; Uwu ba a kpakpɛ mu isomo te akwu Opita, akwɛyi umba ba o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;De ba akwu kwundu wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Opita ba a kpakpɛ mu kwuwo ilama mu riku, akwɛyi o wu riku mo akwɛyi o ma Opita akwɛyi izele i zele mbo mo. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Opita e wo mbo kwuwo te uwewe la kpala kenzu mo akwɛyi a bamba ɛza iyi Ukpo a wa wu kwudu mu ugu ugyi. A za mba te,&lt;&lt;la lu za la Ozhemisi mbala ɛmɛnɛ kiya ingyi ki wo le,&gt;&gt; akwɛyi e fulomo a ka mu riyi ngyewa<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Tabɔkɔ eyi i lama, ovyo uwakwu a ta la asozha kwuwongu o yi kiya ingyi ki du Opita mo. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ Ɛrɔdu a za la asozha te lo gagyi Opita akwɛyi o kpɛvyɛ munamuna ba o ma wu mo, e yo asozha mbamba kwuyo akwɛyi a zɔ te lo ngbɛ mba ma.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 12:19">Lukwu Undu Ɛrɔdu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɛrɔdu a lafya la Ozhudiya a ka ŋɔ mu Oseseriya kwuye bwɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Kwuye kwɔngu Ɛrɔdu e yi mu amba iwomo mbala enzu umba Otaya mbala Ɔsidɔ. Tabɔkɔ o kpa Obilasitu onzu u bɔ eyi mu udaba uwu ɔsu ɛshɛku akwɛyi a nya mba ma. O ka mba Ɛrɔdu kaa lo gagyi iŋɔma iyi oloto mbala esu, kwuwongu o fya ewiri mba mu ɛzhi iyi ɔsu ele.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Akwɛyi ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu o shi awu, Ɛrɔdu e kpo ɛriga iyi ɛsu wu akwɛyi a ŋɔma mu ukpa uwu ɛsu akwɛyi e so enzu iso umba bɔkɔ o kpala ɛlu mu idu awu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Akwɛyi enzu o le wu mu ɛnyi itomo te, &lt;&lt;Opu ɔlɛ akwu uwu ukpo uwu fo, mo akwu onzu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Mu kwotota kwɔngu, ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a fya Ɛrɔdu kiya akwɛyi apwu i ri wu mo akwɛyi e kpomo, kwuwongu a du Ukpo ma mo. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Iso iyi Ukpo ba i le mu ikyomo akwɛyi i fula kizɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Obanaba mbala Ɔsɔlu o mbwa ɛduma mba ma, akwɛyi o gbama mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o ka mu Atiyɔki mbala Ɔzhɔnu uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Omaki awu.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="ms">O Ŋa Obanaba Mbala Ɔsɔlu Akwɛyi Ɔ Lɔ Mba ma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mu ɔshɔshi uwu Atiyɔki, Anukenzu mbala wa zɔ enzu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi o yi mɔmɔ: O ya mba te, Obanaba, Ɔsamɔ uwu o ya wu Onazha, Ɔlushiyɔ uwu Osarini, Ɔmaniyɛ (uwu bɔkɔ o yi wu mba ɔsu Ɛrɔdu) mbala Ɔsɔlu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu Ukpo ilɛma mbala kenyo irima, akwɛyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu ŋa Ɔsɔlu mbala Obanaba kaa lo wo ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ mi ya mba te wo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Tabɔkɔ o mbwa kenyo irima mbala Ukpo ilɛma, o fulo mbo ewo mu reshi akwɛyi o za mba te lo sheyimo.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsɔlu Mbala Obanaba Mu Ɔsapurɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Mizhikembo iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo a lɔ Obanaba mbala Ɔsɔlu kaa lo tanu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, wepepo mbo o to ɔgwuzɛ o ka mu Ɔsɛlusiya akwɛyi o wɔ mɔmɔ o zɛ mu kwoda ungwembyi o ka mu Ɔsapurɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o bo mu Osalamisi, o tanu iyi iso Ukpo mu idaba iyi Azhu. Ɔzhɔnu ba e yi mbala mba e ye mbo mu imbwama.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />O fulama mu kutashi kwɔngu lɛɛbi nzhii ba o bo mu Ɔpafɔsi. O du onzu uwu Azhu uwu bɔkɔ akwu uwo emondo mbala anukenzu uwu angba uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Obari-Ɔzhizɔsi mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Uwu ele, akwu umɛza uwu Ogomina uwu kutashi kwɔngu, uwu o ya wu te Ɔsagiyɔ Ɔpɔlu, uwu ba akwu onzu uwu amasa, a lɔma laa Obanaba mbala Ɔsɔlu kwuwongu a gyi te la pwa iso iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Uwo emondo ele, uwu bɔkɔ ɛnyi wu o ya wu tee, Ɛlimasi mu kenzu unga Ogiriki awu, e kiri kaa le fulo egbo iyi ogomina ma kaa la na iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mo. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Akwɛyi Ɔsɔlu uwu bɔ o ya wu te Ɔpɔlu uwu bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi mbala wu awu, a bɔ wu eyeshii akwɛyi a za wu te, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />&lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu umɛ uwu onzu uwoyi mbala ogewa uwu kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ akwu ingyɛshi! Kwukyoro mbala ira i nyɔlɔ ŋɔ egbo mo. Ŋɔ lafya la ɔgwuzɛ uwu ongbulolo uwu Ukpo itutumo mo? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Ŋɔ ma kwuwongu Ɔkwu kekelele, ŋɔɔ peyi, akwɛyi i gyi i to kwuye ŋɔ ma ɛbɛ mo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Mu kwotota kwɔngu ibumburu mbala ipwu i kpo ma wu akwɛyi e le mu i gɔma yaa a gagyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi wu mu kwuwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Tabɔkɔ ogomina a ma iyi bɔkɔ i du uwo emondo ele, izele i yi wu mo akwɛyi a nyama a mbwalu Ɔkwu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba Mu Opisidiya Uwu Atiyɔki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi Ɔpɔlu mbala enzu wu o fye mu kwoda i wɔ mu Ɔpafɔsi o ka mu Opega mu Opafiliya, mbaa bɔkɔ Ɔzhɔnu a lu mba afyima akwɛyi a gbama a ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />O wɔ mu Opega o ka mu Atiyɔki iyi Opisidiya. Mu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo o fye mu idaba iyi Azhu akwɛyi o ŋɔma. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ o mbwa ɛzu iwama mu ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala ɛzu iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu o ka, akwɛyi wa to keyi umba udaba uwu Azhu o lɔma la mba o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, shi lu yi ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi ɛnwu ɛɛkɔ la enzu mbɔlɛ, shɔkɔ la lu so.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu e yimo a rima, e wo mbo ewo akwɛyi a zɔ te: &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛ umba Izirɛ mbala lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu Azhu mo bɔkɔ lu mbwalu Ukpo: la lu ngbalu kaa lu pwa! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Ukpo uwu enzu umba Izirɛ a ŋa umba asɔkwu nzu akwɛyi e shi riba mba ri kyomo gyɔɔ kwuyengwu bɔkɔ umba o yi mu Izhipiti, a wa mba ma mu kwuwo ungwu ekpasu wu mɛzhi ɛnyi, <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Ukpo e yi idu mbala mba mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara nzhii ba lɔri uwekpendo, <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ukpo a ra laa ese erewo mo mu Okena akwɛyi a ra yi e shi mbo kaa lakwu ɛzhi mba. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ɛlɛ i to mbo lɔri ederi endo la uwɛkpɛlɔ (450).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">&lt;&lt; Mizhikembo iyɛlɛ Ukpo e shi mbo wa zɔ ombu nzhii ba kwuye ungwu anukenzu Ɔsamuwɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Akwɛyi enzu mbamba o nda te le shi mbo ɔsu mba akwɛyi Ukpo e shi mbo Ɔsɔlu umɛ uwu Okishi, uwu ɛdɔ iyi Obezhami, uwu bɔkɔ e rɛsu lɔri uwekpendo. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a lu Ɔsɔlu ma mu ɛsu akwɛyi E to Odevidi ɛsu. Ukpo e so iso iyesheshi wu te: &lt;Mi fya Odevidi umɛ uwu Ozhese onzu uwu idu mi, ee wo ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ mi gyi te le wo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />&lt;&lt;Akwu mu ɛdɔ iyi onzu ele gba Ukpo a kala Izirɛ Ɔzhizɔsi u sa enzu le , mate bɔkɔ e so mbo e shi mɛzhi tayi. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Ɔzhɔnu uwo obatisima a tanu iyi ikwu ira ɔsu la enzu umba Izirɛ lɛɛbi dɛ gba Ɔzhizɔsi e bo le. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhɔnu e yi mu ɛduma wu imbwama akwɛyi e yo mbo te &lt;Lunyi lu ma te mi kwu uwe? Akwu mi gba mi kwu Usama le mo. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu inyɔma mu kembo mi le, ekyikyi iyi ekpoyata wu lala mi do yi ivuvuma mo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, ɛmɛ umba Aburamu, mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo umba bɔkɔ o wo iyi iyi Ukpo, kinzu gba o lɔ ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi isama o ka nzu le. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Enzu umba Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbala wa to keyi ba o nyama te Ɔzhizɔsi gba Ukpo a lɔ wu kaa la sa mba ma le mo, o zɔngɔma iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu o ka. Tetete lukwu undu bɔkɔ o ngbɛ wu akwu inyɔlɔma iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu o so iyi bɔkɔ o wayi iyɔkpɔɔ ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />O fya kwuyi ungwu o ngbɛ wu ma mo, tetete o za la Opayileti te la ngbɛ wu ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ o mbwa iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ o ka mu reshi wu awu ma, o kala wu ma mu kwuwɛyi akwɛyi o pwu wu mo mu kuvɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ukpo ba e yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />akwɛyi mu afyi gyɔɔ a zɔ ɛnwu wu ma mba enzu umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu Ogalili o zɛ mbala wu o ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. Umba gba akwu azɔgɔ wu le kekelele .<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />&lt;&lt; Kekelele ki ka yi la iso iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi la umba asɔkwu nzu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />akwɛyi a nyɔlɔ yi ma, Ukpo e shi nzu Ɔzhizɔsi kinzu eye, kyamate bɔkɔ o ka yi mu kwokpo ungwu Usamu ungwopo te: &lt;&lt; &lt;Ŋɔ kwu umɛ mi;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:33">ɔnɛnɛ mi kwu Ada ŋa. <verse eid="ACT 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Ongbulolo uwu iso gba e yi te Ukpo e yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ, e shi wu kaa la gba le kpomo fo, Ukpo e so yi e shi mɛzhi te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">&lt;&lt; &lt;Mi mbwa yi ma lunyi enzu mi kyamate mi so mi shi mɛzhi la Odevidi tayi.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Te gba o ka yi ma mu riyi ingyi fo mu kwokpo ungwu amwu le te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">&lt;&lt; &lt;Ŋɔ lafya la onzu Ɔkɛrikɛri ŋɔ kaa le kpomo mo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Odevidi a mbwa ɛduma iyi Ukpo mo mu ɔyi wu akwɛyi Ukpo a na wu kwunyɔ ma, o pwu wu mo mbala umba asɔkwu wu akwɛyi ɛnwu wu i vama. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ukpo e yi Ɔzhizɔsi ma mu kwuvɔ, akwɛyi e kpomo fo ɛnwu ba i vama mo.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔngu ɛmɛnɛ mi, Mi gyi te la mi so yi te akwu mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi gba o gbɔ nzu ingbomo nzu ma le. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Kwuwongwu kiya ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi e wo le Ukpo e yese onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kwidu e fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi te e yi ingbomo fo. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />La lu ngbɛndu kaa iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu o so awu li wɔ ma yi mo.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />O zɔ te, La lu Yese lunyi wazhi iso iyi Ukpo mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">lu ya kenzu ngbɛɛ nzhii ba lu kpomo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">mo mi wo kiya ingyi izele mu kwuye yi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">iyi bɔkɔ gba o so yi lala lunyi lu nyama mo.<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba o lafya la udaba uwu uwu Azhu, enzu mbamba o za mba te lo gba lo bo kpɔ kaa lo siso ɛlɛ lo kyo ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ enzu mbamba o kama, Azhu gyɔɔ mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mo, o mbwalu Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba. Umba ba o so mbo iso o ka mba ɛnwu ma, o za mba te lo rima kpakiri mu Ukpo imbwalu ma.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo i shi te enzu umba kwuse kwɔngu ndii gba o kpala ɛlu te lo pwa iso iyi Ɔkwu le.<verse eid="ACT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Tabɔkɔ Azhu o ma enzu gyɔɔ, akwɛyi o wo rise ingyi Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba akwɛyi o zɔ te iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e yi mu isomo awu akwu angba akwɛyi o kpa mba ari. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba o gba mba opwu gedegede te: &lt;&lt;Lunyi gba ki so yi iso iyi Ukpo keyi le, ta bɔkɔ lu to yi mo awu lu zɔ te lu fa la kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ mo, inyi gba i shi ki fulo ki ka mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo le. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Ada Ɔsu Ukpo gba a ta nzu ɔkpa le tee .&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">Mi lɔ yi ma la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo kaa la lu so mbo rɛnu mi. Lunyi lu kwu kyamate ɛbɛ tayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">kaa lo sa enzu mba kwudu kwɔlɛ ma lɛɛ .<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Tabɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo o pwa iso ɛlɛ, o mwu ɔnyɛ akwɛyi ɔ zɔ te iso iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ akwu iso iyeshi; akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa mba kaa lo fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ o kwidu o fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Iso iyi Ukpo i fulama munamuna mu ɛzhi ɛnyi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Watokeyi umba Azhu ba o lo eko umba o yi kwuwo, umba o wuyi iyi Ukpo mbala enzu umbakɔ umba kwuse atiti akwɛyi o yimo la ovyo mbala Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba akwɛyi o ra mba ma mu ɛzhi mba. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba ba o bulɔ kwumburu ungwu alɛ mba ma akwɛyi o lafya la kwuse kwɔngu o ka mu Ikɔniyɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Enzu wa mbwalu mu Atiyɔki ba o yi mbala ɔnyɛ mbala Kwundu uwu Ukpo kwuyengwunanguna.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="ms">Ɔpɔlu Mbala Obanaba O Tanu Iyi Iso Iyi Ukpo Mu Ikɔniyɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Mu Ikɔniyɔ Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba o ka mu udaba uwu uwu Azhu ta bɔkɔ o koko o wo awu. Mɔmɔ o siso ɔnyɛ akwɛyi Azhu mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo o kwidu o fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Azhu umba bɔkɔ o kwidu fulo mo awu, o za la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo te lo nyama la iso ɛnyi mo, kwuwo kwɔngu enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo umbafo o wamba mbala wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba o to kwuye gyɔɔ mɔmɔ mu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi isomo gedegede. Ukpo e shi mbo ekpasu kaa lo wo apula iyi amɛ. E wo ɛlɛ te kaa la zɔ enzu te iso iyi bɔkɔ wa zɛ ilɔ o so awu , te gba iyi le. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Enzu umba kwuse Ikɔniyɔ kwɔngu o ka epo: umbafo o mbwalu Azhu, umbafo ba o mbwalu wa zɛ ilɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo mbala Azhu o wo okwura mbala watokeyi mba kaa lo kpa mba ekyi lo ngbɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba ba o pwa yi akwɛyi o rima o ka mu Olisitira mbala Odebi ese iyi Olikoniya mbala ese iyi bɔkɔ i fula yi ma, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />O kpakpɛ mu anu itama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mɔmɔ.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Kpa Ɔpɔlu Ekyi Mu Olisitira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Onzu ukpɛnyi mu Olisitira mɔmɔ uwu bɔkɔ alɛ wu i kɔma, o mba wu la kinyɛ ba a da zɛma dɛ mo. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Onzu ele a ngbalu kwuyengwu Ɔpɔlu e yi mu iso isomo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi. Ɔpɔlu a bɔ wu eyi shii akwɛyi a ma te onzu ele a nyama te, Ɔzhizɔsi e do wu ofya ibomo mo <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a ya wu ma mu opwu uwɔkɔɔ te, &lt;&lt;Umɛza mi yimo ka rima!&gt;&gt; Mu kwotota kwɔngu e yimo a la kwuzhoto akwɛyi e le mu luzɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Tabɔkɔ riba ingyi enzu mbamba o ma ingyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e wole, o ta opwu okpaa mu ɔnyɛ imuma la isomo mu kenzu unga Olikoniya te, &lt;&lt;Ukpo a vindɔ onzu e bo munyi nzu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />O ya Obanaba te Ɔzayɔ, Ɔpɔlu ba o ya wu te ɛmɛsi kwuwongu uwu gba akwu u to keyi uwu iso isomo le. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Akwɛyi obwoshi uwu eshi iyi Ɔzayɔ, uwu bɔkɔ kunu ungwu eshi wu ku yi kɛlɛ mbala kwuse awu, e bo la endo mbala edodo mu kenzu unga ɔbɛ kwuwongu uwu mbala riba ingyi enzu mbamba o gyi te lo wo isabɔ la Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Tabɔkɔ Obanaba mbala Ɔpɔlu o pwa ɛlɛ o tara ekpayi mba ma o renya o fye mɛmi iyi enzu mbamba la isomo mu opwu uwɔkwu. <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />O zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛza mi kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu wo ɛlɛ? Kinzu tete ki kwu enzu kyamate lunyi te. Ki ka yi la ilɔ iyesheshi, kaa la lu lafya la apula iyi umbwa ɛlɛ kaa la lu mbwalu Ukpo uwu e ye la reyi uwu e wo oshi mbala ɛzhi mbala risu mbala apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ iyi mɛmi yi. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Mu ɔyi uwu ekyi, e shi enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ bi kaa lo mbwalu ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ u she mbo. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Tetete Ukpo a zɔ enzu lɛɛbi te uwu gba e shi nzu apula iyeshi iyinayina le: Uwu gba e shi embyi umboshi le, uwu gba e shi ewiri iyi utu i wɔma, i bwulɔma akwɛyi ii mbomo le; e shi yi kiya ingyirimo kaa lu ri, e shi yi ɔkpara uwu ɛnwu kaa la lu mu ɔnyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Kyo la isomo iyi Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba ɛlɛ lala, o kiri ngbɛɛ de gba o nyi enzu mbɔlɛ isabɔ iwomo la mba le.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Akwɛyi wa to keyi umba Azhu umbafo o wɔ mu Atiyɔki mbala Ikɔniyɔ akwɛyi o za mba te iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e so awu akwu iso iyira. O kpa Ɔpɔlu ekyi akwɛyi o pyipyi wu o wawu ma mu kwuse, o mate naa e kpomoo ŋa. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Akwɛyi wa mbwalu mbamba o bo o fula wu ma, akwɛyi e yimo a gba e fye mu kwuse yimo a gba e fye mu kwuse. Eyi i lama Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba o lafya la kwuse kwɔngu o ka mu Odebi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu Mbala Obanaba O Gbama O Ka Mu Atiyɔki Mu Ɛzhi Iyi Osiriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba o tanu iyi ilɔ iyesheshi mu kwuse kwɔngu akwɛyi o fya wa mbwalu gyɔɔ. Akwɛyi o gba o ka mu Olisitira, Ikɔniyɔ mbala Atiyɔki, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a mbwalu, mega a ma inyashi gyɔɔ mu kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa la mu ɔnyɛ mu ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo moshi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Mu Ɔshɔshi uwunawuna, Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba o ŋa mba enzumbakɔ, o lɛ Ukpo, o wo kenyo akwɛyi o ra mba o lo Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ umba o kwidu o fulo ma wu awu mɔwu. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba o zɛ mu Opisidiya, akwɛyi o ka mu Opafiliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />O tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo mu Opega, akwɛyi o ka Ataliya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />O wɔ mu Ataliya o fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi akwɛyi o gba o ka mu Atiyɔki mbaa bɔkɔ o lɛ mba Ukpo kaa esheshi iyi Ukpo li yi mbala mba kwuwongu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ o mbwa yi iwomo awu. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Tabɔkɔ o bo mu Atiyɔki, o kpala wa mbwalu ɛlu akwɛyi o ba mba ɛza iyi kiya lɛɛbi ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mbo ekpasu bo wo, e kyo e shi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo o na rɛnu ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Akwɛyi o wo afyi gyɔɔ mbala wa mbwalu mɔmɔ.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛlukpalama Iyi Enzu Umbakɔ Mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Enzu umbafo o wɔ mu Ozhudiya o sheye mu Atiyɔki, akwɛyi o za la wa mbwalu ɛzu izɔma te: &lt;&lt;Mɛga o zɛ yi ɛsɔ ma kyamate bɔkɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi i zɔ tayi, mo lu fya isama mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Ɔpɔlu mbaIa Obanaba ba o nyama la iso mba ɛlɛ mo akwɛyi kaambu ungaku ke fye mekeka mba. Akwɛyi enzu umbakɔ umba Ɔshɔshi o ŋa Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba mbala enzu wa mbwalu mbafo te lo kala wa zɛ ilɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ iso ɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Akwɛyi wa mbwalu umba Atiyɔki o shi mbo kiya ingyi luzɛ akwɛyi o wo mbo ungbo. Tabɔkɔ o fulomo, o zɛ mu ɛzhi iyi Ofonishiya mbala Osamariya, akwɛyi o ba ɛza la wa mbwalu ewo iyi bɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo o fulowa o mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi. Ɛza ɛlɛ i shi wa mbwalu ubwu uruwu gyɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba o bo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, ɔshɔshi mbala wa zɛ ilɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ o bwamba ma, akwɛyi o ba mba ɛza ɛlɛ lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mbo ekpasu bɔkɔ umba o wo.<verse eid="ACT 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Akwɛyi wa mbwalu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o yi egbo ikpɛnyi mbala Afarisi o yimo o rima akwɛyi o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi akwu mega te o zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma, kaa lo gba lo lomo la ɛrama iyi Omosisi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Wa zɛ ilɔ mbala enzumbakɔ umba ɔshɔshi o ŋɔma kaa lo yese ɛlɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />O ri kaambu mu iso ɛlɛ gyɔɔ, akwɛyi Opita e yimo a rima, a za mba te: &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, lunyi lu yitu te mekyeki Ukpo a ŋa enzu mekeka yi te enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo lo pwa iso iyi Ukpo mu kenzu mi, kaa lo nyama la yi. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yitu iyi egbo iyi onzu awu, a zɔ yi te a nyama la mba kwuwongu e shi mbo Kwundu uwu Ukpo, kyamate ba e shi nzu awu. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ukpo a zɔ uwewe kusɛ mo, mo a wulu akɔ mba ma kwuwongu ikwidufulo mbo mu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu gyi te la lu pwa Ukpo ma bɔkɔ lu fulo wa mbwalu mbɔlɛ ewulo iyɔlu iyi bɔkɔ kinzu mbala asɔku nzu lala ki do yi shimo mo? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ayi mo! Kinzu ki shi egbo te akwu kwuwongu esheshi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi gba ki fya isama le, kyamate umba o tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Enzu umba o gyirima lɛɛbi awu o gbo ndii ta bɔkɔ o ngbɛ kwɔlu mu ɛza iyi o ba mba awu. Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba o ba mba ɛza iyi apula iyi kenzu iyama bɔkɔ Ukpo e shimbo o wo meka iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o mbwa iso isomo lɛɛbi, akwɛyi Ozhemisi e yimo a gba opwu te: &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, la lu ngbɛ alu mu iso mi. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Ɔsamɔ uwu o ya wu te Opita awu a ba nzu ɛza kwonze te, Ukpo e yi egbo mu enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, akwɛyi a ŋa enzu umbafo lɛnwu wu meka mba kaa lakwu umba wu. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu o so i nyama la ɛlɛ kyamate bɔkɔ o ka awu te:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />&lt; Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ Imi Ɔkwu mii gbama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">mii gba la kwogba ungwu Odevidi imbomo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Ɛrizhi ɛnyi mii gba ya la imbomo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">akwɛyi mi gba ngwu la inɔngɔma,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />kaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o shimo awu lo gagyi Ɔkwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo lɛɛbi, umba bɔkɔ o ya mba o ba la ɛnyi mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Imi Ɔkwu gba mi so ɛlɛ le.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Mi so yi mi shi mɛzhi mekyeki.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Ozhemisi a zɔ kpɔ te, &lt;&lt;Mu imama mi, enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ifulowa bo mba Ukpo awu la ki fulo mbo ewulo iyɔlu mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Kinzu ba la ki ka mba kwupu te, lo ri ewiri iyi bɔkɔ o wo isabɔ la eshi mo, lo yama mo, lo kwu ivye iyi izɔfyi uwu ɛnzhi wu o fumo mo mo, ba lo kwu ɛnzhi mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Mekyeki, ɛrama iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi Omosisi o ye yi mu iwama mu kwuse ungwunanguna mu idaba iyi Azhu orondo orondo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enzumbakɔ Umba Ɔshɔshi O Ka Kwupwu Laa Wambwalu Umba Bɔkɔ Akwu Azhu Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Akwɛyi wa zɛ ilɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ mbala enzu umba ɔshɔshi lɛɛbi, o nyama te lo ŋa enzu umbafo kaa lo lɔ mba ma mu Atiyɔki lo zɛ mbala Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba. Akwɛyi o ŋa Ozhudasi uwu o ya wu te Obasaba mbala Osalasi, enzu wepo mbɔlɛ akwu wa to keyi mekeka iyi ɛmɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />O kakwupu o shi mbo te:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Kinzu wa zɛ ilɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ, mbala ɛmanyi yi gba ki ka yi kwupwu kwɔlɛ le,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Lunyi wa mbwalu umba lu kwu Azhu mo bɔkɔ lu yi mu Atiyɔki, Osiriya mbala Osilisiya:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Ki gbɛlɛ yi ɛnyi.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Ki pwa te enzu umbafo mekeka nzu umba ki lɔ mba ma mo o wɔ o ka munyi yi o wo yi egbo gididi, o tutu yi egbo mo kwongwu iso iyi o so. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Akwɛyi kpɛkpɛ nzu ki nyama te la ki ŋa enzu umbafo kaa la ki lɔ mba ma munyi yi, umba mbala ɛmɛza nzu kasɛkɛ Obanaba mbala Ɔpɔlu. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Enzu mbɔlɛ o ra lakwunyɔ mba o shi kwuwongu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Kwuwo kwɔngu ki lɔ Ozhudasi mbala Osalasi te lo so kaa lo so yi iso iyi bɔkɔ ki ka mu kwupu kwɔlɛ awu. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo a zɔ nzu te, la ki fulo yi ewulo iyɔlu mo, lunyi ba la lu mbwalu ɛrama ɛlɛ te: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />lunyi ba la lu ri ewiri iyi bɔkɔ o wo isabɔ la eshi mo, la lu yama mo, la lu kwu ivye iyi izɔfyi uwu ɛnzhi wu o fumo mo mo, ba lo kwu ɛnzhi mo. Gba lu mbwa ɛrama ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i shoshi.</para>
  <para style="pmc" vid="ACT 15:29">Ukpo le yi mbala yi.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Enzu mbɔlɛ o fye alɔgbulɔ mo akwɛyi o to ɔgwuzɛ mba o ka mu Atiyɔki, o kpala enzu umba ɔshɔshi ɛlu akwɛyi o shi mbo kwupu kwɔlɛ mɔmɔ . <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Tabɔkɔ o wa mbakwupu kwɔlɛ ma, enzu o mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu iso ɛlɛ i ka mba ɛnwu ma. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Ozhudasi mbala Osalasi, umba ba akwu anukenzu tete awu, o so ɛmɛnɛ iso gyɔɔ kaa lo ka mba ɛnwu ma lo shi mbo ekpasu. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Alɔgbulɔ umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o wo afyi bwɛ mbala mba mu Atiyɔki, akwɛyi ɛmɛnɛ mbamba o fye mbo mo o wo mbo ungbo laa ɔnyɛ akwɛyi o kama iyamba mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o lɔ mba ma awu. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Osalasi ba a ma te i she wu woshi te la ŋɔma mu mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba ba o rima mu Atiyɔki. Mɔmɔ umba mbala enzu umbafo gyɔɔ o zɔ ɛzu mbala anu itama iyi iso iyi Ɔkwu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu mbala Obanaba O Kama Mbala Esu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Mizhikembo iyi kwuye bwɛɛ akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a za la Obanaba te, &lt;&lt;La ki gba la ifulama mu ese iyi bɔkɔ ki tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo awu kaa la ki ma luzɛ mba mu iso iyi Ukpo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Obanaba a gyi te Ɔzhɔnu uwu o ya wu te Omaki awu le somo mbala mba. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Ɔpɔlu ba a ma te i ye mbo ɔnyɛ mo gba a kama mbala mba, kwongwu bɔkɔ a ri ɛnya e shimbo mu Opafiliya, a lafya la ɛduma iwomo mbala mba. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />O ri kaambu gyɔɔ mbala esu akwɛyi onzonzu e to ɔgwuzɛ wu. Obanaba e to Omaki o fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi akwɛyi o to ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ɔsapurɔ, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Ɔpɔlu ba e to Osalasi ma, akwɛyi ɛmɛnɛ o lɛ Ukpo te le gbo mbomo mu luzɛ mba akwɛyi o kama. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />A zɛ mu Osiriya mbala Osilisiya akwɛyi a ka wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ɛnwu ma.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Otimoti A Mbwalu Ɔpɔlu Mbala Osayilasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Ɔpɔlu e bo mu Odebi mbala Olisitira, mɔmɔ gba u vɔngɔ kiya uwu o ya wu te Otimoti e yi le, uwu anyi wu akwu Ozhudiya u mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ete wu ba akwu Ogiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Ɛmɛnɛ mu Olisitira mbala Ikɔniyɔ o siso iyeshi mekeka iyi Otimoti. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Ɔpɔlu ba a gyi te la za wu le so mo, kwuwo kwɔngu a zɛ wu ɛsɔ ma dɛ kwongwu Azhu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɛzhi ɛnyi, lɛɛbi mba o yitu te ete uwu Otimoti akwu Ogiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Tabɔkɔ o ka mese mese, o so la enzu iso iyi bɔkɔ wa zɛ ilɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o zɔ te lo wo. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Akwɛyi ikwu idu fulo iyi wa mbwalu ikyo ekpasu ma, wa mbwalu ba o kwo mu riba ikyomo kwɔfyi kwɔfyi.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Ma Ɛbɛ Mekeka Iyi Onzu Uwu Omasedoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Ɔpɔlu mbala enzu umba o zɛ mbala wu o fulama mɛzhi iyi Ofirigiya mbala Ogalatiya, moo Kwundu uwu Ukpo a nya mba ma te lo tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya mo. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o bo mu Omisiya, o gyi te lo fye mu Obitiniya, Kwundu uwu Ɔzhizɔsi ba a nya mba ma mo. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Akwɛyi o zɛ mu Omisiya o ka mu Oturowa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Mutu ɔnwu Ɔpɔlu a ma ɛbɛ te, onzu uwu Omasedoniya uwufo e bo munyi wu akwɛyi a kpa wu ɛshɛku te, &lt;&lt;Sama kaa bo mu Omasedoniya ka mbwa nzu ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔpɔlu a mbwa ɛbɛ imama, akwɛyi ki nɔngɔ ewulo nzu ma efyefya akwɛyi ki to ɔgwuzɛ uwu Omasedoniya, kwongwu ki shi egbo nzu te Ukpo gba a ya nzu ma le te la ki za mba rɛnu wu.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olidiya A Na Rɛnu Ingyi Ukpo Mu Ofilipiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Ki fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi mu Oturowa akwɛyi ki to ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo ki ka mu Osamoteresi, akwɛyi eyi i lama ki fye mu Oniyapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Ki fulomo mɔmɔ akwɛyi ki ka mu Ofilipayi, kwuse ungwu kwu ka mɛzhi iyi Omasedoniya, mekyi ungwu kwu yi mu ewo iyi Oroma. Ki ŋɔ mɔmɔ afyi gyɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo, ki wɔ kwudu ki zɛ mu kenzugwu unga kwuse ki ka mu kenzu unga ɔkwu mba bɔkɔ ki mate ki fya riyi ingyi Ukpo ilɛma. Ki ŋɔma akwɛyi eko umba bɔkɔ o gyirima mɔmɔ awu ki le mbo mu iso isomo. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Oko uwufo uwu o ya wu te Olidiya e kyo e yi mekeka iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu alu ingbɛma awu, e fulo ewo iyi ekpayi iwembi, a wɔ mu kwuse ungwu Otiyatira, oko ele akwu u mbwalu Ukpo. Ukpo a wu egbo wu ma akwɛyi a nyama mu iso iyi Ɔpɔlu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Mizhikembo iyi uwu mbala agba wu o wo obatisima, akwɛyi a za nzu te la ki so mogba wu. A zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Gba lu nyama ngboro te, imi mi kwu u mbwalu Ɔkwu, la lu bo kaa la lu gbo mi oga mogba mi.&gt;&gt; E bwu nzu mo nzhii ba ki nyama ki mbwalu wu.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Ta Ɔpɔlu Mbala Osayilasi Mu Ugu ugyi Mu Ofilipiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ɔnu uwufo ki wɔ ki she mu riyi ingyi Ukpo ilɛma, umoko unye uwu e yi ɛndu iyira iyi ba e kwu epa ma yi a wɔ e kpolo nzu. A fya eduwo gyɔɔ la enzu wu mu epa ikwumo ɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Umoko ele a mbwalu Ɔpɔlu mbala nzu, la uzhi iwomo te, &lt;&lt;Enzu mbɔlɛ akwu ɛmɛgba umba Ukpo uwakwuu, o so yi iso iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu isama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Te gba e koko e wo le nzhii ba afyi gyɔɔ, ɛlɛ i shi Ɔpɔlu e wo amba akwɛyi a mwanya e geleyi a za la ɛndu iyira ɛnyi te, &lt;&lt;Mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Mi za ŋa te wɔma mu umoko ele!&gt;&gt; Mɔmɔ ɛndu iyira i lu wu afyima.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Tabɔkɔ enzu umba umoko unye ele o ma te ɔgwuzɛ uwu eduwo ifyama mba u semo-o, akwɛyi o yi Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi o pyipyi mbo o ka mba mu idu iyi enzu umbakɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />O kamba mu idu iyi wa zɔ ombu akwɛyi o zɔ te, Enzu mbɔlɛ akwu Azhu, o yi mu ovyo itama mu kwuse kwɔlɛ <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />o zɔ enzu ɛzu te lo wo apula iyi bɔkɔ ɛrɛma nzu Oroma i nyama te la ki wo mo naa la ki vɔngɔ yi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Akwɛyi riba ingyi enzu mbamba o le mu Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi ɛmu ikpama, akwɛyi wa zɔ ombu o zɔ te lo lu mbo ekpayi ma akwɛyi o za la asozha te lo kpa mba ikpa. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Mizhikembo iyi o mbwa mba ikpa ireyi ikpama, akwɛyi o ta mba mu ugu ugyi, akwɛyi o za la onzu u gbomo te le gbo mbo mo ɔnyɛnyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" /><note caller="+" style="f" />Tabɔkɔ a na ɔkpa ele ma, akwɛyi a ta mba mu ugu ugyi uwu ɛmɛ mi akwɛyi a ta mba kwutoshi.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Mu utuweka Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi o yi mu Ukpo ilɛma mbala amu itama iyi iduma la Ukpo, umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ugu ugyi kya awu ba o yi mu alu ingbɛma. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Kporo ba ɛzhi i dungɔma giri nzhii ba ɔla uwu Ugugyi e wo akpa, akwɛyi ikwu iyi ugu ugyi awu lɛɛbi i wuma, erimoki iyi o kpa uwewe akyi awu i vuvuma. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />U gbo ugu ugyi awu a nyeyimo mondo, tabɔkɔ a mate ikwu iyi ugu ugyi i yɛwu, akwɛyi a wa la ukpandɛrɛ wu kaa la ngbɛ ɛnwu ma kwuwongu a ma te umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ugu ugyi awu o rima lɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu ba a tara oga a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ki ngbɛ ɛŋɔ ma mo! Kpɛkpɛ nzu ki yi munɛ!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />U gbo ugu ugyi awu a zɔ tee lo ka wu laa ɔyi, e fye mɛmi efyefya akwɛyi a ta mɛzhi la ipwulama mu idu iyi Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Akwɛyi u gbo ugu ugyi awu a wa mba kwudu akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Ada umbagba, kimbe ba mii wo bo sa mi ma?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />O gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Kwidu fulo mu Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi, ŋɔɔ fya isama ma, uŋɔ mbala agba ŋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi o ta wu anu iyi rɛnu ingyi Ɔkwu uwu mbala enzu lɛɛbi umba kwogba wu. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Mu utu ɔnwu, u gbo ugu ugyi awu akwu mba ma a gbɔ mba ashinakpa mba ma; akwɛyi uwu mbala agba wu o wo mbo obatisima kɛlɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />U gbo ugu ugyi e bo mbo mu kwogba wu akwɛyi e shi mbo kiya ingyi rimo; ɔnyɛ a nyɔlɔ wu ma kwuwongu uwu mbala agba wu o nyama la Ukpo.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Bɔkɔ eyi i lama, wa zɔ ombu o lɔ asozha ma mbaa u gbo ugu ugyi awu te: &lt;&lt;La lu lafya la Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Akwɛyi u gbo ugu ugyi ele a za la Ɔpɔlu te, &lt;&lt;Wa zɔ ombu o lɔma te, lo lunyi afyima. Kekelele la lu sheyimo kya yi bi. La lu somo mu oloto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ɔpɔlu ba a za la asozha mbamba te: &lt;&lt;O byi nzu ɛmu mu okpulo gedegede o yo kwuyo ungwu kwuyi ungwu ombu dɛ mo, kinzu ba ki kwu ɛmɛ umba Oroma, o ta nzu mu ugu ugyi. Akwɛyi kekelele ba o gyi te lo wa nzu ma kyokyokyo? Ayimo yimo! Lo bo lo wa nzu ma mafyi mba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Tabɔkɔ asozha mbamba o gba yi o ka la enzu wa zɔ ombu, akwɛyi kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o pwa te Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi akwu ɛmɛ umba Oroma, iyi i wo mbo mo. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />O bo o ta mba mɛzhi akwɛyi o wa mba ma mu ugu ugyi awu, akwɛyi o kpa mba ɛshɛku te lo lafya la kwuse kwɔngu. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi o wɔ ma mu ugu ugyi, o ka mu kwogba ungwu Olidiya, mɔmɔ o kpolesu mbala ɛmɛnɛ akwɛyi o so mbo iso iyi i kɔ mba ɛnwu ma. Akwɛyi o lafya la kwuse kwɔngu.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu Mbala Osalasi Mu Otesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi ɔ zɛ mu ese iyi Afipoli mbala Apoloniya akwɛyi o bo mu Otesalonika mbaa bɔkɔ udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu e yi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />mate bɔkɔ e koko e wo awu, Ɔpɔlu a ka mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu, afyi iyi ɛnwu igbomo ela a ma mu kaambu irimo mbala mba mu iso Ukpo, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />a lunyi mba ma a gba zɔ yi mba gedegede te, akwu ɛga te Okrasi e kpomo akwɛyi a gba lakwunyɔ iyimo. Ɔpɔlu a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi uwu mi ba yi ɛza wu ele uwu gba akwu Okrasi le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Azhu mbafo o nyama la iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e so mbo awu akwɛyi o kyo mbala Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi. Enzu umba Ogiriki gyɔɔ umba o yi iyi iyi Ukpo mbala eko umba enzu umbakwu riba o kyo mbala mba tete. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Azhu umbafo ba o wo rise iyi Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi; akwɛyi o ka mu rishi o ko gagyi ɛmɛ umbira, akwɛyi o kpala enzu umba ovyo ɛlu, akwɛyi o so mu ovyo iwomo mu kwuse. O gyakpɔ o ka mu kwogba ungwu Ɔzhasɔ mbaa Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi igagyima kaa lo wa mba kwudu lo shi enzu umba riba mbamba. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Tabɔkɔ o du mbo mo, akwɛyi o pyipyi Ɔzhasɔ mbala wa mbwalu umbafo o ka mba mu idu iyi enzu umbakɔ umba kwuse, o za la uzhi iwomo te: &lt;&lt;Enzu mbɔlɛ o yi mu ovyo itama munamuna, ba o bo mu kwuse nzu tete-e. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Ɔzhasɔ ba a na mba e shi mbo mu kwogba wu. Lɛɛbi mba o fo ɛrɛma iyi Osiza ma, o zɔ te, Ɔsu uwufo e yi, o ya wu te Ɔzhizɔsi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Tabɔkɔ riba ingyi enzu mbamba mbala wa to keyi umba kwuse o pwa iso ɛlɛ akwɛyi egbo mbo i tutumo. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Akwɛyi o shi Ɔzhasɔ mbala wa mbwalu umbafo te lo shi ekpa akwɛyi o lu mba afyima o kama.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu Mbala Osayilasi Mu Oberiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Tabɔkɔ utu u kpomo, wa mbwalu o wo Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi ungbo te lo sheyi mu Oberiya. Tabɔkɔ o kama mɔmɔ, o to ɔgwuzɛ uwu Udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Enzu umba Obiriya o yi egbo iyi iso inama mu akɔ mba o ka enzu umba Otesalonika ma, kwuwongu o gyikpɔ te lo pwa iso ɛlɛ akwɛyi o manda iso ɛnyi ma kwɔfyi kwɔfyi kaa lo yitu ongbulolo iyi iso iyi Ɔpɔlu bɔkɔ e so awu. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Azhu gyɔɔ mbala eko umba inzubɛkwu mbala anzɔnu umba Ogiriki o na iso iyi Ukpo.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Tabɔkɔ Azhu umba Otesalonika o pwa te Ɔpɔlu e yi mu rɛnu ingyi Ukpo anu itama mu Oberiya, akwɛyi o ka mɔmɔ tete, o le mu enzu egbo iyimo, o lo mbo atiti. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Kɛlɛlɛ akwɛyi ɛmɛnɛ o fye Ɔpɔlu ma o ka wa mu kenzu unga risu, Osalasi mbala Otimoti ba ɔ ŋɔ iyamba mu Obiriya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Enzu wa mbwalu o fye Ɔpɔlu ma nzhii ba o kawa mu Atɛsi akwɛyi o lu wu afyima, e shi mbo ilɔ te lo za la Osalasi mbala Otimoti te lo du wu efyefya.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu Mu Kwuse Ungwu Atɛsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e rigbo Osalasi mbala Otimoti mu Atɛsi, egbo wu itutumo gyɔɔ kwongwu bɔkɔ a ma eshi munamuna mu kwuse kwɔngu. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Kwuwo kwɔngu kwɔfyi kwɔfyi a ka mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu mu eza ibama mbala Azhu mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo bɔkɔ o gbo Ukpo oya awu, ikyo a ka mu rishi mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ e du mbo mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Wa zɔ ɛzu umbafo umba o ya mba te Epikuriyani mbala umba Ositoki o le mu kaambu irimo mbala Ɔpɔlu. Umbafo mba o yo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba u wo uzhi le e yi mu isomo?&gt;&gt; Umbafo ba o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;I yi mate e yi mu anu itama iyi rɛnu ingyi Ukpo uwepo.&gt;&gt; O so ɛlɛ kwuwo ngwu Ɔpɔlu e yi mu rɛnu itama iyi iso iyeshi mekeka iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala igba la kwunyɔ iyimo. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Akwɛyi o to Ɔpɔlu o kawa mbaa udaba uwu Areyopagusu, o za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ki gyi te la ki yitu iyi ɛzɔ iyepo ɛlɛ bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi mu izɔma le? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Mo ŋɔ ka nzu la ɛzɔ iyepo, ki gyi te la ki yitu kimbe ba akwu iluma yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Ɛmɛ umba Atɛsi lɛɛbi mbala agboga umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ o ngbɛ kwuye mba mu iso isomo mbala alu ingbɛma mu ɛzɔ iyepo ɛlɛ.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu e yimo a rima mu udaba uwu Areyopagusu ele a zɔ te: &lt;&lt;Enzu umba Atɛsi! Mi ma yi te mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna lu kwu enzu umba o mbwalu Ukpo riba riba. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kwuwongwu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi yi mu ifulama, mi ngbɛndu mu apula iyi lu gbo yi oya, mi ma kwɔla ungwu isabo ungwu o ka ɛnyi mangwu te, &lt;Laa UKPO uwu o yi wu mo.&gt; Kekelele, Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ lu gbo wu oya ba lu yi wu mo awu, uwu gba mi ye yi mu iso wu isomo le.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Ukpo ele e wo kwudu mbala apula iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ e yi mɛmi yi, uwu gba akwu Ukpo uwoshi mbala ɛzhi le, uwu a ŋɔ mu ɛtɛpu uwu enzu o mbo le mo. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Ukpo ele e yi ugɔ uwu kiya moo a gyi imbwama iyi enzu mo mu ɛduma iyi ewo mo, kyamate e yi ugɔ tayi, kwongwu uwu mu afyi wu gba enzu lɛɛbi kwunyɔ mbala ɛnyɔ ifumo mbala ingyinangyina le. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Ɛdɔ iyi enzu iyinayina lɛɛbi i ngyi mu onzu ɛnyi, kaa lo nyɔlɔ kwudu kwɔlɛ ma; akwɛyi uwu a ka mba kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o wo mbala mbaa bɔkɔ ese i yi le. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Ukpo e wo ɛlɛ kaa enzu lo gagyi wu akwɛyi ingboshimo oo gagyi wu kego ba o fye wu mo, mekyeki uwu a ndama mbala ukpɛnyɛnyi nzu mo. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />&lt;Moo mawu gba ki yi le, gba ki kpa ɛvyɛ le, gba e shi ki yi kwunyɔ le.&gt; Mate bɔkɔ aba iyayi iyifo i zɔ, &lt;Ki kwu Ɛmɛ wu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ishi gba ki kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo, la ki byi egbo te Ukpo eyi mate uwɔ uwu ogolu naa osiliva nana kwoki ungwu bɔkɔ onzu mu ilukwu wu e mbo le mo. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Mekyeki Ukpo e to iyitumo iyi enzu te a kwa wu kiya mo, ɔbulɛ kekelele a ta okpa te enzu lɛɛbi munamuna lo lafya la iyira iwomo. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Moo a zɔ kwɔfyi diridiri-e ungwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ uwu a ŋa le, aa zɔ ombu la uwewe mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mu ongbulolo. e wo kiya ngyi bɔkɔ enzu o nyama la ngyi lɛɛbi, <verse eid="ACT 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o pwa iso iyi igba la iyimo iyi ukpɛzhi, umbafo mba o wo ɛnɛ, mbafo ba o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;ki gyi te la ki pwa ŋa kpɔ mu iso ɛlɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Kwuwo ungwu ɛlɛ, akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a wɔma mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Umbafo bwɛ mekeka mba o mbwalu Ɔpɔlu akwɛyi o shi egbo mbo. Umba bɔ o kyo mbala mba gba akwu Odiyonisiyu, uwu bɔkɔ e kyo mu udaba uwu Areyopagusu, tete oko uwufo uwu o ya wu te Odamarisu, mbala umbafo gyɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu Mu Okoroti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ Ɔpɔlu a lafya la Atɛsi a ka mu Ɔkɔrɛti. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />E kpolo onzu uwu Azhu uwufo uwu o ya wu te Akwila uwu a wɔ mu Opotusu; e ngyi iyepo mu Itili mbala oko wu uwu o ya wu te Opirisila, kwongwu Ɔkaladiyɔ a ta okpa te Azhu lɛɛbi lɔ lafya la Oromu. Ɔpɔlu ba a ka te la ma Akwila mbala Opirisila, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />akwɛyi kwongwu akwu u ndo ɛtɛti mate umba tayi awu, a ŋɔ mbala mba o wo ɛduma kyaa. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ungwunanguna Ɔpɔlu a ka mu udaba uwu Azhu la lɔɔmbu irimo mu iso iyi Ukpo mbala Azhu ikyo Agiriki ka le bwu mbo mo ka lo na iso iyi bɔkɔ e yembo mu isomo.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />kwuyengwu Osalasi mbala Otimoti ɔ wɔ mu Omasedoniya o bo, Ɔpɔlu a rala ɛnwu e shi ndii mu anu itama mbala izɔgɔ itomo laa enzu umba Azhu te Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu u sa enzu le. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Azhu ba o towu wu mo akwɛyi o kpa wu ari, akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a bwulɔ kwumburu ungwu ekpayi wu ma, za mba te &lt;&lt; Ɛnzhii yi o yi mu reshi yi! Kwukyikyi yi kwu wɔma mu kwɔrɔ mi ee. Mi yimo munɛ le mi sheye mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo ŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a lafya la udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu a ka mu kwogba ungwu Ɔtatɔ Ɔzhɔsitu u mbwalu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ kwogba wu ku yi kɛlɛ mbala udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu awu. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Okirisipu u to keyi uwu udaba uwu Azhu mbala a gba wu lɛɛbi mbala enzu umba Ɔkɔrɛti gyɔɔ o umba bɔkɔ o pwa iso iyi Ɔpɔlu o na iso iyi Ukpo akwɛyi o wo mbo obatisima.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Mu utu uwufo Ɔpɔlu a ma ɛbɛ te Ukpo e so iso mbala wu, a za wu te &lt;&lt; Ki wuyi mo; kpakpɛɛ mu iso isomo, ki kpala kenzu ŋɔ ma mo. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Mo mi yi mbala ŋa, onzu uwunawuna e do ŋɔ ira iwomo mo kwongwu mi yi enzu riba mu kwuse ngwɔlɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Ɔpɔlu a ŋɔ mu Ɔkɔrɛtiya kari la kwurizhi mu iso iyi Ukpo izɔma.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />kwuyengwu Ogaliyo akwu ɔsu uwu Akaya, Azhu umba bɔkɔ o gyi Ɔpɔlu mo awu o kpala o shi wu akwɛyi o yi wu mo akwɛyi o kawa wu mu udaba uwu Ɔsu Ogaliyo kaa lo fu wu ombwu. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />O za la Ogaliyo te, &lt;&lt; Onzu ele, e yi mu enzu ibumo te lo lɛ Ukpo mu ɛgwuzɛ iyi i fo ɛrama ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a ba ya kenzu mo te le so iso de Ogaliyo a za la Azhu tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi Azhu, gba la lu zɔ te ombu uwu lu bo wu ele akwu te onzu ele e wo izumbira iyɛku de ba mi ngbɛ kwɔlu mu iso yi ɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ombwu uwu lu bo wu ele ba akwu ombu uwu kaambu irimo meka iyi iso mbala ɛnyi mbala ɛrama yi awu, la lu so kaa lu zɔ kyayi ma mafyi yi. Mi kwu u zɔ ombu mu iso ɛlɛ te mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Akwɛyi e shi o ra mba ma mu udaba. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Akwɛyi enzu riba mbɔlɛ o fulowa o kpo Osositini u to keyi uwu udaba uwu Azhu mɛnwu, akwɛyi o byi wu ɛmu mɔmɔ mu idu iyi Ogaliyo, Ogaliyo ba a pwa mba ɛkwu mo.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Gba A Kama Mu Atiyɔki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Ɔpɔlu e wo afyi gyɔɔ mu Ɔkɔrɛtiya dɛ gba a lafya la wa mbwalu mɔmɔ akwɛyi uwu mbala Opirisila mbala Akwila o fye mu kwɔda ungwu embyi o ka mu Osiriya le. Mu Osekiriya, a ngbɛ inyi wu ma kwongwu ivungɔma iyi bɔkɔ uwu e wo. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />O ka mu Ɛfɛsɔ akwɛyi Ɔpɔlɔ a za la Opirisila mbala Akwila te lo rigbo wu mɔmɔ. Akwɛyi uwu ba e fye mu udaba uwu Azhu mbaa kaambu irimo mbala Azhu. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Wambwalu o za wu te la ŋɔ mbala mba le kyoo, uwu ba e tomo. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ a ŋa lu mba afyima, a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Mi gba minyɔ gba Ukpo a nyama.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi e fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi a lafya la Ɛfɛsɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Tabɔkɔ a kama mu Oseseriya, akwɛyi a ka gbɛlɛ wa mbwalu ɛnyi akwɛyi a ka mu Atiyɔki.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Mizhikembo iyi e to kwuye mu Atiyɔki, akwɛyi a lafya la mɔmɔ a ka mu ese ikikɔ ikikɔ mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalatiya mbala Ofirigiya a kɔ wa vɔngɔ kiya ɛnwu ma.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolosi Mu Ɛfisu Mbala Ɔkɔrɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Kwuye kwɔngu onzu uwu Azhu uwufo o ya wu te Apɔlɔsi a wɔ kusɛ ungwu Alɛkizandariya e bo mu Ɛfɛsɔ. Onzu ele akwu onzu uwu e yi iyitu gyɔɔ mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo ba e siso kego. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Onzu ele a vɔngɔ ɛzu iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo gyɔɔ, ba e siso iyi Ukpo la ɔnyɛ mbala enzu ɛzu izɔma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi kyori kyori. Uwu ba e yi iyitu iyi obatisima uwu Ɔzhɔnu kɛɛkyi bi. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Tabɔkɔ Opirisila mbala Akwila o pwa wu te e so iso la ɛkpasu mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu, akwɛyi o za wu te le so mu kwogba mba akwɛyi o zɔ wu ɛzu iyi iso iyi Ukpo kaa le yi yi marimari.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Apɔlɔsi a gyite le so mu Akaya, wa mbwalu o kawu ɛnwu ma akwɛyi o kakwupu la wabwalu mɔmɔ te lɔ na wu ewo epo. Bɔkɔ a kama mɔmɔ, a mbwa ma la enzu gyɔɔ umba bɔkɔ o na rɛnu ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi kwongwu esheshi iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ɔpɔlu e ri kaambwu mbala Azhu gedegede te, umba o wo ɔnyɛ mo, akwɛyi a zɔ mba mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo te Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu Okrasi le.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu Mu Ɛfɛsɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Apɔlɔsi e yi mu Ɔkɔrɛti, Ɔpɔlu a zɛ mu ese iyi Ofirigiya mbala ɛzhi iyi Ogalatiya akwɛyi a ka mu Ɛfɛsɔ. Mɔmɔ e du enzu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi umbafo <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />akwɛyi e yo mbo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu na Ɔzhizɔsi awu, Kwundu uwu Ukpo e bo ma yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">O gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ayimo, kinzu lala ki pwa te Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi dɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Ba obatisima uwuna bɔkɔ o wo yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">O gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Obatisima uwu Ɔzhɔnu uwu bɔkɔ e siso mekeka wu awu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Ɔpɔlu a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Obatisima uwu Ɔzhɔnu akwu uwu enzu lo kwu ira ɔsu. A gba a za la enzu te lo shi egbo mu onzu uwu e yi mu inyɔma mu izhikembo wu, uwu gba akwu, Ɔzhizɔsi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Tabɔkɔ enzu o pwa iso iyi Ɔpɔlu e so awu, akwɛyi o wo mbo obatisima mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, Ɔpɔlu e fulo mbo ewo mu reshi, akwɛyi kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye ma mba, akwɛyi o so iso mu lunzu undepo akwɛyi o zɛ ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />O yi ta enzu wewo te lɛɛbi mba.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Evya ɛla Ɔpɔlu e koko a ka mu udaba uwu Azhu, mɔmɔ e so mbo iso mu iyi mo, e koko e bwu mbo mo mu iso isomo mekeka iyi iso iyi irɛsu iyi ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Enzu umbafo mba o kɔ egbo mo ba o nyama la iso iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e so mbo le mo akwɛyi, o so iso iyira iyi iso ɛlɛ pepee. Kwuwo kwɔngu Ɔpɔlu a lu mba afyima, a zɛ mbala wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi umbafo ma mbala wu, akwɛyi kwɔfyi kwɔfyi a ka mba mu ɛzu izɔma mu igwu iyɛkwu iyi ɛzu izɔma iyi Otiranu. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Ɔpɔlu e koko wo ɛlɛ nzhii ba lɔri lopo, ɛlɛ i shi Azhu lɛɛbi mbala enzu umba Ogiriki umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya o pwa iso iyi Ɔkwu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛmɛ Umba Osiva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Ukpo e shi Ɔpɔlu ekpasu akwɛyi e wo apula iyi kenzu iyama iyɛku gyɔɔ, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />kwuwo ngwɔlɛ enzu, kukokpayi ungwu anu wu mbala ɔmu uwu ɛduma wu o kawa mbaa enzu umba efya o kpa yi mba mɛnwu, akwɛyi efya mba i bomo; ɛndu iyira tete i lu mba afyima.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Azhu umbafo, tete o kpa ɛvyɛ munamuna mu ɛndu iyira iwɔma, o gyi te lo wo ɛduma mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi ka lo rala ɛndu iyira ma mu ɛnwu iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi ɛndu iyira. O zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, uwu Ɔpɔlu a tanu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi awu, mi za ŋa te wɔma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Ɛmɛ umba Osiva, u to keyi uwu ebwoshi uwu Azhu, o yi mu ɛlɛ iwomo tete. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ɔnu uwufo ɛndu iyira i gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Imi mi yi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Ɔpɔlu, uŋɔ ba ŋɔ kwu uwe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Akwɛyi onzu ele uwu e yi ɛndu iyira le e ye piriri a la ma mba, akwɛyi a bi mba ɛmu nzhii ba a nɛ mba kanɛ, e pye mbo ɛriga ma akwɛyi o wɔ kwudu la ɛnya mu kwogba kwɔngu.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Azhu mbala enzu umba Ogiriki umba bɔ o yi Ɛfɛsɔ o pwa iso ɛlɛ, lɛɛbi mba iyi i wo mbo mo, akwɛyi ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi i fya iduma gyɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Enzu umbafo gyɔɔ umba bɔkɔ o nyama la iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, o bo o ta mɛzhi akwɛyi o kwo mu enzu isomo ira iyi bɔkɔ umba o wo pepee. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Enzu gyɔɔ wa kwu ɛpa o bo la ekpo iyi apula iyi ɛpa ikwumo mba akwɛyi o pwu yi mo mu eyi iyi enzu. O lo eduwo iyi apula ɛnyi mesu, abwa yi akwu eduwo edubu uwɛkpɛlɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />kwongwu ɔlɛ, rɛnu ingyi Ukpo ri so mu iyama munamuna akwɛyi enzu gyɔɔ ba o na ngyi ma.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ovyo Mu Ɛfɛsɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ lɛɛbi, Ɔpɔlu a ka amasa te e re mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, a zɛ mu Omasedoniya mbala Akaya. A za la ɛnwu te, &lt;&lt;Gba mi ka mɔmɔ, mi re mu Oromu megaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />A lɔ enzu wepo umba o mbwa wu ma mu ɛduma iwomo, Otimoti mbala Erasitu mu Omasedoniya, uwu ba a gyi e wɔ afyi epo mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Kwuye kwɔngu obirigo uwakwu a wɔ la enzu umba o yi mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Onzu u ndo kwondo uwufo o ya wu te Ɔdimɛtirɔ e yi mu kwuse kwɔngu. Mu kwunu ungwu eshi mɔmɔ, onzu ele e ndo eshi iyi Atemisi mu esiliva. Ɛlɛ i ka laa wa ndo kwondo rishi gyɔɔ <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Ɔdimɛtiri e lo ɛlu enzu wa ndo kwondo umbafo lɛɛbi, akwɛyi a za mba te: &lt;&lt;Reshi ingyi udaba mɛɛ, lunyi lu yitu te ki wo rishi gyɔɔ mu ɛduma nzu ɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Lu yi mu imama mbala ipwama iyi onzu ele Ɔpɔlu uwu bɔkɔ enzu gyɔɔ o shi egbo munyi wu, e kyoro enzu ma lɛɛbi munɛ mu Ɛfɛsɔ mbala ɛzhi iyi Eshiya. A za la enzu te, &lt;&lt;Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ onzu gba e ndo le akwu Ukpo mo ndii. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Gba ki gbo oshoshimo, rishi nzu ngyɛlɛ ri fya ɛnyi iyira mekeka iyi enzu akwɛyi enzu o nyama te o shi kunu ungwu eshi nzu iyɛkwuu, Atemisi igba fo, eshi ɛlɛ iyi bɔkɔ enzu o lɛ mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya mbala kwudu kwɔlɛ ndii, o gbo yi oya fo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Tabɔkɔ o pwa iso ɛlɛ, amba o wo mbo mo, akwɛyi o le mu ovyo iwomo mu opwu uwɔkwuu te: &lt;&lt;Atemisi uwu Ɛfɛsɔ gba akwu uwakwu le!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Akwɛyi uwewe akwu ovyo iwomo mu kwuse kwɔngu. Enzu mbɔlɛ o yi Ɔgayɔ ma mbala Arisitaku ɛmɛza umba luzɛ umba Ɔpɔlu, enzu umba Omasedoniya o kamba mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu kwuse. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Ɔpɔlu a gyi te le rima mu idu iyi enzu kaa le siso, wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ba o nya wu ma mo. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Enzu umbakɔ umbafo umba kwuse umba bɔkɔ akwu ɛmɛza umba Ɔpɔlu o lɔ ilɔ la Ɔpɔlu te, o kpa wu ɛshɛku te la nɛnɛ le fye mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama awu mo. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Enzu mba bɔkɔ o kpala ɛlu awu o mwa gbu: Umbafo o ya ngyɛlɛ, umbafo ba o ya ngyewa. Enzu riba o yi ingyi ki kpalamba ɛlu mo. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Azhu o wala Alɛkizanda kudu te la rima mu keyi mba, umbafo mba o zɔ te e yi kwuwo mɛmi iyi ovyo ele. Alɛkizanda e wombo ewo te onzonzu la kpala kenzu wu ma, a gyi te le fu ombu wu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Tabɔkɔ enzu mbɔlɛ o zɔngɔma ma te akwu Azhu, akwɛyi kpɛkpɛmba mu opwu ukpɛnyi o le mu ovyo iwomo nzhii ba awa epo mu iyama te: &lt;&lt;Atemisi uwu Ɛfɛsɔ gba akwu uwakwu le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Akwɛyi u ka kwupu uwu kwuse kwɔngu a za la enzu te lo kpa la kenzu mbo ma, akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi umba Ɛfɛsɔ, uwe ba e yitu te akwu kinzu umba kwuse kwɔlɛ gba ki gbo Ɔtɛpu uwu Atemisi uwakwu mbala kwoki ɔkɛrikɛri ungwu bɔkɔ kwu wɔ moshi kwu ta mɛzhi le mo? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, i yi iyi bɔkɔ o ri kaambu mu ɛlɛ mo awu, onzonzu le gbo ndii le wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki nya la obirigo munɛ mo. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Lunyi lu bo la enzu mbɔlɛ munɛ, o wo nzu ɛlɔ iyi apula ɔkɛrikɛri iyi ɔtɛpu mo, ba o kpa eshi nzu ari mo. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ishi gba Ɔdimɛtirɔ mbala enzu wa wo ɛduma iyawu o yi amba mbala onzu uwufo, idaba iyi ombu ifumo iyi ɛwu kwɔfyi kwɔfyi mbala wa zɔ ombu <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ishi ba lu yi ombu uwufo uwu lu gyi te la lu bo wu, uwu o bo so wu mu udaba uwu ombu <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Gba ki gboshoshi mo, o yi nzu ombu uwu ovyo iwomo mu kwuse ɔnɛ. ki do ata ifulomo marimari iyi ovyo ele mo, kwongwu kwuyi ungwu ovyo iwomo nzu kwu yi mo. <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Mizhikembo iyi u ka kwupwu uwu kwuse awu a mbwa ɛlɛ isomo, akwɛyi a za la uwewe te lo kpasha.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Zɛ Mu Omasedoniya Mbala Akaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ ovyo e gbomo ndii, akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a lɔ la enzu wa mbwalu, kɔ mba ɛnwu ma akwɛyi e wo mbo ungbo, akwɛyi a lu mba afyima a ka mu Omasedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />A kpɛvyɛ mu ɛzhi ɛnyi mu enzu wa mbwalu iso isomo gyɔɔ iyi ɛnwɛkɔ nzhii ba a kama mu ɛzhi iyi Akaya, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />a nɔma mɔmɔ evya ɛla. Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ e yi mu egbo ibyima iyi te e to ɔgwuzɛ uwu Osiriya, akwɛyi a dama te Azhu o yi mu anya wu iwomo iyi o ngbɛ wu ma, akwɛyi a ka mu egbo wu a gbala kembo a zɛ mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu Omasedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Enzu umba o fye wu mo gba akwu: Osopata umɛ uwu Opiruyu uwu a wɔ mu Oberiya, Arisitaku mbala Osekundu uwu a wɔ mu Otesalonika, Ɔgayɔ uwu a wɔ mu Ɔdɛbi, Otimoti tete, mbala Otakiku mbala Otirofimu uwu a wɔ mu ɛzhi iyi Ashiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Enzu mbɔlɛ o to keyi la nzu o ko rigbo nzu mu Oturowa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ ki mbwa odumudumu uwu Kwoburedi ungwu kwu yi otutu mo, ki lafya la Ofilipayi ki fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi ki zɛma iyi afyi ɛlɔ akwɛyi ki ka mu Oturowa, mɔmɔ ki ŋɔ afyi erewo.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isomo Iyi Ɔpɔlu Mu Oturowa Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ki bo kaa la ki ri kiya ingyirimo ingyi ilolomo iyi Ɔkwu. Ɔpɔlu e so wa mbwalu rɛnu ingyi Ukpo iso ba a kpakpɛɛ mu iso wu isomo nzhii ba utu uwɔkɔɔ kwuwongu bɔkɔ e yi egbo iyi ifulomo mu eyi ilama. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Lɔmbu undu ɔyi guruguru lu yi mu ugu uwoshi mbaa bɔkɔ ki kpala ɛlu awu. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Ulugbaga uwufo uwu o ya wu te Ɔyutikɔ a ŋɔ mu owindo uwu ugu uwoshi, bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu eyi mu iso isomo awu akwɛyi ondo u to wumo gyɔɔ. Tabɔkɔ ondo u to wu mo iyɛkɔkɔ awu, akwɛyi a kalama mu ugu uwola uwoshi a ta mɛzhi, akwɛyi o ko du wu ukpɛzhi. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a kalama e bo mɛzhi, a ka kpa ukpɛzhi ele midu akwɛyi a mawa gbamu. A zɔ te, &lt;&lt;La lu wo idu giri mo, e ye la reyi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a gba la iyama mu ugu uwoshi awu, akwɛyi a mu koburedi ma akwɛyi e ri mbala mba. E siso mbala mba nzhii ba eyi ilama, akwɛyi e fulomo. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Enzu mbɔlɛ o to ulugbaga ele ma o ka wu mogba la reyi, akwɛyi idu i gbo mbo mo totoo.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Lafya Laa Otorowasi A Ka Mu Omiletusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Ki to keyi ki ka mbaa kwoda ungwu embyi akwɛyi ki to ɔgwuzɛ uwu Asɔsu, kaa ki to Ɔpɔlu ma mɔmɔ. Uwu gba e so le, ba a gyi te la zɛ malɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ e du nzu mu Asosu, ki to wu mo mu kwoda akwɛyi ki ka mu Omitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Eyi ilama ki fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi ki lafya la mɔmɔ akwɛyi ki ka mu Ɔkiyɔ. Eyi ilama ki sama ki ka mu Osamosu, akwɛyi eyi ilama ki ka mu ɔmilɛtu.. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Ɔpɔlu a ka amasa mu egbo wu te e fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi ungwu kwu la mu Ɛfɛsɔ mo kwuwongu e yi egbo te e wo afyi gyɔɔ mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya mo, mo e yi mu igyakpɔɔ te le so mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, ishi ba i wo wumo, uwu la ba mɔmɔ ɔnuwu Ɔpɛtakɔ.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu E Wo Enzu Umbakɔ Umba Ɛfɛsɔ Ungbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Ɔpɔlu e yi mu ɔmilɛtu. akwɛyi a lɔ la enzu umbakɔ umba ɔshɔshi uwu Ɛfɛsɔ te lo bo. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o bomo, a za mba te: &lt;&lt;Lunyi lu yitu ewo iyi bɔkɔ mi wo mbala kwuyengu mi ngbɛ lɛɛbi mbala yi, i ye mu kwɔfyi ungwonze bɔkɔ mi bo mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya awu. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Mi gyi ɛmi ma, mi wo ɛduma la Ɔkwu la ɛnyɛ meyi.Imi ba Azhu o lo mi inyashi gyɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Lunyi lu yitu te mi nvye kiya ingyinangyina ingyi ki mbwa yi ma mo. Mi zɔ yi iso iyi Ukpo mu agba mu agba mbala kwudu. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Mi lo Azhu mbala Agiriki ilutu mu alu te mega lo kwu ira ɔsu, lo gbama mbaa Ukpo ba lo kwudifulo mu Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />&lt;&lt;Kekelele, imi mi sheyimo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kwongwu imi mi lomo laa kwundu Ɔkɛrikɛri, ingyi ki bi du mi mɔmɔ mo. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Imi mi yitu te mu kwuse ungwunanguna Kwundu uwu Ukpo e ye mi ilutu ilomo mu alu te ugu ugyi mbala inyashi imama i rigbo mi. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Tetete, mi to kwunyɔ mi te akwu kiya kyinyinyi mo, iyami akwu te mi mbwa ɛduma mi ma. Inyi gba akwu ɛduma iyi anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo le.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />&lt;&lt;Mi fulama munyi yi mu anu itama iyi irɛsu iyi Ukpo, kekelele mi yitu te kpɛkpɛyi umba bɔkɔ mi ta yi anu iyi Ukpo awu, lu gba lu ma mi fo. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi so yi te, ɛnzhi umba onzonzu ɛnyi te o yi mu reshi mi fo, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />mo mi ta yi anu iyi rɛnu ingyi Ukpo lɛɛbi-a. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />La lu gbo ɛnwu yi ma mbala uzhi lɛɛbi uwu bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e shi lu kwu wa to keyi awu. La lu kwu wa bɔ eyi mu Ɔshɔshi uwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ a ya mu ɛnzhi wu. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Mi yitu te mizhikembo mi, lugbonga ndura lu fye mekeka yi ba o ma eyembembyi iyi uzhi uwu ilɔ mo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Enzu mekeka yi o wɔ o nyɔ mba ongbulolo ata ilama kaa lo gyi enzu lɛmba. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ la lu gbo ɛnwu yi ma! La lu lolo te lɔri lola utu la ɔnu mi koko mi yi malu la eyi iyi ɛnyɛ .<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />&lt;&lt;Kekelele mi lu yi afyima mu ewo iyi Ukpo mbala esheshi wu, iyi bɔkɔ i shi yi kaa lu kwu idu yi la lu fulo kaa lu yi esheshi iyɔkpɔɔ iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a nɔngɔ yi ma kwongwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi ɛnwu ma kaa lo mbwalu wu awu. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Imi mi na onzu Osiliva naa Ogolu naa okpayi mo. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Lunyi mu afyi yi lu yitu te ewo mi ɛlɛ i ka mi la iyi ugɔ mi a gyi mbala iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma mbala mi. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Mu ingyinangyina bɔkɔ mi wo, Mi zɔ yi te, mu ɛduma iwomo ɛlɛ te gba ki mbwa umba bɔkɔ o yi ekpasu mo le, la ki lolo mba iso iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi e so mu afyi wu te: &lt;Ishimo iyi ɔnyɛ i ka inama.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a mbwa iso ɛlɛ isomo, uwu mbala mba lɛɛbi o kumo akwɛyi o lɛ Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Enzu lɛɛbi mba o mu ɛnyɛ akwɛyi o kpa Ɔpɔlu idu akwɛyi a kama. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Iyi bɔkɔ i shimbo ubugyi gyɔɔ gba akwu iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a za mba te o ma wu gbee fo awu. Akwɛyi o fye wu mo o kawa mba kwoda ungwu embyi.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Ka Mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Mizhikembo iyi ki wo esu ungbo awu, ki fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi ki to ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ɔkɔsi. Eyi ilama ki ka mu Orodesi akwɛyi ki lafya la mɔmɔ ki ka mu Opatara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ki du kwoda ungwu embyi ungwu kwu sheye mu Ofonishiya, ki fye mangwu akwɛyi kwu fulomo. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Tabɔkɔ ki bo mbaa ki ma Ɔsapurɔ, akwɛyi ki mu isama ki sheyi mbaa okanga uwu ɔnu kwoto akwɛyi ki to Ɔgwuzɛ uwu Osiriya. Ki ka mu Otaya mbaa bɔkɔ kwoda kwu kala ewulo mo. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Bɔkɔ ki fye wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ma mɔmɔ, ki ŋɔ mbala mba afyi erewo. Mu iwomo iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo a kpa Ɔpɔlu ɛshɛku te le so mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mo. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Tabɔkɔ kwuyengwu iyimo nzu ku wo mo, ki yimo akwɛyi ki to Ɔgwuzɛ nzu. Wambwalu Ɔzhizɔsi lɛɛbi la eko la umba o fye nzu mo o ka nzu mu kenzu unga risu, akwɛyi ki kwumo ki lɛ Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Tabɔkɔ ki wo esu ungbo, ki fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi umba ba o gba o kama mogba.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Mu Otaya ki le mu luzɛ nzu mu embyi nzhii ki ka mu Opitolemaya, mɔmɔ ki gbɛlɛ wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ɛnyi akwɛyi ki ŋɔ mbala mba kwɔfyi kwunyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Eyi i lama ki yimo ki ka mu Oseseriya akwɛyi ki kpo mu kwogba ungwu Ofilipi u tanu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, akwu onzu ukpɛnyi mekeka iyi werewo mbamba. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Ofilipu e yi emoko wendo umba bɔkɔ akwu anukenzu.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Mizhikembo iyi ki ŋɔ mɔmɔ afyi gyɔɔ akwɛyi anukenzu uwufo uwu o ya wu te Agabu a wɔ mu Ozhudiya e bo munɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />E bo munyi nzu, e to kwumamuzhi ungwu Ɔpɔlu akwɛyi a ma ewo mbala alɛ wu ma akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Kwundu uwu Ukpo a zɔ te, &lt;Te gba Azhu umba Ɔzhɛrusalɛ oo ma ada uwu kwumamuzhi kwɔlɛ ma le akwɛyi oo rawu oo shi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Tabɔkɔ ki pwa ɛlɛ, kinzu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ awu ki kpa Ɔpɔlu ɛshɛku te le so mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mo. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a gba nzu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi ba lu loga ba lu tutu mi egbo mo te. Imi mi nyama te lo ta mi mu ugu ugyi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ lo kyo lo ngbɛ mi ma kwuwo ungwu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Bɔkɔ ki ma te ki do wu egbo ifulomo mo, akwɛyi ki fu ewo mɛzhi akwɛyi ki zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi awu gba li wo li.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, ki yi ɛnwu ma akwɛyi ki to ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Enzu wa mbwalu umbafo umba Oseseriya o fye nzu mo o ka nzu mu kwogba ungwu Ominaso, uwu gba a ŋegbo onzu riyi oga le. Onzu ele a wɔ mu kwuse ungwu Ɔsapurɔ ba akwu enzu umba kwonze umba bɔkɔ o na rɛnu ingyi Ukpo.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu a Ka Mbaa Ozhemisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Bɔkɔ ki kama mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, enzu wa mbwalu o ba nzu ma ɔnyɛnyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Eyi ilama Ɔpɔlu mbala umba bɔkɔ ki shimo ki ka mu ɔgba uwu Ozhemisi, enzu umbakɔ umba Ɔshɔshi lɛɛbi o yi mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Ɔpɔlu a gbɛlɛ mba ɛnyi akwɛyi a zɛ mba ilɔ lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo mekeka iyi ekeshi kwongwu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ e wo.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Tabɔkɔ o pwa ɛlɛ, o gbo oya la Ukpo. Akwɛyi o za la Ɔpɔlu te: &lt;&lt;Umɛnɛ, yese, Azhu riba akwu wa mbwalu, kpɛkpɛ mba mba ba akwu enzu wa bɔ kushi mu ɛrɛma iyi Omosisi. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />O ba mba ɛza te uŋɔ ŋɔ zɔ Azhu umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala enzu ekeshi lo shi egbo mu ɛrɛma iyi Omosisi mo, lo zɛ ɛmɛ mba ɛsɔ ba lo mbwalu iwomo iyi ɛdɔ nzu mo. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Ki wo te kekelele? Moo mega o pwa yi te ŋɔ bo munɛ, <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, wo iyi bɔkɔ ki so ŋɔ. Anzɔnu wendo o yi mbala nzu umba bɔkɔ o bɔ ɛmba kepo mu idu. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Uŋɔ mbala enzu mbɔlɛ la lu so kaa lu wo ɔpɛriri, shi rigbɛ ingyi ɛduma mba kaa lo gbɛ mba inyi ma. Akwɛyi ɛlɛ ishi onzu uwunawuna e yitu te ongbulolo e yi mekeka iyi ewa iyaŋa bɔkɔ o lo le mo, uŋɔ lala ŋɔ yi mu ɛrɛma ɛlɛ imbwaluma. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Mu iso iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu, ki ka mba kwupu dɛ-ɛ iyi bɔkɔ ki nyama la yi te, lo rima mbaa ewiri iyi bɔkɔ o wo yi isabɔ la eshi, lo kwu ɛnzhi mo, mbala ivye iyi izɔfyi uwu bɔkɔ o fu ɛnzhi ba lo yama mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Bɔkɔ eyi ilama Ɔpɔlu mbala enzu wendo mbamba o ka o ko wo ɛmba ɔpɛriri. Akwɛyi a ka mu ɔtɛpu kaa le so mbo kwɔfyi ungwu bɔkɔ ɔpɛriri iwomo kwubo mo akwɛyi o wo rɛshi kwuwo mbo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Yi Ɔpɔlu Ma Mu Ɔtɛpu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Bɔkɔ afyi erewo i nda la inyɔlɔma fo, Azhu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya o ma Ɔpɔlu mu ɔtɛpu akwɛyi o lo enzu atiti akwɛyi o yi Ɔpɔlu ma,<verse eid="ACT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />o le mu uzhi iwomo te, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba Izirɛ, la lu mbwa nzu ma! Ele gba akwu onzu uwu a zɔ enzu lɛɛbi munamuna te lo zhi enzu nzu mo, lo lomo la ɛrɛma iyi Omosisi mo mbala ɔtɛpu nzu ele. Akwu ɛlɛ kɛɛkyi mo, e bo la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo mu ɔtɛpu mɛmi, e fo ɛrɛma iyi kizɛ kɛ kɛrikɛri ngyɛlɛ ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Mu afyi ɛnyi o ma Otirofimu, onzu uwu Ɛfɛsɔ mu kwuse mbala Ɔpɔlu akwɛyi o byi egbo te Ɔpɔlu lala a kawa mɛmi iyi ɔtɛpu.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Akwɛyi enzu umba kwuse kpɛkpɛ mba o le mu ovyo iwomo, enzu o wɔ munamuna o bo, akwɛyi o yi Ɔpɔlu ma, o pyipyi wu o wawu kwudu mu ɔtɛpu, akwɛyi o koko iku iyi ɔtɛpu ma efyefya. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Tabɔkɔ enzu mbamba o yi mu iwomo te lɔ ngbɛ wuma, akwɛyi ɛza ɛlɛ i ka mu alu iyi u to keyi uwu Asozha uwu Oroma te kwuse kpɛkpɛngwu kwu yi mu ovyo iwomo. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Kɛlɛlɛ akwɛyi u to keyi uwu asozha akwu umbakɔ mbala umbɛri akwɛyi o ri ɛnya o ka mɔmɔ mba ovyo awu. Tabɔkɔ wawo ovyo mbamba o ma u to keyi uwu Asozha mbala Asozha wu, akwɛyi o lafya Ɔpɔlu ɛmu ikpama.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />U to keyi uwu Asozha e bo akwɛyi e yi Ɔpɔlu ma akwɛyi e shi ɔkpa te lo gbawakyi mu akwuta epo. Akwɛyi e yo Ɔpɔlu kwuyo te u wu akwu uwe dɛ, kimbe ba e wo dɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Enzu mbafo mɛmi iyi riba ingyi enzu ngyɛngyi o le mu ovyo iwomo, umbafo o so kiya ngyɛlɛ umbafo ba o so ngyewa, akwɛyi u to keyi uwu Asozha le e do te a zɔngɔma ongbulolo iyi iso ɛlɛ mo kwongwu ovyo, akwɛyi e shi ɔkpa te Ɔpɔlu lo sowo mu mɛmi iyi obaraki uwu asozha. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e bo mba embu iyi ɔgwuzɛ, akwɛyi asozha o to wu mo mu ingari kwuwongu ovyo uwu enzu mbamba e yi gyɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Riba ingyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu awu o so wu mu uzhi iwomo te, &lt;&lt;Lo sheyimo la onzu ele!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Gbɔ Ɛwu Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Tabɔkɔ asozha o gyi te lo so la Ɔpɔlu mu mɛmi iyi obaraki uwu asozha akwɛyi e yo u to keyi uwu asozha awu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ nyama te la mi so ŋɔ iso?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ so Ogiriki kego?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />&lt;&lt;Akwu ŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu onzu uwu Izhipiti uwu bɔkɔ e shi enzu o wo ovyo mbala ogomineti akwɛyi ŋɔ kwu enzu umbira edubu endo mu afyi ɛnyi ŋɔ kamba mu ɔsɛ le mo re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Ɔpɔlu a gba mba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ayimo. Imi mi kwu Azhu, mi wɔ mu Otasu mu ɛzhi iyi Osilisiya, mi kwu umɛ uwu kwuse ungwɔkuu. Shɔɔkɔ la lu shi mi kapa kaa la mi siso mbala enzu mbɔlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Tabɔkɔ u to keyi uwu asozha e shi wu kapa, akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu e yimo a ri mu embu iyi iyama mu ɔgwuzɛ akwɛyi e wo enzu ewo te lo kpala kenzu mo. Tabɔkɔ kizɛ ki gbo ndii, akwɛyi e so mbo iso mu kenzu unga Iburu:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />&lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi mbala umba ada mi, la lu pwa opwu uwu iso mi ŋanɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />kwuyengwu o pwa ta e ye mbo mu iso isomo mu Iburu akwɛyi o ŋɔ kyoo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:2">Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a za mba te: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />&lt;&lt;Imi mi kwu Azhu, o mba mi mu Otasu uwu Osilisiya, o yi mi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ munɛ. Midu iyi Ɔgamaliyɛ gba mi vɔngɔ ɛzu iyi ɛrɛma iyi umba asɔkwu nzu mamari le, akwɛyi imi rala ɛnwu mi mi shi Ukpo kyamate bɔkɔ lunyi lu rala ɛyi yi lu shi Ukpo ɔnɛnɛ te awu. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Mi lo enzu umba ɔgwuzɛ ɔlɛ inyashi nzhii ba o kpomo, mi yi anzɔnu mbala eko ma mi fu mbo mu ugu ugyi. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Eboshi umbakɔ mbala wa to keyi umba Azhu akwu azɔgɔ umba iso ɛlɛ te akwu ongbulolo. Watokeyi mbɔlɛ o shi mi kwupwu akwɛyi mi ka mbaa Azhu umba o yi mu Ɔdamasikɔ awu, mi ka mɔmɔ kaa la mi yi wa mbwalu ma kaa mi lo mbo ɛyɛ la mi bo mbo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kaa lo lo mbo inyashi.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu E So Iyi Bɔkɔ I Wo Bɔkɔ A Na Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(Iwomo Iyi Wa zɛ ilɔ 9.1-19; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />&lt;&lt;kwuyengwu ɔnɔnda ta bɔkɔ mi bo kɛlɛ mbala Ɔdamasikɔ, kɛlɛlɛ ɛbɛ iyɛku i wɔ mu oshi i kpo mami. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Mi kpeyi mbwe mɛzhi akwɛyi mi pwa opwu uwu onzu u ya mi ma te, &lt;Ɔsɔlu! Ɔsɔlu! Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ ŋɔ lo mi inyashi te?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Mi yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt; &lt; Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu uwe ngyɔɔ Ada?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">A gba mi opwu te, &lt;&lt; &lt; Imi mi kwu Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti, uwu ŋɔ ye wu mu inyashi ilomo awu.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɛ mbala mi le o ma ɛbɛ ɛnyi, umba ba o pwa opwu uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yemi mu iso isomo le mo.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Mi yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt; &lt;Kimbe ba mi wo, Ada?&gt; Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt; &lt;Yimo, ka so mu Ɔdamasikɔ. Gba ŋɔ kama mɔmɔ o so ŋɔ kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo lɛɛbi.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɛ mbala mi awu o yi mu kwuwo gba o ka mya mu Ɔdamasikɔ le, kwongwu ilemo iyi ɛbɛ ɛnyi i se mi eyi mo.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />&lt;&lt; Mu kwuse kwɔngu onzu uwufo o ya wu te Ananayasi e bo te la ma mi. Onzu ele akwu u mbwalu ɛrama iyi Omosisi, Azhu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ le o lowu mo gyɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ananiya e bo kɛlɛ mba mi akwɛyi a za mi te &lt;Umɛnɛ mi Ɔsɔlu, gbala ɛbɛ imama!&gt; Akwɛyi mu kwotota kwɔngu mi gbala ɛbɛ imama akwɛyi mi ma wu.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi a za mi te: &lt;Ukpo uwu asɔkwu nzu a mulɛ ŋɔ ka yitu ingyi uwu a gyi, kaa gba ma onzu uwu ototo ka pwa iso mu kenzu wu. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ ŋɔ kwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ so enzu iso iyi kiya ingyi ŋɔ ma ba ŋɔ pwa laa enzu. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Kekelele kimbe ba ŋɔ rigbo ngyi fo? Yimo, ya ɛnyi iyi Ukpo kaa lo wo ŋɔ obatisima akwɛyi ingbomo ŋɔ o gbayi o kpaŋa.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">O Ya Ɔpɔlu Ma Te Kaa La Ta Anu Laa Enzu Umba Bɔkɔ Akwu Azhu Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />&lt;&lt;kwuyengwu mi gba mi ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ bɔkɔ mi yi mu Ukpo ilɛma mu ɔtɛpu, akwɛyi Mi ma ɛbɛ iyifo <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />akwɛyi mi ma Ɔzhizɔsii, akwɛyi a za mi te, &lt;Wo efyefya ka lafya la Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mu atata ɛlɛ! Kwuwongwu enzu mbɔlɛ o nyama la iso mi iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ so mbo mu reshi mi le mo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Mi gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt; &lt;Ɔkwu, enzu mbɔlɛ o yitu mi mamari te mi ka mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama iyi Azhu gyɔɔ, mi yi enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu ŋɔ mi gba mi kpamba ɛmwu akwɛyi mi fu mbo mu ugu ugyi. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o yi mu Ositivi, u uzɔgɔ ŋɔ mu ingbɛma awu, Imi tete mi rima mɔmɔ mi nyama mi kyo mbala mba, Imi gba mi gbo ekpayi iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o ye wo mu ekyi ikpama awu le.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi Ɔkwu a za mi te, &lt;So; Imi mi lɔ ŋɔma sharu mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e siso ɛlɛ akwɛyi enzu mbamba o nyama te lo pwa iso wu fo. Akwɛyi o yi opwu mo o wo ovyo iyɛkɔkɔ o zɔ te, &lt;&lt; Lo ngbɛ wu ma mo i fate le yi lakwunyɔ mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu ovyo iwomo, akwɛyi o to ekpayi mba mbala umburu pyo pyo moshi, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />akwɛyi u to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ awu a za mba te lo to Ɔpɔlu ma lo so mu obariki uwu asozha. Akwɛyi a za mba te lo kpa wu ikpa kaa la zɔ kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ Azhu o lo wu egbulo te le. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Tabɔkɔ asozha o wa wu kwudu kaa lo kpa wu ikpa, akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a za la u to keyi uwu asozha uwu bɔkɔ a rima mɔmɔ awu te, &lt;&lt;I fate kaa kpa umɛ uwu ɛzhi iyi Oroma kwɔkpa, uwu bɔkɔ o do zɔ ombu wu ma ba u riwu dɛ moo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />kwuye ungwu u to keyi uwu asozha awu a pwa iso ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a ka mba u to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ e yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ki wo iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ wole mo, moo onzu ele akwu umɛ uwu ɛzhi iyi Oroma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />U to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ awu e bo mba Ɔpɔlu akwɛyi e yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;So mi, uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu umɛ uwu ɛzhi iyi Oroma?&gt;&gt; A gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ee, mi kwu umɛ uwu Oroma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />U to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ awu a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Imi mi shi eduwo gyɔɔ te lami kwu umɛ uwu ɛzhi iyi Oroma.&gt;&gt; Ɔpɔlu ba a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;O mba mi umɛ uwu ɛzhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Kɛlɛlɛ enzu umba bɔkɔ o gyite lo yo wu eyo awu o gba kembo. U to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ awu iyi i wo wu mo kwongwu a zɔngɔma te Ɔpɔlu akwu umɛ uwu ɛzhi iyi Oroma.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu Mu Keyi Unga Watokeyi Umba Azhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Tabɔkɔ eyi i lama, u to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ awu a gyi te le yitu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki wo pwaa ba Azhu o lewa iyi Ɔpɔlu, a zɔ te lo lu Ɔpɔlu ɛyɛ ma akwɛyi a za la ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wa to keyi umba Azhu te lo kpala ɛlu. Akwɛyi e bo la Ɔpɔlu kaa la rima mu keyi mba.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Ɔpɔlu a bɔ eyi suu mu wa to keyi umba Azhu akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, Mi yitu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ mi wo ba akwu ingyira mo, moo ngbaa ta bɔkɔ o mba mi le Ukpo nzu gba mi ye wu mu ilomo le .&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />kwuye ungwu Ananayasi obwoshi uwakɔ awu a pwa iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e so akwɛyi a za la enzu umba bɔkɔ o ri kɛlɛ mbala Ɔpɔlu awu te lo kpa wu afyi mu kwɔngba. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a za la Ananayasi te, &lt;&lt;Ukpo a gbala afyi a kpa ŋa uŋɔ onzu uwu kwukyoro ele! Uŋɔ ŋɔ ŋɔma mɔmɔ te ŋɔ zɔ mi ombu mate ɛrama iyi Omosisi bɔkɔ i so awu, uŋɔ mafyi ŋɔ ba ŋɔ fo ɛrama ma kwongwu ŋɔ za mba te lo kpa mi afyi ba ŋɔ yo mi kwuyo kaa ma te ombu u ri mi dɛ mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o rima kɛlɛ mbala Ɔpɔlu awu o za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ki pe obwoshi uwu Ukpo uwu uwakɔ ari mo&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Ɔpɔlu a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, Mi yitu te ele akwu obwoshi uwakɔ mo; kwuwongu o ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo te: &lt;La lu so ungwoyi ungwu u to keyi uwu enzu mo.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a zɔngɔma te umbafo mba akwu Asadusi umbafo mba ba akwu Afarisi, akwɛyi e siso mu opwu uwɔkwuu mɔmɔ te, &lt;&lt; Ɛmɛnɛ mi, Imi mi kwu Ofarisi, umɛ uwu Ofarisi. Watokeyi umba Azhu o yi mi ombu kwongwu egbo mi i na yi ma te enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo Ukpo a gbala iyimo mu kwuvɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a mbwa iso ɛlɛ i somo, Kambu ka ta mekeka iyi Afarisi mbala Asadusi akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpala ɛlu awu o kepo. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Mo Asadusi o zɔ te iyimo mu kuvɔ iyimo, o kyo o zɔ te alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mbala kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi mo, Afarisi ba o nyama te ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i yi.)<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Akwɛyi kambu ungakwu ka wɔ ka ta mɔmɔ, akwɛyi wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi umbafo umba bɔkɔ akwu Afarisi o yimo o rima la kambwu rimo ungakwu, o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ki ma kiya ingyira kikpikpɛnyi te ingyi bɔkɔ onzu ele e wo mo,&gt;&gt; akwɛyi o zɔ te. &lt;&lt;Igboshimo akwu kwundu uwu Ukpo naa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo gba e so wu iso le kɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Tabɔkɔ kambwu kɛlɛ ka vindɔ ovyo uwakwuu awu gba u to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ awu e wiyi kwongwu enzu o bo pe Ɔpɔlu ma. Akwɛyi a za la asozha te lo so mɔmɔ kaa lo wala Ɔpɔlu ma renya mekeka mba kaa lo so wu mu obariki uwu asozha.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Mutu uwu mɔnu mawu Ɔkwu a wɔ a ri kɛlɛ mbala Ɔpɔlu akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Yi idu! Mate ŋɔ to izɔgɔ mi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ awu, tayi gba ŋɔ to izɔgɔ mi mu Oromu tete le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Azhu Umbafo O Ka Amasa Iyi O Ngbɛ Ɔpɔlu Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Eyi i lama, Azhu umbafo o kpa kyaa akwɛyi o wo okwura mbala esu te o ri o wo mo nzhii ba o ngbɛ Ɔpɔlu ma dɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpa kyaa te o ngbɛ Ɔpɔlu ma le o pika uwekpendo ma. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />O ka mu ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ akwɛyi o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ki wo okwura te ki ri mo ki wo mo nzhii ba ki ngbɛ Ɔpɔlu ma dɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Kekelele, lunyi mbala wa to keyi umba Azhu la lu wo kwuwoyo kaa la lu za la u to keyi uwu Asozha uwakɔ awu kaa le bo wu mu idu yi, la lu za wu te lu gyite lu yo Ɔpɔlu eyo kyo . Kinzu ba ki kwu ki gbo wu mu ɔgwuzɛ, a ba munyi yi dɛ mo akwɛyi ki ngbɛ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Tabɔkɔ umɛ uwu umanyi uwu Ɔpɔlu a pwa amasa iyi o ka awu, e fye mɛmi iyi obariki uwu asozha akwɛyi e so Ɔpɔlu iso ɛnyi.<verse eid="ACT 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a ya u to keyi uwu asozha ukpɛnyi ma akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;To ulugbaga ele so mba u to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ; e yi iso ikpɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ a gyite le so wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Akwɛyi e to wu a kawu la u to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ awu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:18">U to keyi uwu asozha awu a zɔ te, Ɔpɔlu uwu e yi mu ugu ungyi awu, a lɔ mi ma a za mi te la mi bo la ulugbaga ele munyi ŋɔ kwongwu e yi iso iyi e so ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />U to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ awu e yi ulugbaga ele a ka wu mu emba akwɛyi e yo wu kwuyo kyo kyo te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi te ka so mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Ulugbaga awu a zɔ te: &lt;&lt; Watokeyi umba Azhu o wo okwura te, umba o za ŋa kaa bo la Ɔpɔlu mu idu mbo kwɔnyi kwɔlɛ. O wo kwuwoyo te umba o gyite lo yo wu eyo kyo. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ki shi wu mbo mo, kwongwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwo gbo wu le o pika enzu uwekpendo mo. O wo okwura mbala esu te umba o ri mo, o wo mo nzhii ba o ngbɛ Ɔpɔlu ma dɛ. O rigbo te nya mba ma kaa lo bo la Ɔpɔlu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />U to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ awu a za la ulugbaga awu te le sheyimo iyawu akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ki so onzu ukpukpɛnyi te ŋɔ so mi iso ɛlɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Lɔ Ɔpɔlu Laa Ogomina Ɔfɛlisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Akwɛyi u to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ a ya wa to keyi umba uzhi uwu asozha wepo ma akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu yi ɛnwu ma kaa lu kwu asozha ederi epo, mbala wapɛ anya uwekperewo mbala asozha umba egwu iyewa ederi epo ka lo so mu Oseseriya mu ekerefe erendo iyutu ɔlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />La lu shi anya kaa Ɔpɔlu mbala enzu umba o zɛ mbala wu awu kaa lo ya ma mba, kaa lo so wu mba Ɔfɛlisi Ogomina moloto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />U to keyi uwu Asozha a ka kwupwu tee:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Imi o ya mi te Ɔkaladiyɔ Ɔlasiyɔ gba mi ka ŋa kwupwu kwɔlɛ le. Uŋɔ onzu uwakwu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 23:26">Ɔfɛlisi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 23:26">Ogomina :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 23:26">Mi gbɛlɛ ɛnyi.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Azhu umbafo o yi Onzu ele</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 23:27">ma akwɛyi o gyi te lo ngbɛ wu , Imi ba mi bo mbala asozha mi akwɛyi mi na wu ma mu ewo mbo, kwongwu mi pwa te akwu onzu uwu ɛzhi iyi Oroma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Imi mi gyi te kaa mi yitu iyi kiya ingyi ki wo bɔkɔ o yi wu mo, akwɛyi Mi ka wu la wa to keyi umba Azhu. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Mi ma te imulo iyi o mu o lo wu akwu kwongwu ɛrama mba, umba ba o fya kwuyi ungwu ombu meka wu ungwu bɔkɔ kwu do lukwu ma mo naa i ta mu Ugugyi ma mo. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Tabɔkɔ mi pwa okwura uwu bɔkɔ o wo mu reshi wu ele, Mi lɔma te lo ka ŋawu kɛlɛlɛ. Mi za la umba bɔkɔ o mwu o lo wu awu te lo so mu keyi ŋɔ mbala ombu mba.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Akwɛyi Asozha o wo ta bɔkɔ o so mbo awu akwɛyi mutu ɔnwu o to Ɔpɔlu ma akwu luzɛ mba, akwɛyi o kawu mu kwuse ungwu o ya ngwu te Atipatiri awu. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Meyi i lama, asozha o to Ɔpɔlu o shi asozha umba bɔkɔ o zɛ mu anya awu te lo she wu mo, akwɛyi umba ba o gbama o ka mu obariki uwu asozha mba. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Tabɔkɔ asozha umba anya mbamba o fye mu Oseseriya, o shi ogomina Ɔfɛlisi kwupwu kwɔngu akwɛyi o lo wu Ɔpɔlu mu ɔwu. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Mizhikembo iyi Ogomina a wa kwupwu kwɔngu ma akwɛyi e yo Ɔpɔlu te, mu ɛzhi iyi na bɔkɔ ŋɔ wɔ? Bɔkɔ a pwa te Ɔpɔlu a wɔ mu Osilisiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />akwɛyi Ogomina a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Mi pwa ombu ŋɔ kwuyengwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o lewa ŋa awu o bo munɛ.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a zɔ te Ɔpɔlu lo shi wu enzu umba o gbomo mogba ungwu ɔsu Ɛrɔdu.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="ms">Azhu O Lo Ewa Iyi Ɔpɔlu Mu Idu Iyi Ogomina Ɔfɛlisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Mizhikembo iyi afyi ɛlɔ obwoshi uwakɔ Ananayasi a ka mu Oseseriya mbala enzu umbakɔ umbafo mbala oloya uwufo uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Otatulu awu. O lo ewa iyi Ɔpɔlu mu idu iyi Ogomina, Ɔfɛlisi. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Tabɔkɔ o ya Ɔpɔlu ma e fyemo mɛmi akwɛyi Otatulu e le mu ombu mba ifumo mu idu iyi onzu uwakwu Ɔfɛlisi. A zɔ te: &lt;&lt;Mu iwomo ŋɔ iyesheshi ɛlɛ gba ishi nzu ki ŋɔma mu oloto mu ɛzhi ɛlɛ le. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Kinzu ki na apula iyi ŋɔ wo nzu le lɛɛbi laa ɔnyɛ uwakwu. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Imi mi gyite kaa mi to kwuye ŋɔ gyɔɔ mo, kwuwo ngwɔlɛ mi kpa ŋa ɛshɛku kaa ŋɔma kyoo kaa pwa iso iyi bɔkɔ mi bi so bwɛɛ le.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />&lt;&lt;Ki du onzu ele te akwu u ta ovyo, e lo Azhu munamuna mu kwudu kwɔlɛ atiti kaa lo wo ovyo. Akwu u to keyi uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o ya mba te Anazarene awu. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />A gyite le tutu ɔtɛpu ma; gba ki yi wu mo le. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Olayisu, u to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ awu ba e bo akwɛyi a na wu nzu ma mega. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Gba ŋɔ yo wu eyo mu afyi ŋɔ, ŋɔ pwa ongbulolo uwu iso lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ ki so mu reshi wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Azhu ba o kyo o nyama mu opwu ukpɛnyi te, te gba iyi le.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu A Gbɛ Ɛnwu Ma Midu Iyi Ɔfɛlisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />kwuyengwu ogomina e shi wu kapa kaa le siso, akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a zɔ te: &lt;&lt;Mi yitu te ŋɔ kwu u zɔ ombu mu kwuse kwɔlɛ diridiri e; kwuwongwɔlɛ mi mu ɔnyɛ kaa la mi fu ombu mi mu idu ŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Uŋɔ ŋɔ do te ŋɔ yo kwuyo mafyi ŋɔ ka pwa te, i di pika afyi uwolepo mo mo bɔkɔ mi ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ ka mi lɛ Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Azhu mbɔlɛ o du mi te mi yi mu kambwu irimo mbala onzu ukpukpɛnyi te mu Ɔtɛpu mo, ba o du mi te mi yi mu ovyo itama mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama iyi Azhu naa munamuna mu kwuse kwɔlɛ mo. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Umba ba o domo te o zɔ ŋɔ kiya ingyi ki zɔ te iso iyi bɔkɔ o so awu akwu ongbulolo mo. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Imi ba mi nyama te mi kwu u lɛ Ukpo uwu asɔkwu nzu, mu iwomo ɛlɛ te gba o zɔ te ki kwu enzu umbira le. Imi ba mi nyama la ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala ɛzu iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu o ka awu lɛɛbi, <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />kyamate bɔkɔ enzu mbɔlɛ o nyama awu, tayigba Imi mi nyama le te Ukpo e wo ta bɔkɔ a zɔ awu te enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo, Ukpo a gba mba la iyimo la kwunyɔ, la enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu Ukpo la enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu mo. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ mi gyikpɔɔ te la mi koko mi wo kiya ingyi ki she la Ukpo mbala enzu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />&lt;&lt;Mizhikembo iyi lɔri gyɔɔ, mi gbama mi ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ ka la mi shi enzu mi ayirewa rɛshi kaa la mi kyo mi wo isabɔ la Ukpo. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Azhu umbafo o ma mi mu Ɔtɛpu mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ mi mbwa isabɔ iyi onzu iwuluma sɛsɛ iwomo. Mɔmɔ mi yi mbala enzu gyɔɔ mo, imi ba o du mi mu ovyo itama mo. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Azhu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu ese iyi Eshiya o yi mɔmɔ, umba gba i fate lo bo mu idu ŋɔ kaa lo fulo ata iyamba le. Gba umba o domo te o yi mi ombu ba lo so nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi munɛ le ba lo so ira iyi bɔkɔ o du mi layi kwuyengwu mi rima mu idu iyi wa to keyi umba Azhu <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Debate akwu iso ikpɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ mi so kwuye ungwu mi rima mekeka mba awu: &lt;Inyi gba akwu te, mi nyama te enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo awu Ukpo a gba mba la iyimo mu kwuvɔ, ɛlɛ gba ishi gba o bo lo ewa mi munyi ŋɔ ɔnɛnɛ le.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Akwɛyi Ɔfɛlisi, uwu bɔkɔ e yitu iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ɔzhizɔsii mamari awu, e turu kwɔfyi ungwu ombu ɔnwu ma a gba keyi, a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɔlasiyɔ u to keyi uwu asozha uwakɔ a nyɔ dɛ gba mi pwa ɛkwu mu iso yi le&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Akwɛyi a za la u to keyi uwu asozha te lo gbala Ɔpɔlu so wo mu ugu ugyi kaa lo gbo wu mo. Uŋɔ ba kapa kaa le wo apula iyifo mafyi, ɛmɛza wu umba bɔkɔ o bo te o ma wu nya mba ma.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu Midu Iyi Ɔfɛlisi Mbala Odurisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Mizhikembo iyi afyi gyɔɔ Ɔfɛlisi mbala oko wu Odurisila, uwu bɔkɔ akwu Azhu awu o gbama o bo mu Oseseriya. A lɔ la Ɔpɔlu kaa le bo le so wu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi. Uwu ba a ngbɛ alu mu iso iyi ikwu idu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ akwu usama nzu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e le mu iso isomo mekeka iyi ototo, i yi ɛnwu ma mbala ombu uwu bɔkɔ u bu nyɔ awu, akwɛyi Ɔfɛlisi a wiyi akwɛyi a za la Ɔpɔlu te, &lt;&lt;Ikpo kya tayi ŋa! Sheyimo iyi a ŋa. Kwuye ungwu mi yi igɔ ŋɔ, Mi lɔ la ŋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Ɔfɛlisi ba a ma kyamate Ɔpɔlu e shi wu eduwo wɛrɛrɛ, akwɛyi e koko a lɔ la Ɔpɔlu wɔwɔ a ba ɛza mbala wu.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Tabɔkɔ lɔri lopo lu pika ma, akwɛyi Osiza a lu Ɔfɛlisi ma mu ogomina akwɛyi e shi yi Ɔpɔshiyɔ Ofesitu. Ɔfɛlisi ba a gyi te Azhu lo pwa wu ma, akwɛyi a lafya la Ɔpɔlu mu ugu ungyi.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="ms">Ɔpɔlu E Lo Ewa Mbaa Ofesitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ofesitu uwu bɔkɔ akwu ogomina uwopo ŋale, e bo mu Oseseriya, akwɛyi mizhikembo iyi afyi ela a ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />mba wa to keyi umba ebwoshi mbala enzu umbakɔ umba Azhu o bo mu idu wu akwɛyi o to iso iyi Ɔpɔlu lɛɛbi o so wu. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />O kpa Ofesitu ɛshɛku, kaa le to ombu la sha mba, kaa lo to Ɔpɔlu ma lo so wo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, kwongwu o wo okwura te umba o kwu o gbo wu mu ɔgwuzɛ akwɛyi o ngbɛ wu ma mu . <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Ofesitu a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ɔpɔlu o ra wu mu Oseseriya, Imi mafyi mi sheyimo mɔmɔ afyi ɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />La lu ŋa enzumbakɔ yi umbafo kaa lo zɛ mbala mi. Gba e wo iyira akwɛyi o fu ombu uwamba mɔmɔ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ Ofesitu e wo afyi eranda naa afyi uwo mbala mba akwɛyi a ka mu Oseseriya. Tabɔkɔ eyi i lama akwɛyi Ofesitu a ka ŋɔma mu udaba uwu ombu izɔma akwɛyi a lɔma te lo bo la Ɔpɔlu mu idu wu. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e fye mo mu udaba uwu ombu izɔma akwɛyi Azhu umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o lowu kwukpo akwɛyi o mu o lo wu te e wo iyira gyɔɔ, umba ba o yi u uzɔgɔ uwu iso ɛnyi ukpukpɛnyi mo.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu e le mu ombu wu ifumo, a zɔ te: &lt;&lt;Imi mi wo kiya kikpikpɛnyi te ingyi bɔkɔ mi ngbo ɛrama iyi Azhu naa ɔtɛpu naa Osiza Ɔsu uwu Oroma ma mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Ofesitu ba a gyite Azhu lo mu ɔnyɛ mbala ombu izɔma wu, akwɛyi e yo Ɔpɔlu kwuyo te &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ nyama kaa mi so la iso ŋɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kaa rima mu idu mi ka gba opwu mu iso iyi bɔkɔ o so ma ŋa le lɛɛbi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Ɔpɔlu ba a gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ayi mo, kekelele Imi mi rima mu keyi ŋɔ mu udaba uwu Osiza mba bɔkɔ i fate lo zɔ ombu mi. Imi mi wo Azhu ira ikpikpɛnyi te mo, kyamate uŋɔ mafyi, ŋɔ yitu ŋɔ mamari tayi. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Gba mi wo kiya ingyira ingyi bɔkɔ ri do lukwu mo, Imi mi nyama te lo ngbɛ mi ma. Gba apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ Azhu o wa mu reshi mi le iyi tayi mo, onzu ukpukpɛnyi e yi munɛ uwu bɔkɔ e domo te e to mi e shi mbo mo. Imi mi re lo ombu mi mba Osiza ɔsu uwu Oroma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Mizhikembo iyi Ofesitu a ta amasa mbala wa to keyi umba udaba uwu ombu izɔma awu akwɛyi a za la Ɔpɔlu te, &lt;&lt; Uŋɔ ba ŋɔ lo ewa mba Osiza awu, ŋɔ re mba Osiza!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu Midu Iyi Agiripa Mbala Ɔbɛnasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Mizhikembo iyi afyi bwɛɛ ɔsu Agiripa mbala Ɔbɛnasi o bo mu Oseseriya kaa lo bwa Ofesitu ma. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Umba o to afyi gyɔɔ mbala Ofesitu akwɛyi Ofesitu a ba ɔsu Agiripa eza iyi Ɔpɔlu kaa la ta wu amasa. A za wu te: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo e yi munɛ uwu bɔkɔ Ofelisi a ta wu mu ugu ugyi akwɛyi a lu wu afyima mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />kwuye ungwu mi ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, u to keyi uwu ebwoshi mbala enzumbakɔ umba Azhu o bo lo ewa wu munyi mi meka iyira iyi bɔkɔ o zɔ te e wo akwɛyi o za mi te la mi to ombu la riwu kaa lo ngbɛ wu ma.<verse eid="ACT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />&lt;&lt;Imi ba mi za mba te gba o lo ewa iyi onzu, kinzu enzu umba Oroma ki to ombu ki riwu kɛlɛlɛ bi mo. Akwu mɛga kaa onzu uwu bɔkɔ o lo ewa wu awu kaa la rima mu keyi unga enzu umba bɔkɔ o lo ewa wu awu kaa le fu ombu uwawu dɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />kwuyengwu o bomo munɛ mbala mi, mi gyite iso ɛnyi li to kwuye gyɔɔ mo, akwɛyi eyi i lama mi ka mu udaba uwu ombu izɔma akwɛyi mi lɔma te lo fye la Ɔpɔlu ma mɛmi. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />kwuyengwu wa to keyi umba Azhu o fu ombu uwamba, mu ombu mba uwu bɔkɔ o fu le mi ma iyira iyi bɔkɔ mi fulo eyi te mi ma meka wu mo. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Kiya ingyi ki ta mba kambwu mbala Ɔpɔlu gba akwu mekeka iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu o mbwalu Ukpo mbala onzu uwufo uwu o ya wu te Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ e kpomo-o, Ɔpɔlu ba a zɔ te e degbo la reyi. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Imi ba mi yi ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ mi zɛ kaa mi zɔ ombu ɔnwu mo; gba mi yo Ɔpɔlu kwuyo te naa a nyama kaa le so mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kaa le fu ombu uwawu ŋa? <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a zɔ te e re la ombu wu mba Osiza ɔsu uwu Oroma, akwɛyi Mi zɔ te lo kwo wu mu igbomo nzhii ba kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ mi re wu mbaa Osiza ɔsu uwu Oroma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Akwɛyi Agiripa a za la Ofesitu te, &lt;&lt;Mi gyi te la mi pwa iso iyi onzu ele mafyi mi tete.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Ofesitu a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Kwɔnyi kwɔlɛ ŋɔ pwa wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Tabɔkɔ eyi i lama akwɛyi Agiripa mbala Ɔbɛnasi o kwu apula iyi abwa o lo mu ɛnwu akwɛyi o fe mo mu udaba uwu ombu izɔma awu mbala enzu gyɔɔ mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi atu iyɛku mbala wa to keyi umba kwuse kwɔngu. Akwɛyi Ofesitu a lɔma te lo fye la Ɔpɔlu ma mɛmi. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Ofesitu a zɔ te: &lt;&lt;Ɔsu Agiripa, mbala enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi munɛ mbala nzu, lu ma onzu ele! Azhu lɛɛbi o ka kwupwu mu reshi wu mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbala mu Oseseriya munɛ, o wo ovyo te ifate onzu ele le yi kwunyɔ fo. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Imi ba mi ma kiya kikpikpɛnyi te ingyi bɔkɔ e wo bɔkɔ ri do lukwu ma mo, uwu ba a zɔ te e re la ombu wu mba Osiza, inyi gba ishi mi lɔwu a ka mu Oromu le. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Imi ba mi yi kiya kikpikpɛnyi te ingyi bɔkɔ mi ka mu reshi wu kaa mi kala Osiza ɔsu uwu Oroma mo, kwongwu ɔlɛ gba mi bo wu mu keyi yi lɛɛbi mbala Bagayidu Ɔsu Agiripa, kaa yo wu eyo le, igboshimo la mi fya kiya ingyi mi ka mu reshi wu. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Mo, mu imama mi, akwu refyo te kaa mi lɔ la onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ugu ugyi la Osiza ɔsu uwu Oroma ba ikyo mbala kiya kpakara ingyi bɔkɔ mi ka mu reshi wu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu A Gbɛ Ɛnwu Ma Midu Iyi Agiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Akwɛyi Ɔsu Agiripa a za la Ɔpɔlu te, &lt;&lt;Kekelele mi shi ŋɔ kapa ka siso.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu eyefaa a gbɛlɛ ɔsu ɛnyi akwɛyi e le mu ombu wu ifumo. <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Bagayidu Ɔsu Agiripa, mi mu ɔnyɛ gyɔɔ te ɔnɛnɛ mi rima mu keyi ŋɔ kaa la mi gbɔ ɛnwu mi ma meka iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ Azhu o so lɛɛbi mu reshi mi. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Iyi bi shi mi mu ɔnyɛ ika gba akwu te ŋɔ yitu iyi ukwu uwu Azhu mbala apula iyi bɔkɔ umba o rilɔmbu ma yi. Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ mi kpa ŋa ɛshɛku, ka yidu ka pwa opwu uwa mi.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />&lt;&lt; Azhu lɛɛbi o yitu iyi iyimo mi ngba kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi umɛshɛri. O yitu iyi iyilareyi mi bi yi, iyo mu ɛzhi mi mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ munɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Gba umba o nyama te o so ongbulolo, umba o yi mi diridiri-e te mi kwu Ofarisi, uzhi uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu ɛrama iyi Omosisi mamari. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Mi rima munɛ ɔnɛnɛ kwongwu mi mbwalu iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi la asɔkwu nzu le. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Ɛlɛ gba lunzu uwola lopo undu asɔkwu nzu o fulo eyi te li nyɔlɔma le, tabɔkɔ o lɛ Ukpo utu la ɔnu. Bagayidu ɔsu, akwu kwongwu ɔlɛ gba Azhu o bo mi mu udaba ŋa le. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ lu nyama te Ukpo e do te e yi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo mo?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />&lt;&lt; Kwuye kwɔngu Imi mi ma mate ifate la mi so iso iyira mu reshi ingyi Ɔzhizɔsii uwu Ɔnazarɛti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Ɛlɛ gba Imi mi wo le mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. Eboshi umbakɔ o shi mi kapa, akwɛyi mi fu enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu Ukpo ele gyɔɔ mu ugu ugyi. kwuyengwu wa to keyi umba Azhu o shi kapa te lo ngbɛmba ma awu mi nyama mi kyo tete. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Mi koko mi fulama mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpala iyi Azhu akwɛyi mi yi mbo mi lo mbo inyashi, mi kpa mba mɛga kaa lo zɔ te umba ɔ mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi fo. Mi wo anya mba nzhii ba mi mbwalu mba mu ese-ese iyi bɔkɔ akwiyi Izirɛ mo kaa mi lo mbo inyashi.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu E So Iyi Bɔkɔ I Wo Bɔkɔ A Na Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(Iwomo Iyi Wa zɛ ilɔ 9.1-19; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Ɔnu uwufo mi sheye mu Ɔdamasikɔ kaa mi lo wa mbwalu inyashi. Watokeyi umba ebwoshi o shi mi ekpasu kaa la mi wo tayi. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Bagayidu ɔsu Agiripa, ta bɔkɔ mi yi mu ɔgwuzɛ mu ɔnɔnda akwɛyi ɛbɛ iyɛku i wɔ moshi i kpo mami, ɛbɛ ɛnyi iwuluma i ka ɔnu ma, akwɛyi i lo mi mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ ɔ zɛ mbala mi meka. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Kinzu lɛɛbi ki kpeyi mbwɛ mɛzhi akwɛyi mi pwa opwu uwu onzu uwufo u siso mbala mi mu kenzu unga Iburu u yo mi te, &lt;Ɔsɔlu Ɔsɔlu kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ ŋɔ lo mi inyashi te?&gt; Kanɛ ngɛlɛ ŋɔ nɛ ɛŋɔ mo akwu imi mo. A kwu erendo ka kiri ewa mbala mi, Ɔkwu ŋɔ.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi mi yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt; &lt; Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu uwe ngyɔɔ Ada?&gt; a gba mi opwu te, &lt;&lt; &lt; Imi mi kwu Ɔzhizɔsii, uwu ŋɔ ye wu mu inyashi ilomo awu.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Kekelele, yimo kaa rima! Imi mi wa ŋa meyi kaa mi za ŋa te wo mi ɛduma. Akwɛyi ŋɔ za la enzu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ ma lɛɛbi ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ ma, mbala iyifo iyi bɔkɔ mi bi zɔ ŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Mi wa ŋa ma mu ewo iyi ɛmɛnɛ ŋɔ Azhu mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo. Imi mi lɔ ŋɔ ma munyi mbo. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Mi lɔ ŋɔ kaa so ka wu mbo eyi mo kaa lo kwu ira ɔsu lo ma ɛbɛ, kaa lo lafya la onzu uwoyi imbwalu ma, ka lɔ mbwalu Ukpo, akwɛyi Ukpo a gba la ingbomo mbo a kpa mba, akwɛyi e shi mbo kizɛ mekeka iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwudifulo ma mi.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu E So Iso Mɛka Iyi Ɛduma Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, Bagayidu Ɔsu Agiripa, Imi mi mbwalu iso iyi bɔkɔ opwu uwu Ɔzhizɔsi u wɔ moshi u so mi te la mi wo. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Mi ye kambwu la anu itama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi la Azhu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Ɔdamasikɔ keyi, akwɛyi mi ta la umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya lɛɛbi. Mizhikembo ɛnyi mi za la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo tete, te lo kwu ira ɔsu kaa lo mbwalu Ukpo. Luzɛ mba la lu zɔ te umba o kwu ira ɔsu kego. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ gba Azhu o yi mi mo mu ɔtɛpu le akwɛyi o gyite lo ngbɛ mi ma. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ukpo ba a mbwa mi ma nzhii kwɔfyi ɔnɛ, bɔkɔ mi rima munɛ kaa la mi so uwewe ɛmɛshɛri mbala enzumbakɔ, iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi. Mi tanu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ anukenzu mbala Omosisi mafyi wu a zɔ te ri wo le kɛɛkyi, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />mi za mba te Okrasi ele, a ma inyashi akwɛyi e kpomo, uwu gba akwu onzu uwu kwonze uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ le, akwɛyi a nya la ɛbɛ la enzu wu, Azhu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e yi mu ombu wu ifumo, iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ uwu e wo mbala anu itama iyi ɔgwuzɛ ɔlɛ akwɛyi Ofesitu a kpa wu ɛyi te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ kporishi re! Ɔpɔlu, ɛzu iyi ŋɔ wa gyɔɔ le ngyɔɔ i ta ŋa rishi re?.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ɔpɔlu ba a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Mi kporishi mo, onzu uwakwuu Ofesitu, iso iyi mi yi mu isomo le akwu ongbulolo mbala iyesheshi. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Ɔsu Agiripa e yitu iyi apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi, kwongwu ɛlɛ mi so wu iso fɔɔ bi, Imi mi yitu te e yitu yi lɛɛbi, kwongwu apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi o wo yi mu ɛmba mo. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Ɔsu Agiripa, ŋɔ nyama te iso iyi anukenzu o so awu akwu ongbulolo? Mi yitu te ŋɔ nyama layi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Akwɛyi ɔsu Agiripa a za la Ɔpɔlu te, &lt;&lt;Mu kwuye kwukɛkyi kwɔlɛ ŋɔ ma mate ŋɔ fulo mi egbo mo kaa lami kwu u mbwalu Okrasi re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Ɔpɔlu a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;La kwuye kwukɛkyi la kwuye gbulɔlɔ, mi nda Ukpo te uŋɔ mbala enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi munɛ le, akwu wa mbwalu kyamate Imi mi kwu tayi. Tetete mi gyite lunyi lo loyi ɛyɛ kyamate bɔkɔ o lo mi ele mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Akwɛyi Ɔsu, ogwomina, Ɔbɛnasi mbala enzu lɛɛbi o yi mo <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Mizhikembo iyi o lafya la udaba awu, o ba eza mbala esu kwuye gyɔɔ akwɛyi o mbwa yi te, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele e ngbo ɛrama iyi Oroma ma mo, iyi bɔkɔ i do te lo ngbɛ wu ma, naa lo ta wu mu Ugugyi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Ɔsu Agiripa a za la Ofesitu te, &lt;&lt; Akwu kwuwongu onzu ele a ka la ombu wu mbaa u zɔ ombu, Ɔsu uwu Oroma Osiza-a le mo, ŋɔ bi lu wu afyima kaa le sheyimo iya wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="ms">Ɔpɔlu E Fye Mu Kwɔda Ungwu Embyi A Ka Mu Oromu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />kwuye ungwu o mbwa te ki re mu Itili, akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o fu mbo mu ugu ugyi kyaa o ra mba o shi u to keyi uwu asozha uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Ɔzhuliyɔ awu, uwu bɔkɔ akwu u to keyi uwu asozha oderi ukpɛnyi uwu uzhi uwu Ɔgɔsutu awu. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tabɔkɔ ki fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi mu Adiramitiyɔ ungwu kwu gyi te lakwu sama kwu so mɛzhi iyi Eshiya mba bɔkɔ o bɔ ada iyi embyi mɛzhi awu. Arisitaku,onzu uwu Omasedoniya uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ mu Otesalonika, e yi mbala nzu.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Mu eyilama, ki bo mu Ɔsayidɔ akwɛyi Ɔzhuliyɔ e wo Ɔpɔlu iyeshi akwɛyi a nya wu ma kaa le so mba ɛmɛza wu kaa lo sa wu igɔ wu ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Ki yimo mu Ɔsayidɔ mo kwokpo kwu gama mɔmɔ, ki fula nzhii ba ki bo mu kutashi ungwu Ɔsapurɔ kwongwu kwokpo ku yi mɔmɔ mo. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Tabɔkɔ ki sa risu ma, ki bo mu kuko ungwu Osilisiya mbala Opafiliya, akwɛyi ki kalama mu Omira mɛzhi iyi Olisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Mɔmɔ u to keyi uwu asozha, a ma kwoda ungwu Alɛkizanda ungwu kwu sheye mu Itili akwɛyi e lo nzu ma ngwu. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Ki to afyi gyɔɔ ki yi mu luzɛ zee, nzhii ba ki ka kɛlɛ mbala kwuse ungwu Osinidu. Tabɔkɔ kwokpo kwu nya nzu ma mo, akwɛyi ki zɛ ki ka mu kutashi ungwu Okiriti ungwu bɔkɔ kwu shi eyi mu kwuse ungwu Ɔsalimɔ umba bɔkɔ kwokpo kwu yi mo awu. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Ki gbo obirigo mu kwoda ipɛma ki zɛ mɛmba iyi risu nzhii ba ki bo mu kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ o ya ngyi te Kizɛ Ingyi isama, kɛlɛ mbala kwuse ungwu Olasiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Ki ngbɛ kwuye gyɔɔ mɔmɔ, kinzu ba ki pɛ kwoda ki ka keyi fo mo kwokpo kwu gama, kwɔfyi ungwu Odumudumu uwu Ingbomo igbɔma ba kwu pikama a, akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu e lo mbo ilutu malu, a za mba te, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />&lt;&lt;Ɛmɛza mi, mi mate ki fye kumbɛ ungwɔkwu mu luzɛ ndɔlɛ gba ki bɔkushi te ki shekeyi. Ɛlɛ i nya la itomo iyi kwoda mbala ewulo mbala kwunyɔ nzu tete. <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />U to keyi uwu asozha awu ba a pwa iso iyi Ɔpɔlu mo, a mbwalu iso iyi u pɛ kwoda mbala ɔkwu uwu kwoda o so le. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kwuwongu riyi ngyɛngyi ri shoshi ka kwoda la ku rima mɔmɔ kwuye ngwu kwokpo mo akwɛyi enzu gyɔ ɔ nyama te la ki sheyimo bi, o shi egbo te umba o re mu Ofenisi ka lo rima mɔmɔ nzhii ba kwuyengwu kwokpo kwu bo mo. Ofenisi akwu riyi ingyi bɔkɔ ada iyi embyi i ri mu kwuse ungwu Okiriti ungwu bɔkɔ kwu shi eyi mu okanga uwu ononoyo mbala ɔnu uwukwoto.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obirikizhi E Yimo Mu Risu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Kwuye ngwu kwokpo ungwu kwu wɔ mu ononoyo kwu kwomu itumo bɛtɛbɛtɛ, umba o ma te kiya ingyi bɔkɔ umba o gyi le, o fya ngyi ma-a, akwɛyi o to otumutu uwu kwoda ma akwɛyi o zɛ mu kwuko ungwu Okiriti. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />I to kwuye gyɔɔ mo akwɛyi obirikizhi uwu o ya wu te &lt;&lt;kwokpo ungwu ononoyo,&gt;&gt; kwu yimo mu kwotashi kwɔngu. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Obirikizhi awu a kwoda nyi mba izɛma mba bɔkɔ umba o gyite lo zɛ, kwuwo kwɔngu ki shi ɔgwuzɛ akwɛyi ki mbwalu obirikizhi awu. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Tabɔkɔ kwoda kwu pika kutashi ungwɛri ungwu o ya ngwu te Okawuda awu ma, ki ma inyashi gyɔɔ dɛ gba ki bi rala kwoda ungwɛri ma le. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Mizhikembo iyi o pyipyi u kwoda ungwɛri o lo mɛmi iyi kwoda ungwɔkwu kwɔngu, akwɛyi o ma ngwu ma mu kwukiki o sa mu kwoda ungwɔku. Kwuwongu o ri iyi iyi ɔgyɛ uwu Olibiya, akwɛyi o lafya la kwoda kaa kwokpo kwu sheye ngwu mo. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Obirikizhi uwakwu awu a lafya mo nzhii ba eyi ilama akwɛyi o le mu ewulo ikwuma o fumo mu embyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Ɔnu kwɔfyi ungwɔla o kwo mu apula iyi kwoda iwɔma ma mafyi mba o fu mu embyi . <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Tabɔkɔ i to afyi gyɔɔ ki ma ɔnu mo ba ki ma elovyo mo obirikizhi ba a kyakpɔ mu itumo, akwɛyi ki wala egbo mo te ki yi kwunyɔ.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Mizhikembo iyi enzu mbamba o to afyi gyɔɔ o ri kiya mo, akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu e yimo a rima mu keyi mbo akwɛyi a za mba te: &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛza mi, gba la lu pwa iyami, ki bi yimo mu kutashi ungwu Okiriti mo; itutumo mbala ishi ɛlɛ i bi du nzu mo. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Kekelele, mi so yi te la lu shi egbo yi mɛzhi, mo onzu ukpukpɛnyi te e tomo mo, kwoda kɛɛkyi gba kwu kpo ɛdɔ ma le. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ akwu ɔkwu mi, uwu mi gbo wu ɔya e bo munyi mi mule mutu, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />akwɛyi a za mi te, &lt; Ɔpɔlu, Ki riyi mo, mo mɛga ŋɔ rima mu keyi unga Osiza, Ɔsu uwu Oroma kaa fulo ata iya ŋa; kwuwo ŋɔ, Ukpo a ma inyashi iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala ŋa awu lɛɛbi o kpɛdɔ ma mo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Kwuwongu ɔlɛ la lu shi egbo yi mɛzhi, ɛmɛza mi, mo mi kwidu mi fulo mu Ukpo te iyi bɔkɔ e so awu e wo yi tayi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Tetete mɛga kwokpo kwɔngu kwu re nzu mu kutashi ungufo dɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Mutu uwu uwo la uwondo, kwokpo kwu za nzu kwu ka mu risu ingyi Omeditariya, akwɛyi mutu uweka, wa pɛ kwoda o ma te o nda la ikala fo. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />O mondo indomo iyi embyi mo, akwɛyi o fya ata oderi la uwo ekpepo. O turu o gba keyi bwɛɛ akwɛyi o gba la i mondo mo kpɔ akwɛyi o fya ata uwo ekperendo. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Wa pɛ kwoda o wo iyi i yi kwodakwu bu la mu ekyi, kwuwo kwɔngu, o kwu etumutu endo o za yi mu undu uwu kwoda o fu mu embyi, akwɛyi o lɛ Ukpo tee eyi li la mba ma moloto. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Wa pɛ kwoda ba o gyi te lo renya lo shi kwoda, akwɛyi o vuvu kwoda ungwɛri ma o ta mu embyi, o wo kuwoyo kyamate umba o ŋɔ o ma kwoda ungwɔku ma mu etumutu mu embyi tayi. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a za la asozha mbala u to keyi mba te, &lt;&lt;Gba wa pɛ kwoda mbɔlɛ o ŋɔma mu kwoda mbala nzu mo, de ba ki fulo eyi iyi isama moloto mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Akwɛyi asozha o kpolo ekyikyi iyi bɔkɔ i rala kwoda ungwɛri kwɔngu ma o lu ngwu afyima, embyi o ka ngu ma.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Mu eyi ifumo, Ɔpɔlu a za mba te lo ri kiya. &lt;&lt;Mo ɔnɛnɛ akwu kwɔfyi ungu uwo la endo, bɔkɔ lu yi mu eyi ifulomo ba lu du ri kiya mo. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />kwuwo ngwɔlɛ mi kpayi ɛshɛku te la lu ri kiya kaa la lu fya ekpasu ma, mo kiya kinyinyi te ki wo onzu ukpukpɛnyi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔpɔlu e so ɛlɛ, akwɛyi e to kwoburedi akwɛyi a gbɛlɛ ɛnyi la Ukpo mu keyi mbo lɛɛbi. A mu ngwu ma akwɛyi e shimbo o le mu irimo. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Umba lɛɛbi ɛnwu ika mba ma akwɛyi o ri kiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Lɛɛbi nzu umba bɔkɔ ki yi mu kwoda le, ki yi enzu ederi epo la uwekperewo la ɛrɛnyi (276). <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Tabɔkɔ lɛɛbi mba o mbwa kiya irimo, umbwu e do mbo mo, akwɛyi o kwu ewolo iyi ewiri o fu yi mo mu embyi kaa kwoda lakwu gyi ɔlu ma.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obirikizhi A Gbɛ Kwoda Kwɔngu Ɛdɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Tabɔkɔ eyi ilama, wapɛ kwoda o zɔngɔma ɛzhi ɛnyi ma mo, umba ba o ma ɔgyɛ e shi kwudu mu kuko ungufo, akwɛyi o ka amasa te, gba i wombo mo, umba o re la kwoda mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />O kpolo erimoki iyi etumutu mo, akwɛyi o lu yi afyima mu risu, mu kwuye kwɔngu pwa, o vuvu erimoki iyi bɔkɔ i rala kwɔsɔ le mo. O sele kwoda mba kwokpo kwu sheyimo akwɛyi kwu ka, kwu rima mu ɔgyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Kwoda ba kwu la mu ɔgyɛ akwɛyi kwu ka mɛzhi. Keyi unga kwoda ke lomo mɔmɔ akwɛyi kwoda kwu rima. Agba iyi embyi iyɛkuu i fya mu kwoda kwɔngu akwɛyi izhikembo iyi kwoda i shɛkɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Asozha ba o gyi te lo ngbɛ enzu umba ugu ugyi umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kwoda kwɔngu ma kwuwongu o bo to embyi lo wɔ ma ka lo rima mo. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />U to keyi uwu asozha mbamba ba a gyi te la wala Ɔpɔlu ma la reyi akwɛyi a anya ma te asozha mbamba lo ngbɛ enzu umba ugu ugyi ma mo. Uwu ba a za la enzu umba bɔkɔ o to embyi ego te lo ta membyi keyi ka lo to embyi lo wɔma. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Enzu mba bɔkɔ o shimo awu ba a za mba te lo yi ewo mu abɛ mbala asa iyi kwoda ka lo sama lo so mu kwudu. Mi womo ɛlɛ, onzonzu a wɔma moloto.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="ms">Ɔpɔlu A Ka Mu Omalita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Tabɔkɔ ki la mɛzhi moloto, akwɛyi ki dama te kutashi kwɔngu o ya ngwu te Omalita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Enzu umba kwutashi kwɔngu o na nzu ewepo. Kwuye kwɔngu Ukpo e yi mu itumo, kizɛ ba ki tumo akwɛyi o kpala nzu ɔyi kaa la ki vye. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Ɔpɔlu a kpala aka iyi ɛwɛyi ɛlu akwɛyi tabɔkɔ a gyi te le fu yi mɔyi, uzu uwɔyi u ra laa ogbazhi ma akwɛyi a la wu ɛnyi akwɛyi a tɛ wu mu kwuwo. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Tabɔkɔ enzu umba kwutashi kwɔngu o ma ogbazhi te a tɛ Ɔpɔlu mu kwuwo, akwɛyi o za la esu te, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu u ngbɛ enzu, moo Ukpo a wa wu ma mu embyi mu risu, tetete ira wu i de gbo i ye wu mu imbwaluma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ɔpɔlu ba a vu kwuwo wu fuu akwɛyi ogbazhi awu a luma a ta mu ɔyi, uwu ba e wo Ɔpɔlu ira mo. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Enzu mbamba o fulo eyi te Ɔpɔlu a nyɛma naa a ta gbuu mɛzhi e kpomo, o rima ngbɛɛ ba o ma kiya kinyinyi te ki wo wu mo, akwɛyi o fulo egbo wa akwɛyi o zɔ te onzu ele akwu ukpo.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Onzu uwufo o ya wu te Ɔpubilɔ u to keyi uwu kutashi kwɔngu e yi agba kɛlɛ mɔmɔ. Onzu ele a na nzu ewepo, ki ŋɔ mogba wu nzhii ba afyi ela. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Ete wu Ɔpubilɔ a nɔma mɛzhi iyi ofya umbu emi ifumo mbala okpakyi. Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a ka te la ma wu, mizhikembo iyi Ɔpɔlu a lɛ Ukpo, e fulo wu ewo akwɛyi ofya wu u bomo. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Tabɔkɔ ɛlɛ i wo akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu efya ipwuma mu kutashi kwɔngu o bo akwɛyi o bo mbo efya ma. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />O mu o kpo nzu gyɔɔ, akwɛyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki yi ɛnwu ma iyi ifulomo mu kwoda ungwu embyi, o kwu apula gyɔɔ i ki yi ugɔ yi mu luzɛ ndɔlɛ o shi nzu.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Lafya Laa Omalita A Ka Mu Oromu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Mizhikembo iyi evya ela, ki fye mu kwoda ungwu bɔkɔ kwu to ɔnɛka ngyɔɔ kwu rima mu kutashi ungwu Omalita, kwu wɔ mu Alɛkizanda o ka ngwu ɛzu te ukpo apiri umba bɔkɔ o ya mba te Ɔkasitɔ mbala Opolusi awu. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Ki bo mu Osiraku akwɛyi ki ŋɔ mɔmɔ afyi ela. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Ki wɔ mɔmɔ ki zɛ mu kwoda ungwu embyi ki bo mu Oregiyumu. Eyi i lama kwokpo ungwu ononoyo kwu yi mo, tabɔkɔ eyi i lama, ki fye mu Oputeyo. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ki du wa mbwalu umbafo mɔmɔ akwɛyi o za nzu te la ki wo orondo mbala mba, akwɛyi ki ka mu Oromu. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Wambwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Oromu, o pwa te ki yi mu inyɔma akwɛyi o lɔ enzu te lo kpolo nzu mu kwuse ungwu o ya ngwu te rishi ingyi Apiyɔsi mbala kizɛ ingyi ɛnwu igbomo ingyi bɔkɔ o ya ngyi te igwu ela iyi ɛnwu igbomo awu. Tabɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a ma mba, ɛnwu i ka wu ma akwɛyi a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Ta Anu Mu Oromu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Tabɔkɔ ki fye mu Oromu, o lafya la Ɔpɔlu te la ŋɔ iya wu mbala osozha ukpɛnyi kaa le gbo wu mo.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Mizhikembo iyi afyi ela, Ɔpɔlu a ya enzumbakɔ umba Azhu ma, kwuye ungwu o kpala ɛlu akwɛyi a za mba te: &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛnɛ mi, imi mi wo kiya ingyira mo naa mi towo ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ asɔkwu nzu o zɔ nzu ma mo, umba asɔkwu nzu ba o yi mi mo, akwɛyi o ka mya mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o ka mya mu Oroma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Enzu umba Oroma o yo mi eyo akwɛyi o gyi te lo lu mi afyima, mo o ma ombu uwu ira bɔkɔ mi wo bɔkɔ i do te lɔ ngbɛ mi ma mo. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Azhu ba o nyama mo, kwuwo kwɔngu akwa mi mɛga ka la mi bo la ombu midu iyi Osiza, moo akwu te mi yi ewa mbala enzu mi le mo. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba mi gyi te la mi ma yi kaa la mi siso mbala yi le. O lo mi ɛyɛ kwongwu usama uwu bɔkɔ enzu nzu, Izirɛ o yi mu eyi ifulomo ma wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Enzu wu, Azhu, o gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ki di na kwupwu mba Ozhudiya mu reshi ŋɔ mo bɛnɛ; ɛmɛnɛ umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mɔmɔ le ba o bo lo ewa ŋa mo ba o so iso iyira ŋa mo. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Kinzu ba ki gyi te la ki pwa egbo iya ŋa, mo ki yitu te enzu munamuna o yi mu iso iyira isomo iyi uzhi ɔlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Akwɛyi wa to keyi umba Azhu o nyama te lo kpolo esu mbala Ɔpɔlu mu kwɔfyi kwowa, akwɛyi umba gyɔɔ o bo mbaa bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e yi awu. Ɔpɔlu e so mbo iso iyi irɛsu iyi Ukpo i na mu kwoto nzhii ba mu onoyo akwɛyi a gyite la na mba egbo mo mu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi laa ɛzu iwama iyi ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala kwokpo ungwu bɔkɔ anukenzu o ka. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Enzumbako umbafo o nyama mu iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e so, umbafo ba o nyama mo. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />I ta mba kambwu akwɛyi o le mu i fulomo mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a mbwa opwu te: &lt;&lt;Kwundu uwu Ukpo e so ongbulolo umba asɔkwu yi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ e so mu kenzu unga anukenzu Azaya te:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />&lt;&lt; &lt;So mba enzu mbɔlɛ ka za mba te, &lt;&lt;Lu koko lu pwa ngbɛɛ, ba</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:26">lu zɔngɔma yi ma mo; lu koko li yese mo ngbɛɛ, ba lu ma mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Moo egbo iyi enzu mbɔlɛ i kɔma,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:27">o se alu mba ma ka lo pwama mo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:27">O kpala eyi mbo mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:27">O wo ɛlɛ kaa lɔ ma ongbulolo mo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:27">ba lɔ pwa iso wu mo, Kwuwongwu o zɔngɔma yi ma mu egbo mbo ba o ta mɛzhi, akwɛyi Mii na mba.<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a mbwa yi te: &lt;&lt;Mi gyi te la lu yitu te Ukpo a lɔ iso iyi isama la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, umba o ngbɛ alu akwɛyi o na yi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e so ɛlɛ, akwɛyi Azhu o kama iyamba, la kambwu irimo mbala esu. <verse eid="ACT 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Lɔri lopo ngyɔɔ Ɔpɔlu a ŋɔ mu ugu uwu bɔkɔ a na le akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o bo munyi wu lɛɛbi a na mba la ɔnyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Kwuye kwɔngu a tanu iyi irɛsu iyi Ukpo gedegede mbala ɛzu izɔma meka iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi ba o yi wu mo mo.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>